readlicense_oo	docs\readme\readme.xrm	0	readmeitem	gettinginvolved2	gettinginvolved2			0	hi	${PRODUCTNAME} समुदाय को आपके सक्रिय भागीदारी से इस महत्वपूर्ण खुला स्रोत परियोजना के विकास में बहुत ज्यादा लाभ होगा।				20200411 15:09:53
readlicense_oo	docs\readme\readme.xrm	0	readmeitem	gettingimvolved3	gettingimvolved3			0	hi	As a user, you are already a valuable part of the suite's development process and we would like to encourage you to take an even more active role with a view to being a long-term contributor to the community. Please join and check out the user page at <a href="https://openoffice.apache.org/get-involved.html">https://openoffice.apache.org/get-involved.html</a>				20200411 15:09:53
