helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0214.xhp	0	help	par_id3150276				0	hi	Depending on whether you have created the query or view in the \<emph\>Design\</emph\> or \<emph\>SQL\</emph\> tab page, the following icons appear:				20200411 15:09:53
