helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154685	2			0	hi	\<variable id=\"chart\"\>$[officename] lets you present data graphically in a chart, so that you can visually compare data series and view trends in the data. You can insert charts into spreadsheets, text documents, drawings, and presentations. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
