helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id3153414	2			0	hi	स्थिति पट्टी में मौजूदा दस्तावेज़ के बारे में जानकारियाँ होती हैं तथा विशिष्ट क्रियाओं हेतु बहुत से बटन होते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	hd_id9648731				0	hi	Language				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id8193914				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays the language for the selected text. \<br/\>Click to open a menu where you can choose another language for the selected text or for the current paragraph. \<br/\>Choose None to exclude the text from spellchecking and hyphenation. \<br/\>Choose Reset to Default Language to re-apply the default language for the selection or the paragraph. \<br/\>Choose More to open a dialog with more options.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	hd_id0821200911015962				0	hi	Digital Signature				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id0821200911015941				0	hi	See also \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/digital_signatures.xhp\"\>Digital Signatures\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	hd_id8070314				0	hi	Zoom & View Layout				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id7723929				0	hi	Three controls on the Writer Status Bar allow to change the zoom and view layout of your text documents. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id3666188				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The View Layout icons show from left to right: Single column mode. View mode with pages side by side. Book mode with two pages as in an open book.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id8796349				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Drag the Zoom slider to the left to show more pages, drag to the right to zoom into a page and show a smaller area of the page.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	$[officename] Writer Features				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154243				0	hi	\<variable id=\"main0503\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/main0503.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] Writer Features\"\>$[officename] Writer Features\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3154263				0	hi	$[officename] Writer lets you design and produce text documents that can include graphics, tables, or charts. You can then save the documents in a variety of formats, including the standardized OpenDocument format (ODF), Microsoft Word .doc format, or HTML. And you can easily export your document to the Portable Document Format (PDF).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147755				0	hi	लेखन				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3147768				0	hi	$[officename] Writer lets you create both basic documents, such as memos, \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/fax.xhp\" name=\"faxes\"\>faxes\</link\>, letters, resumes and \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/01150000.xhp\" name=\"merge documents\"\>merge documents\</link\>, as well as long and complex or multi-part documents, complete with bibliographies, reference tables and indexes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3147797				0	hi	$[officename] Writer also includes such useful features as a \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06010000.xhp\" name=\"spellchecker\"\>spellchecker\</link\>, a \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/using_thesaurus.xhp\" name=\"thesaurus\"\>thesaurus\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040000.xhp\" name=\"AutoCorrect\"\>AutoCorrect\</link\>, and \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/06030000.xhp\" name=\"Hyphenation\"\>hyphenation\</link\> as well as a variety of \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01010100.xhp\" name=\"templates\"\>templates\</link\> for almost every purpose. You can also create your own templates using the wizards.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147225				0	hi	डिज़ाइन बनाना तथा स्ट्रक्चर बनाना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3147239				0	hi	$[officename] offers a wide variety of options to design documents. Use the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05140000.xhp\" name=\"Styles\"\>Styles and Formatting window\</link\> to create, assign and modify styles for paragraphs, individual characters, frames and pages. In addition, the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>Navigator\</link\> helps you to quickly move around inside your documents, lets you look at your document in an outline view, and keeps track of the objects that you have inserted into your document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3147272				0	hi	You can also create various \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120000.xhp\" name=\"indexes and tables\"\>indexes and tables\</link\> in text documents. You can define the structure and appearance of the indexes and tables according to your individual needs. Live hyperlinks and bookmarks let you jump directly to the corresponding items in the text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145596				0	hi	 $[officename] राइटर के साथ डेस्कटॉप प्रकाशन कार्य				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3145610				0	hi	$[officename] Writer contains numerous desktop publishing and drawing tools to assist you in creating professionally styled documents, such as brochures, newsletters and invitations. You can format your documents with multi-column layouts, \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/text_frame.xhp\" name=\"text frames\"\>text frames\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/insert_graphic.xhp\" name=\"graphics\"\>graphics\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/table_insert.xhp\" name=\"tables\"\>tables\</link\>, and other objects.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145649				0	hi	गणनाएँ				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3145663				0	hi	Text documents in $[officename] have an integrated \<link href=\"text/swriter/main0214.xhp\" name=\"calculation function\"\>calculation function\</link\> that helps you execute sophisticated calculations or logical links. You can easily create a table in a text document in order to perform calculations.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151192				0	hi	ड्राइंग तैयार करना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3151206				0	hi	The $[officename] Writer \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01140000.xhp\" name=\"drawing tool\"\>drawing tool\</link\> lets you create drawings, graphics, legends, and other types of drawings directly in text documents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151229				0	hi	ग्राफ़िक्स प्रविष्ट करना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3151243				0	hi	You can insert pictures with \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000020.xhp\" name=\"different formats\"\>different formats\</link\> into a text document, including graphics with a JPG or GIF format. In addition, the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/gallery.xhp\" name=\"Gallery\"\>Gallery\</link\> provides a collection of clipart graphics, and the \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/fontwork.xhp\"\>Fontwork Gallery\</link\> creates stunning font effects.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155084				0	hi	लचीला अनुप्रयोग इंटरफ़ेस				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3155098				0	hi	The program interface is designed so that you can configure it according to your preferences, including customizing icons and menus. You can position various program windows, such as the Styles and Formatting window or the Navigator as floating windows anywhere on the screen. You can also \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/autohide.xhp\" name=\"dock\"\>dock\</link\> some windows to the edge of the workspace.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155123				0	hi	खींचें व छोड़ें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3155137				0	hi	The \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/dragdrop.xhp\" name=\"drag-and-drop\"\>drag-and-drop\</link\> feature enables you to work quickly and efficiently with text documents in $[officename]. For example, you can drag-and-drop objects, such as graphics from the Gallery, from one location to another in the same document, or between open $[officename] documents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155162				0	hi	मदद क्रियाएँ				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3145675				0	hi	You can use the \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000110.xhp\" name=\"Help system\"\>Help system\</link\> as a complete reference for $[officename] applications, including \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/main.xhp\" name=\"instructions\"\>instructions\</link\> for simple and complex tasks.				20200411 15:09:53
