helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153708				0	hi	यह वह स्थल है जहाँ आप मॅक्रोज़ तथा $[officename] बेसिक के साथ कार्य करने के बारे में सामान्य जानकारियाँ पाएँगे.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	CreateUnoListener फंक्शन [रनटाइम]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155150				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>CreateUnoListener function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155150				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03132000.xhp\" name=\"CreateUnoListener Function [Runtime]\"\>CreateUnoListener Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346				0	hi	लिसनर इंस्टैंस तैयार करता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153681				0	hi	Many Uno interfaces let you register listeners on a special listener interface. This allows you to listen for specific events and call up the appropriate listener method. The CreateUnoListener function waits for the called listener interface and then passes the interface an object that the interface supports. This object is then passed to the method to register the listener.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148685				0	hi	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143228				0	hi	oListener = CreateUnoListener( Prefixname, ListenerInterfaceName )				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147574				0	hi	Example:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154046				0	hi	निम्न उदाहरण बेसिक लाइब्रेरी वस्तु पर आधारित है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155136				0	hi	Dim oListener				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148944				0	hi	oListener = CreateUnoListener( "ContListener_","com.sun.star.container.XContainerListener" )				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149294				0	hi	The CreateUnoListener method requires two parameters. The first is a prefix and is explained in detail below. The second parameter is the fully qualified name of the Listener interface that you want to use.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	hi	The Listener must then be added to the Broadcaster Object. This is done by calling the appropriate method for adding a Listener. These methods always follow the pattern "addFooListener", where "Foo" is the Listener Interface Type, without the 'X'. In this example, the addContainerListener method is called to register the XContainerListener:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154164				0	hi	Dim oLib				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154940				0	hi	oLib = BasicLibraries.Library1 ' Library1 must exist!				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150359				0	hi	oLib.addContainerListener( oListener ) ' Register the listener				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154138				0	hi	The Listener is now registered. When an event occurs, the corresponding Listener calls the appropriate method from the com.sun.star.container.XContainerListener Interface.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148922				0	hi	The prefix calls registered Listeners from Basic-subroutines. The Basic run-time system searches for Basic-subroutines or functions that have the name "PrefixListenerMethode" and calls them when found. Otherwise, a run-time error occurs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150768				0	hi	इस उदाहरण में लिसनर-इंटरफ़ेस निम्नलिखित विधियाँ इस्तेमाल करता है:				20200411 15:09:53
