helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150592				0	hi	An event structure type that contains information about an event exists for every Listener type. When a Listener method is called, an instance of this event is passed to the method as a parameter. Basic Listener methods can also call these event objects, so long as the appropriate parameter is passed in the Sub declaration. For example:				20200411 15:09:53
