helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149514				0	hi	CBool (Expression1 {= | <> | < | > | <= | >=} Expression2) or CBool (Number)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156152				0	hi	वापसी मूल्य:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155419				0	hi	Bool				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147530				0	hi	Parameters:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156344				0	hi	\<emph\>Expression1, Expression2:\</emph\> Any string or numeric expressions that you want to compare. If the expressions match, the \<emph\>CBool\</emph\> function returns \<emph\>True\</emph\>, otherwise \<emph\>False\</emph\> is returned.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149655				0	hi	\<emph\>Number:\</emph\> Any numeric expression that you want to convert. If the expression equals 0, \<emph\>False\</emph\> is returned, otherwise \<emph\>True\</emph\> is returned.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145171				0	hi	The following example uses the \<emph\>CBool\</emph\> function to evaluate the value that is returned by the \<emph\>Instr\</emph\> function. The function checks if the word "and" is found in the sentence that was entered by the user.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156212				0	hi	Example:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147288				0	hi	Sub ExampleCBool				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768				0	hi	Dim stext As String				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155132				0	hi	sText = InputBox("Please enter a short sentence:")				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155855				0	hi	REM Proof if the word »and« appears in the sentence.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146984				0	hi	REM Instead of the command line				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148576				0	hi	REM If Instr(Input, "and")<>0 Then...				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154014				0	hi	REM  CBool फ़ंक्शन निम्नानुसार लागू किया जाता है:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155413				0	hi	If CBool(Instr(sText, "and")) Then				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152940				0	hi	MsgBox "The word »and« appears in the sentence you entered!"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153954				0	hi	EndIf				20200411 15:09:53
