helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149205				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03090202.xhp\" name=\"For...Next Statement [Runtime]\"\>For...Next Statement [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
