helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148932				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03010201.xhp\" name=\"InputBox Function [Runtime]\"\>InputBox Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3151262				0	hi	Displays a prompt in a dialog at which the user can input text. The input is assigned to a variable.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3151100				0	hi	The \<emph\>InputBox\</emph\> statement is a convenient method of entering text through a dialog. Confirm the input by clicking OK or pressing Return. The input is returned as the function return value. If you close the dialog with Cancel, \<emph\>InputBox\</emph\> returns a zero-length string ("").				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152347				0	hi	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3159201	5			0	hi	InputBox (Msg As String[, Title As String[, Default As String[, x_pos As Integer, y_pos As Integer]]]]) 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150713				0	hi	वापसी मूल्य:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145090				0	hi	वाक्यांश				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149346				0	hi	Parameter:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153311	9			0	hi	\<emph\>Msg\</emph\>: String expression displayed as the message in the dialog box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145315	10			0	hi	\<emph\>Title\</emph\>: String expression displayed in the title bar of the dialog box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154307	11			0	hi	\<emph\>Default\</emph\>: String expression displayed in the text box as default if no other input is given.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147573	12			0	hi	\<emph\>x_pos\</emph\>: Integer expression that specifies the horizontal position of the dialog. The position is an absolute coordinate and does not refer to the window of the office application.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3156024	13			0	hi	\<emph\>y_pos\</emph\>: Integer expression that specifies the vertical position of the dialog. The position is an absolute coordinate and does not refer to the window of the office application.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153897				0	hi	If \<emph\>x_pos\</emph\> and \<emph\>y_pos\</emph\> are omitted, the dialog is centered on the screen. The position is specified in \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/00000002.xhp#twips\" name=\"twips\"\>twips\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
