helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080101.xhp	0	help	par_id3125864				0	hi	radiant=(grad*pi)/180				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080101.xhp	0	help	par_id3159252				0	hi	Pi is here the fixed circle constant with the rounded value 3.14159.				20200411 15:09:53
