helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090403.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153360				0	hi	Parameters:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090403.xhp	0	help	par_id3154140				0	hi	\<emph\>Name:\</emph\> A different name than defined in the DLL, to call the subroutine from $[officename] Basic.				20200411 15:09:53
