helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090405.xhp	0	help	par_id3147559				0	hi	Releases DLLs that were loaded by a Declare statement. A released DLL is automatically reloaded if one of its functions is called. See also: \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03090403.xhp\" name=\"Declare\"\>Declare\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
