helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156283				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_BASICIDE_WATCHWINDOW_LIST\"\>Displays the list of watched variables. Click twice with a short pause in between on an entry to edit its value.\</ahelp\> The new value will be taken as the variable's value for the program.				20200411 15:09:53
