helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151384				0	hi	Returns the ASCII (American Standard Code for Information Interchange) value of the first character in a string expression.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155555				0	hi	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
