helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155909				0	hi	Select whether you want to remove a global assignment or an assignment that is just valid in the current document by selecting the option in the \<emph\>Save In\</emph\> listbox.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159129				0	hi	Select the event that contains the assignment to be removed from the \<emph\>Event\</emph\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
