helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154346				0	hi	$[officename] बेसिक में वेरिएबल के आधारभूत उपयोग निम्नानुसार वर्णित हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153361				0	hi	वेरिएबल आइडेंटिफ़ायर्स के लिए नामकरण प्रथा				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148797				0	hi	A variable name can consist of a maximum of 255 characters. The first character of a variable name \<emph\>must\</emph\> be a letter A-Z or a-z. Numbers can also be used in a variable name, but punctuation symbols and special characters are not permitted, with exception of the underscore character ("_"). In $[officename] Basic variable identifiers are not case-sensitive. Variable names may contain spaces but must be enclosed in square brackets if they do.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	hi	वेरिएबल आइडेंटिफ़ायर के उदाहरण:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3163798				0	hi	MyNumber=5				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156441				0	hi	Correct				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147317				0	hi	MyNumber5=15				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149664				0	hi	Correct				20200411 15:09:53
