helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3143271				0	hi	Declares a variable or an array.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154686				0	hi	If the variables are separated by commas (for example, DIM sPar1, sPar2, sPar3 AS STRING), only Variant variables can be defined. Use a separate definition line for each variable.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	hi	DIM sPar1 AS STRING				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159252				0	hi	DIM sPar2 AS STRING				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153142				0	hi	DIM sPar3 AS STRING				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152576				0	hi	Dim declares local variables within subroutines. Global variables are declared with the PUBLIC or the PRIVATE statement.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156443				0	hi	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149412				0	hi	Public VarName[(start To end)] [As VarType][, VarName2[(start To end)] [As VarType][,...]]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147397				0	hi	Parameters:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154730				0	hi	\<emph\>VarName:\</emph\> Any variable or array name.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147125				0	hi	\<emph\>Start, End:\</emph\> Numerical values or constants that define the number of elements (NumberElements=(end-start)+1) and the index range.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153877				0	hi	Start and End can be numerical expressions if ReDim is applied at the procedure level.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153510				0	hi	\<emph\>VarType:\</emph\> Key word that declares the data type of a variable.				20200411 15:09:53
