helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020407.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153361				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03020407.xhp\" name=\"FileDateTime Function [Runtime]\"\>FileDateTime Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020407.xhp	0	help	par_id3156423				0	hi	Returns a string that contains the date and the time that a file was created or last modified.				20200411 15:09:53
