helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020407.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150448				0	hi	Parameters:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020407.xhp	0	help	par_id3159153				0	hi	\<emph\>Text:\</emph\> Any string expression that contains an unambiguous (no wildcards) file specification. You can also use \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/00000002.xhp\" name=\"URL notation\"\>URL notation\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020407.xhp	0	help	par_id3155306				0	hi	This function determines the exact time of creation or last modification of a file, returned in the format "MM.DD.YYYY HH.MM.SS".				20200411 15:09:53
