helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\insert_control.xhp	0	help	par_id3146797	2			0	hi	Use the tools on the \<emph\>Toolbox \</emph\>of the BASIC dialog editor to add controls to your dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\insert_control.xhp	0	help	par_id3150276				0	hi	To open the \<emph\>Toolbox\</emph\>, click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Insert Controls\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Macro\</emph\> toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\insert_control.xhp	0	help	par_id3145068				0	hi	Click a tool on the toolbar, for example, \<emph\>Button\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
