helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\symbolshapes.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056A				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the Symbol Shapes toolbar from which you can insert graphics into your document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
