helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170902.xhp	0	help	par_id3145136				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_EDIT_RID_PAGE_LCW_CONTENTSELECTION_FIELD_ET_DISPLAYEDFIELD\"\>Specifies the field whose data are to be shown in the combo or list boxes.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170902.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	hi	The field name given here appears in the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170102.xhp\" name=\"Control properties\"\>Control properties\</link\> as an element of an SQL statement in the \<emph\>List Contents\</emph\> field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	Fields				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149991				0	hi	Fields				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149987				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>database contents; inserting as fields\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149987	8			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_RADIOBUTTON_DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL_RB_AS_FIELD\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts data selected from the data source browser into the document as fields.\</ahelp\>In the \<emph\>Insert Database Columns\</emph\> dialog, select the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>Fields\</link\> to insert the selected data into the document as fields. These \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090006.xhp\" name=\"database fields\"\>database fields\</link\> work as wildcards for the individual database columns and can be used for form letters. Click the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12080000.xhp\" name=\"Data to Fields\"\>\<emph\>Data to Fields\</emph\>\</link\> icon to match the contents of the fields to the currently selected record.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153114				0	hi	If several records are selected when you choose the \<emph\>Data to Text\</emph\> function, the mail merge fields will be inserted according to the number of records. Also, a field command such as "Next record" will be inserted automatically between individual field command blocks.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145090				0	hi	The \<emph\>Insert Database Columns\</emph\> dialog lets you define which database fields to insert into the document and how to format the paragraphs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156136				0	hi	Fields				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147571				0	hi	In the \<emph\>Fields\</emph\> area, use the arrow button to select the database table columns into which you want to insert field contents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153345				0	hi	Database columns				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155535				0	hi	Lists all columns of the database table, which can be accepted in the selection list box to insert them into the document. \<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL_LB_TXT_DB_COLUMN\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Select the database columns that you want to insert it in the document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152551				0	hi	>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	hi	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"SW_IMAGEBUTTON_DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL_IB_DBCOL_TOEDIT\"\>Moves the fields that you selected in the \<emph\>Database columns\</emph\> list box into the selection field.\</ahelp\> You can also double-click the entry to select it.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166411				0	hi	Select				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3163802				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_MULTILINEEDIT_DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL_ED_DB_TEXT\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Lists the database columns that you selected to be inserted into the document. You can also enter text here. This text will be also inserted into the document.\</ahelp\> The entries' order in the selection field corresponds to the data order in the document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153257				0	hi	अनुच्छेद शैली				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3158430				0	hi	By default, the inserted paragraphs are formatted with the current Paragraph Styles. This format corresponds to the "none" entry in the \<emph\>Paragraph Style\</emph\> list box. \<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL_LB_DB_PARA_COLL\" visibility=\"visible\"\>This is where you can select other Paragraph Styles to apply to the paragraph you want to insert into the document.\</ahelp\> The list box displays the available Paragraph Styles defined in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> and managed in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05130000.xhp\" name=\"Style Catalog\"\>Style Catalog\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
