helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150693	2			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Sorts the data of the selected field in ascending order. \</ahelp\>Text fields are sorted alphabetically, numerical fields are sorted by number.				20200411 15:09:53
