helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149415				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL:RB_DBFMT_FROM_DB\"\>Accepts the database formats.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159148				0	hi	Select				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152349				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL:LB_DBFMT_FROM_USR\"\>Specifies a format from the list, if the format information of certain data fields is not accepted.\</ahelp\> The formats supplied here are only available for certain database fields, such as numeric or Boolean fields. If you select a database field in text format, you will not be able to select any format from the selection list, since the text format will be automatically maintained.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3144511				0	hi	If the format you want is not listed, select "Other Formats..." and define the desired format in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020300.xhp\" name=\"Number Format\"\>\<emph\>Number Format\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154282				0	hi	The number format assigned using the selection list always refers to the database field selected in the \<emph\>Database columns\</emph\> list box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154138				0	hi	To insert the data into the document in the form of a table, the correct \<emph\>Table\</emph\> option must be active. You can then select a database field from the \<emph\>Table column(s)\</emph\> list box to define the formatting of the database field. The changes to the number formats will be applied to the last selection. It does not matter whether the database field was selected from the \<emph\>Database columns\</emph\> list box or from the \<emph\>Table column(s)\</emph\> list box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156280				0	hi	तालिका शीर्षक प्रविष्ट करें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150497				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL:CB_TABLE_HEADON\"\>Specifies whether to insert a heading line for the columns in the text table.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153178				0	hi	स्तम्भ नाम लागू करें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152922				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL:RB_HEADL_COLNMS\"\>Uses the field names of the database table as headings for each of the text table columns.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3158407				0	hi	सिर्फ पंक्ति बनाएँ				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153194	29			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL:RB_HEADL_EMPTY\"\>Inserts an empty heading line into the text table.\</ahelp\> Using the\<emph\> Create row only \</emph\>option, you can define headings in the document, which do not correspond to the database field names.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153369				0	hi	Properties				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154299				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL:PB_TBL_FORMAT\"\>Opens the \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05090000.xhp\" name=\"Table Format\"\>\<emph\>Table Format\</emph\>\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Table Format\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> dialog, which enables you to define the table properties such as borders, background, and column width.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153728				0	hi	ऑटोफॉर्मेट				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154988				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_AP_INSERT_DB_SEL:PB_TBL_AUTOFMT\"\>Opens the \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05150101.xhp\" name=\"AutoFormat\"\>\<emph\>AutoFormat\</emph\>\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>AutoFormat\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> dialog, in which you can select format styles that are immediately applied when inserting the table.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	Mail & News				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147102				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/09070200.xhp\" name=\"Mail News\"\>Mail & News\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153049				0	hi	On the \<emph\>Mail & News\</emph\> page in the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/09070000.xhp\" name=\"Hyperlink dialog\"\>Hyperlink dialog\</link\> you can edit hyperlinks for e-mail or news addresses.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153528				0	hi	Mail & News				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153748				0	hi	ई-मेल				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3166460				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_MAIL_RB_LINKTYP_MAIL\"\>Assigns the specified e-mail address to the hyperlink.\</ahelp\> Clicking the new hyperlink in the document will open a new message document, addressed to the receiver specified in the \<emph\>E-mail\</emph\> field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155628				0	hi	समाचार				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149955				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_MAIL_RB_LINKTYP_NEWS\"\>Assigns a news address to the hyperlink.\</ahelp\> Clicking the hyperlink in the document will open a new message document to the news group you entered in the \<emph\>Receiver\</emph\> field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149580				0	hi	प्राप्तकर्ता				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153665				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HYPERDLG_MAIL_PATH\"\>Specifies the full URL of the addressee, in the form mailto:name@provider.com or news:group.server.com.\</ahelp\> You can also use drag-and-drop.				20200411 15:09:53
