helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150443				0	hi	Target				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070100.xhp	0	help	par_id9887081				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enter a URL for the file that you want to open when you click the hyperlink. If you do not specify a target frame, the file opens in the current document or frame.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155628				0	hi	डबल्यूडबल्यूडबल्यू ब्राउज़र				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153760				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:IMAGEBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_INTERNET:BTN_BROWSE\"\>Opens a web browser, into which you can load the desired URL.\</ahelp\> You can then copy and paste the URL into the \<emph\>Target\</emph\> field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155421				0	hi	दस्तावेज़ में लक्ष्य				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147618				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:IMAGEBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_INTERNET:BTN_TARGET\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Target in Document\</emph\> dialog.\</ahelp\> There you can select the destination within a document and add it to the target URL with the \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147335				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HYPERLINK_MARKWND_TREE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies the position in the target document where you wish to jump to.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149164				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HYPERLINK_MARKWND_APPLY\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts the target in the \<emph\>Target\</emph\> field of the \<emph\>Hyperlink\</emph\> dialog.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155388				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HYPERLINK_MARKWND_CLOSE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Once the hyperlink has been completely entered, click on \<emph\>Close\</emph\> to set the link and leave the dialog.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153320				0	hi	लॉगइन नाम				20200411 15:09:53
