helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170903.xhp	0	help	par_id3155391				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_COMBOBOX_RID_PAGE_LCW_FIELDLINK_CMB_TABLEFIELD\"\>Specifies the linked table data field, which is related to the specified value table field.\</ahelp\> In addition, click the data field in the lower list field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170903.xhp	0	help	par_id3154823				0	hi	In \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170102.xhp\" name=\"Control - Properties\"\>Control - Properties\</link\>, the specified field will appear in the \<emph\>Data\</emph\> tab page of a SQL statement under \<emph\>List Contents\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
