helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149174				0	hi	The next document is created in a top-level window, that is, in the highest frame of the hierarchy; if the current frame is already a top window, the document is created in the current frame.				20200411 15:09:53
