helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1154E				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies if a Push Button behaves as a Toggle Button. If you set Toggle to "Yes", you can switch between the "selected" and "not selected" control states when you click the button or press the spacebar while the the control has the focus. A button in the "selected" state appears "pressed in".\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11558				0	hi	क्लिक पर फ़ोकस करें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1156E				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>If you set this option to "Yes", the Push Button receives the focus when you click the button.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
