helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id919217				0	hi	For a List box that contains a value list, you can click the \<emph\>...\</emph\> button to open the \<emph\>Default selection\</emph\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id50050				0	hi	In the \<emph\>Default selection\</emph\> dialog, select the entries that you want to mark as selected when you open the form that contains the list box.				20200411 15:09:53
