helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154681	145			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_DEFAULT_BUTTON\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The\<emph\> Default button\</emph\> property specifies that the corresponding button will be operated when you press the Return key.\</ahelp\>The\<emph\> Default button\</emph\> property specifies that the corresponding button will be operated when you press the Return key. If you open the dialog or form and do not carry out any further action, the button with this property is the default button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149750				0	hi	This property should be assigned only to a single button within the document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150931				0	hi	When using Web page forms, you might come across this property in search masks. These are edit masks that contain a text field and a Submit type button. The search term is entered in the text field and the search is started by activating the button. If the button is defined as the default button, however, simply hit Enter after entering the search term in order to start the search.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153389				0	hi	उपसर्ग प्रतीक				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150271				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_CURRSYM_POSITION\"\>Determines if the currency symbol is displayed before or after the number when using currency fields.\</ahelp\> The default setting is currency symbols are not prefixed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154548				0	hi	टैब रुकावट				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155361	49			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_TABSTOP\"\>The \<emph\>Tabstop \</emph\>property determines if a control field can be selected with the tab key.\</ahelp\> The following options are available:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148627				0	hi	नहीं				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3161673				0	hi	जब टैब कुंजी का इस्तेमाल किया जा रहा हो, फ़ोकस करने पर नियंत्रण छूट जाता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3159323				0	hi	हाँ				20200411 15:09:53
