helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146909				0	hi	हजार विभाजक				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154936	148			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_SHOWTHOUSANDSEP\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts a thousands separator.\</ahelp\>With numerical and currency fields you can determine whether thousands separators are used.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156256				0	hi	लेबल 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3156432	8			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_LABEL\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The Label property sets the label of the control field that is displayed in the form.\</ahelp\>The Label property sets the label of the control field that is displayed in the form. This property determines the visible label or the column header of the data field in table control forms.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154568				0	hi	When you create a new control, the description predefined in the \<emph\>Name\</emph\> property is used as the default for labeling the control. The label consists of the control field name and an integer numbering the control (for example, CommandButton1). With the \<emph\>Title\</emph\> property, you can assign another description to the control so that the label reflects the function of the control. Change this entry in order to assign an expressive label to the control that is visible to the user.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	bm_id3163820				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>multi-line titles in forms\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>names; multi-line titles\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>controls; multi-line titles\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3163820				0	hi	To create a multi-line title, open the combo box using the arrow button. You can enter a line break by pressing Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3159407				0	hi	The \<emph\>Title\</emph\> property is only used for labeling a form element in the interface visible to the user. If you work with macros, note that at runtime, a control is always addressed through the \<emph\>Name\</emph\> property.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150293				0	hi	URL				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154358	57			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_TARGET_URL\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies the URL address that opens when you click an "Open document / web page" button.\</ahelp\>Enter the URL address for a Open document or web page button type in the \<emph\>URL\</emph\> box. The address opens when you click the button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146074				0	hi	If you move the mouse over the button in User mode, the URL appears as the extended tip, provided that no other Help text was entered.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147134				0	hi	करेंसी चिह्न				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3145160	150			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_CURRENCYSYMBOL\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>You can enter a character or a string for the currency symbol.\</ahelp\>In a currency field, you can pre-define the currency symbol by entering the character or string in the \<emph\>Currency symbol\</emph\> property.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144444				0	hi	Value				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3152417	155			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_HIDDEN_VALUE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>You can enter the data that is inherited by the hidden control.\</ahelp\>In a \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170600.xhp\" name=\"hidden control\"\>hidden control\</link\>, under \<emph\>Value\</emph\>, you can enter the data which is inherited by the hidden control. This data will be transferred when sending the form.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157315				0	hi	पासवर्ड अक्षर				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155323	157			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_ECHO_CHAR\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>If the text box is used as a password input, enter the ASCII-code of the display character. This character is displayed instead of the characters typed by the user for the password.\</ahelp\>If the user enters a password, you can determine the characters that will be displayed instead of the characters typed by the user. Under \<emph\>Password character\</emph\>, enter the ASCII code of the desired character. You can use the values from 0 to 255.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3152493				0	hi	The characters and their ASCII codes can be seen in the \<emph\>Special Characters\</emph\> dialog (Insert - Special Character).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157884				0	hi	लिटरल मॉस्क				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3157557	160			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_LITERALMASK\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Defines the literal mask. The literal mask contains the initial values and is always visible after downloading a form.\</ahelp\>With masked fields you can specify a literal mask. A literal mask contains the initial values of a form, and is always visible after downloading a form. Using a character code for the Edit mask, you can determine the entries that the user can type into the masked field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148513				0	hi	The length of the literal mask should always correspond to the length of the edit mask. If this is not the case, the edit mask is either cut off or filled with blanks up to the length of the edit mask.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146762				0	hi	फ़ॉन्ट				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151037	6			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_FONT\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select the font for the text that is in the control field.\</ahelp\>For control fields which have visible text or titles, select the display font that you want to use. To open the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020100.xhp\" name=\"Font\"\>\<emph\>Font\</emph\>\</link\> dialog, click the \<emph\>...\</emph\> button. The selected font is used in control fields names and to display data in table control fields.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156734				0	hi	पंक्ति ऊँचाई				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3160455	163			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_ROWHEIGHT\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies the row height of a table control field.\</ahelp\>In table controls, enter a value for the row height. If you want, you can enter a value followed by valid measurement unit, for example, 2 cm.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11FB6				0	hi	पाठ पंक्तियाँ से अंत होती हैं				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11FBA				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>For text fields, select the line end code to be used when writing text into a database column.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3160477				0	hi	समय प्रारूप				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3145187	169			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_TIMEFORMAT\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>You can define the desired format for the time display.\</ahelp\>You can define the desired format for the time display.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3158195				0	hi	Help text				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146823	171			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_TAG\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies additional information or a descriptive text for the control field.\</ahelp\>In each control field you can specify additional information or a descriptive text for the control field. This property helps the programmer to save additional information that can be used in the program code. This field can be used, for example, for variables or other evaluation parameters.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157828				0	hi	फ़ॉर्मेट किया जा रहा है				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146843				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_FORMATKEY\"\>Specifies the format code for the control. Click the \<emph\>...\</emph\> button to select the format code.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN122C4				0	hi	स्केल				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN122C8				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_SCALEIMAGE\"\>Resizes the image to fit the size of the control.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1209F				0	hi	Acting on a record				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN120B1				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"37930\"\>Specifies to show or hide the action items in a selected Navigation Bar control.\</ahelp\> Action items are the following: Save record, Undo, New record, Delete record, Refresh.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN120BE				0	hi	अवस्थिति				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN120D9				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"37928\"\>Specifies to show or hide the positioning items in a selected Navigation Bar control.\</ahelp\> Positioning items are the following: Record label, Record position, Record count label, Record count.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN120D7				0	hi	नेविगेशन				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN120DB				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"37929\"\>Specifies to show or hide the navigation items in a selected Navigation Bar control.\</ahelp\> Navigation items are the following: First record, Previous record, Next record, Last record.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12156				0	hi	फिल्टरिंग / छंटाई				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1215A				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"37931\"\>Specifies to show or hide the filtering and sorting items in a selected Navigation Bar control.\</ahelp\> Filtering and sorting items are the following: Sort ascending, Sort descending, Sort, Automatic filter, Default filter, Apply filter, Remove filter/sort.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12175				0	hi	प्रतीक आकार				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12179				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"37927\"\>Specifies whether the icons in a selected Navigation Bar should be small or large.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id0409200920593864				0	hi	Visible				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id0409200920593851				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Defines whether the control will be visible in live mode. In design mode, the control is always visible.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id0409200921154683				0	hi	Note that if this property is set to "Yes" (the default), this does not necessarily mean the control will really appear on the screen. Additional constraints are applied when calculating a control's effective visibility. For instance, a control placed in a hidden section in Writer will never be visible at all, until at least the section itself becomes visible.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id0409200921154691				0	hi	If the property is set to "No", then the control will always be hidden in live mode.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id0409200921154614				0	hi	Older OpenOffice.org versions up to 3.1 will silently ignore this property when reading documents which make use of it.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12314				0	hi	दृष्टिगोचर आकार				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12318				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the size of scrollbar thumb in "value units". A value of ("Scroll value max." minus "Scroll value min." ) / 2 would result in a thumb which occupies half of the background area.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12375				0	hi	If set to 0, then the thumb's width will equal its height.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12332				0	hi	Orientation				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12336				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the horizontal or vertical orientation for a scrollbar or spin button.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	टैब अनुक्रम				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146959				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170300.xhp\" name=\"Tab Order\"\>Tab Order\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150347	2			0	hi	\<variable id=\"text\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TabDialog\"\>In the\<emph\> Tab Order \</emph\>dialog you can modify the order in which control fields get the focus when the user presses the tab key.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3109850				0	hi	If form elements are inserted into a document, \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> automatically determines in which order to move from one control to the next when using the Tab key. Every new control added is automatically placed at the end of this series. In the \<emph\>Tab Order\</emph\> dialog, you can adapt the order of this series to your individual needs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	hi	You can also define the index of a control through its specific properties by entering the desired value under \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Order\"\>\<emph\>Order\</emph\>\</link\> in the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> dialog of the control.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149760				0	hi	A radio button inside a group can only be accessed by the Tab key when one of the radio buttons is set to "selected". If you have designed a group of radio buttons where no button is set to "selected", then the user will not be able to access the group or any of the radio buttons by keyboard.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149140				0	hi	नियंत्रक				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150789	5			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TABORDER_CONTROLS\"\>Lists all controls in the form. These controls can be selected with the tab key in the given order from top to bottom.\</ahelp\> Select a control from the \<emph\>Controls \</emph\>list to assign the desired position in the tab order.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153750				0	hi	Move Up				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751	7			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SVXDLG_TAB_ORDER_PB_MOVE_UP\"\>Click the\<emph\> Move Up\</emph\> button to shift the selected control one position higher in the tab order.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155339				0	hi	Move Down				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154823	9			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SVXDLG_TAB_ORDER_PB_MOVE_DOWN\"\>Click the\<emph\> Move Down\</emph\> button to shift the selected control one position lower in the tab order.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154288				0	hi	स्वचालित छांटें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153748	11			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SVXDLG_TAB_ORDER_PB_AUTO_ORDER\"\>Click the\<emph\> Automatic Sort\</emph\> button to automatically sort the controls according to their position in the document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	ग्राफिक्स मोड				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149762				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/24020000.xhp\" name=\"Graphics Mode\"\>Graphics Mode\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150255				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GrafMode\"\>Lists view attributes for the selected graphic object. The embedded or linked graphic object in the current file will not be changed, only the view of the object.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150275				0	hi	\<image id=\"img_id3154515\" src=\"res/helpimg/zellvor.png\" width=\"1.528in\" height=\"0.292in\" localize=\"true\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154515\"\>Cell Styles\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771				0	hi	ग्राफिक्स मोड				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155262				0	hi	Default				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155434				0	hi	चित्र वस्तु के दृश्य को बदला नहीं गया.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147574				0	hi	श्वेत-श्याम				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153760				0	hi	The graphic object is shown in grayscale. A color graphic object can become monochrome in grayscale. You can also use the color sliders to apply a uniform color to the monochrome graphic object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151246				0	hi	काला और सफेद				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153062				0	hi	The graphic object is shown in black and white. All brightness values below 50% will appear black, all over 50% will appear white.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146795				0	hi	वाटरमार्क				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	hi	The graphic object is raised in brightness and reduced in contrast so that it can be used in the background as a watermark. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14060000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	Alias				20200411 15:09:53
