helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01171000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155805				0	hi	You cannot activate the controls of the form or edit contents of database records in Design Mode. However, you can change the position and size of the controls, edit other properties, and add or delete controls in Design Mode.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01171000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147089				0	hi	After you have finished editing your form, right-click "Forms" in the \<emph\>Form Navigator\</emph\> and deselect \<emph\>Open in Design Mode\</emph\>. Save your form when you are finished.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01171000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154749				0	hi	If the form document is write-protected, the \<emph\>Open in Design Mode\</emph\> command is ignored.				20200411 15:09:53
