helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150247				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DecrementIndent\"\>Click the \<emph\>Decrease Indent\</emph\> icon to reduce the left indent of the current paragraph or cell content and set it to the previous default tab position.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
