helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3159233				0	hi	The table given here appears in the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170102.xhp\" name=\"Control properties\"\>Control properties\</link\> as an element of an SQL statement in the \<emph\>List Contents\</emph\> field.				20200411 15:09:53
