helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153927				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CheckBox\"\>Creates a check box.\</ahelp\> Check boxes allow you to activate or deactivate a function in a form.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153794				0	hi	पाठ बक्सा				20200411 15:09:53
