helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3158444				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Edit\"\>Creates a text box.\</ahelp\> Text boxes are fields in which the user can enter text. In a form, text boxes display data or allow for new data input.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151218				0	hi	Formatted Field				20200411 15:09:53
