helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CE7				0	hi	स्क्रॉल मूल्य न्यूनतम				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CED				0	hi	स्क्रॉलपट्टी की न्यूनतम ऊँचाई तथा न्यूनतम चौड़ाई निर्धारित करता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CF4				0	hi	स्क्रॉल मूल्य अधिकतम				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CFA				0	hi	स्क्रॉलपट्टी की अधिकतम ऊँचाई तथा अधिकतम चौड़ाई निर्धारित करता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D01				0	hi	Default scroll value				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D07				0	hi	Specifies the default value of a scrollbar, used when the form is reset.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D0E				0	hi	Orientation				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D14				0	hi	स्क्रॉलपट्टी की दिशा निर्धारित करता है, यानी कि आड़ा या खड़ा.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D1B				0	hi	Small change				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D21				0	hi	Specifies the minimum amount by which you can scroll a scrollbar, for example, by clicking an arrow.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D28				0	hi	Large change				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D2E				0	hi	Specifies the amount that a large step scrolls a scrollbar, for example, when you click between the scrollbar thumb and a scrollbar arrow.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D35				0	hi	Delay				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D3B				0	hi	Specifies the delay in milliseconds between scrollbar trigger events. For example, the delay that occurs when you click an arrow button on the scrollbar and hold down the mouse button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D42				0	hi	Symbol color				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D48				0	hi	स्क्रॉलपट्टी में तीर का रंग निर्धारित करता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D4F				0	hi	दृष्टिगोचर आकार				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D55				0	hi	Specifies the size of the scrollbar thumb in "value units". For example, a value of ("Scroll value max." minus "Scroll value min.") / 2 results in a scrollbar thumb that occupies half of the scrollbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D58				0	hi	To make the width of the scrollbar equal to the height of the scrollbar, set the Visible Size to zero.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D63				0	hi	In a Calc spreadsheet, you can use the Data tab page to create a two-way link between a scrollbar and a cell.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153316				0	hi	Image Button				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159622				0	hi	\<image id=\"img_id3154378\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_imagebutton.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154378\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148601				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Imagebutton\"\>Creates a button displayed as an image.\</ahelp\> Aside from the graphic representation, an image button has the same properties as a "normal" button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159171				0	hi	Image Control				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155869				0	hi	\<image id=\"img_id3152381\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_objectcatalog.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152381\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149596				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ImageControl\"\>Creates an image control. It can only be used to add images from a database.\</ahelp\> In the form document, double-click one of these controls to open the \<emph\>Insert Graphic\</emph\> dialog to insert the image. There is also a context menu (not in design mode) with commands for inserting and deleting the image.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150318				0	hi	Images from a database can be displayed in a form, and new images can be inserted in the database as long as the image control is not write-protected. The control must refer to a database field of the image type. Therefore, enter the data field into the properties window on the \<emph\>Data\</emph\> tab page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156040				0	hi	तारीख़ क्षेत्र				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149423				0	hi	\<image id=\"img_id3150096\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_adddatefield.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150096\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151312				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DateField\"\>Creates a date field.\</ahelp\> If the form is linked to a database, the date values can be adopted from the database.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151302				0	hi	If you assign the "Dropdown" property to the date field, the user can open a calendar to select a date under the date field. This also applies to a date field within a Table Control field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154395				0	hi	Date fields can be easily edited by the user with the up arrow and down arrow keys. Depending on the cursor position, the day, month, or the year is can be increased or decreased using the arrow keys.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153112				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170003.xhp\" name=\"Specific Remarks on Date Fields\"\>Specific Remarks on Date Fields\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152369				0	hi	समय क्षेत्र				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153687				0	hi	\<image id=\"img_id3155949\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_timefield.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155949\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155399				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TimeField\"\>Creates a time field.\</ahelp\> If the form is linked to a database, the time values for the form can be adopted from the database.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154764				0	hi	Time fields can be easily edited by the user with the up and down arrow keys. Depending on the cursor position, the hours, minutes, or the seconds are increased or decreased using the arrow keys.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156186				0	hi	चयन छुपाएँ				20200411 15:09:53
