helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145601				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:NumericField\"\>Creates a numerical field.\</ahelp\> If the form is linked to a database, the numerical values in the form can be adopted from the database.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153612				0	hi	Currency Field				20200411 15:09:53
