helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000206.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155354				0	hi	Dif Import/Export/ Lotus import/ dBASE import				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000206.xhp	0	help	par_id3150620				0	hi	Defines the options for import/export. These dialogs will be automatically shown if the corresponding file type is selected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000206.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149000				0	hi	अक्षर सेट				20200411 15:09:53
