helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159242	2			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The\<emph\> General \</emph\>tab page lists the general properties of the current theme.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
