helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000007.xhp	0	help	par_id3156326				0	hi	These commands can only be accessed after you enable support for Asian languages in \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language Settings - Languages\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
