helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154408				0	hi	\<variable id=\"xmlformat\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000021.xhp\" name=\"XML File Formats\"\>XML File Formats\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3148919				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DID_SAVE_PACKED_XML\"\>By default, $[officename] loads and saves files in the OpenDocument file format.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_idN10725				0	hi	The OpenDocument file format (ODF) is a standardized file format used by many software applications. You can find more information at the Wikipedia site: \<link href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OpenDocument\"\>wikipedia.org/wiki/OpenDocument\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
