helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159150				0	hi	If you want to terminate a macro that is currently running, press Shift+ \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Q.				20200411 15:09:53
