helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153349	6			0	hi	Next >>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156307				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_ASS:BUT_NEXT\"\>Accepts the new settings and moves to the next page.\</ahelp\> You will not be able to select this button in the last editing step.				20200411 15:09:53
