helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110300.xhp	0	help	par_id3157909				0	hi	छवि फ़ॉर्मेट निर्धारित करें. आप निर्यात के लिए संपीडन मूल्य भी निर्धारित कर सकते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110300.xhp	0	help	hd_id2298959				0	hi	PNG - Portable Network Graphics format				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110300.xhp	0	help	par_id4653767				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The files are exported as PNG files. PNG files are compressed without loss of data, and can contain more than 256 colors.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147618				0	hi	जीआईएफ़ - ग्राफ़िक्स इंटरचेंज फ़ॉर्मेट				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154860				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_PUBLISHING:PAGE3_GIF\"\>The files are exported as GIF files. GIF files are compressed without loss of data, and have a maximum of 256 colors.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154306				0	hi	जेपीजी - संपीडित फ़ाइल फ़ॉर्मेट				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153665				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_PUBLISHING:PAGE3_JPG\"\>The files are exported as JPEG files. JPEG files are compressed, with adjustable compression and can contain more than 256 colors.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149763				0	hi	विशेषता				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110300.xhp	0	help	par_id3151384				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:COMBOBOX:DLG_PUBLISHING:PAGE3_QUALITY\"\>Specifies the compression factor of the JPEG graphic. A 100% value offers the best quality for a large data range. The 25% factor indicates small files with inferior image quality.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148552				0	hi	मॉनीटर रेज़ोल्यूशन				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110300.xhp	0	help	par_id3148947				0	hi	Defines the resolution for the target screen. Depending on the selected resolution, the image will be displayed in a reduced size. You can specify a reduction of up to 80% from the original size.				20200411 15:09:53
