helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153361				0	hi	Medium resolution (800x600 pixels)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154686				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_PUBLISHING:PAGE3_RESOLUTION_2\"\>Select the medium resolution for a medium-sized presentation.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153968				0	hi	High resolution (1024x768 pixels)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149810				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_PUBLISHING:PAGE3_RESOLUTION_3\"\>Select a high resolution for a high quality slide display.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
