helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id2008				0	hi	The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Navigator\</item\> deck contains the \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>        \<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"navigator\"\>Navigator\</link\>\</caseinline\>        \<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"navigator\"\>Navigator\</link\>\</caseinline\>        \<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"navigator\"\>Navigator\</link\>\</caseinline\>        \<defaultinline\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"navigator\"\>Navigator\</link\>\</defaultinline\>        \</switchinline\> window.				20200411 15:09:53
