helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id2010				0	hi	        The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Functions\</item\> deck contains the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04080000.xhp\" name=\"functions\"\>Function List\</link\> window. This deck is only available for spreadsheets.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id2011				0	hi	\<image id=\"img_id2011\" src=\"sfx2/res/symphony/sidebar-template-large.png\" width=\"0.25in\" height=\"0.25in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id2011\"\>Master Pages deck\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id2012				0	hi	The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Master Pages\</item\> deck lists currently used, recently used, and available master pages. Right-click a master page thumbnail for a sub-menu to apply or edit the master page. This deck is only available for presentations.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id2013				0	hi	\<image id=\"img_id2013\" src=\"sfx2/res/symphony/sidebar-animation-large.png\" width=\"0.25in\" height=\"0.25in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id2013\"\>Custom Animation deck\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id2014				0	hi	The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Custom Animation\</item\> deck provides tools to apply animation effects to presentation and graphic objects on your slide. This deck is only available for presentations.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id2015				0	hi	\<image id=\"img_id2015\" src=\"sfx2/res/symphony/sidebar-transition-large.png\" width=\"0.25in\" height=\"0.25in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id2015\"\>Slide Transition deck\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id2016				0	hi	The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Slide Transition\</item\> deck provides tools to apply a special effect that plays when you display a slide. This deck is only available for presentations.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id0002				0	hi	The sidebar is available in WRITER, CALC, IMPRESS, and DRAW application.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	hd_id0500				0	hi	Sidebar Window Handling				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id0003				0	hi	The sidebar is a \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/autohide.xhp\" name=\"docking\"\>dockable window\</link\>. However, you cannot dock it to the bottom or top edge of the working area but only to the left or right edge. The sensitive area for the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command-\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl-\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>double-click method of docking is small, so make sure you click the sidebar window and not its content.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id0004				0	hi	In a docked sidebar window the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Close Sidebar Deck\</item\> button in the upper-right corner of the title area minimizes the current deck, but keeps the tab bar open. To reopen the deck click the corresponding tab or drag the sidebar window frame. To close the sidebar window completely uncheck \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Sidebar\</item\> in the View menu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id0005				0	hi	For decks with several panels click the panel title area to toggle between expanded and minimized state of the panel.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id0006				0	hi	The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>More Options\</item\> button at the top-right of a panel title opens a dialog which provides additional settings. Not all panels have this feature.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	पृष्ठ पर छापने योग्य अधिकतम क्षेत्र चुनना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149180				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>page formats; maximizing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>formats; maximizing page formats\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>printers; maximum page formats\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149180				0	hi	\<variable id=\"pageformat_max\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/pageformat_max.xhp\" name=\"Selecting the Maximum Printable Area on a Page\"\>Selecting the Maximum Printable Area on a Page\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3156426				0	hi	सभी प्रिंटर काग़ज़ के किनारों तक छापने में असमर्थ होते हैं. प्रायः बहुत से प्रिंटर छापे नहीं जा सकने वाले हाशिए छोड़ते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3149182				0	hi	$[officename] offers a semi-automatic feature that enables you to print as close to the paper's edge as is possible.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3159233				0	hi	Make sure that your printer has been setup under \<emph\>File - Printer Settings\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3156114				0	hi	Make sure that the \<emph\>Web Layout\</emph\> in the \<emph\>View\</emph\> menu is not selected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3147653				0	hi	Select the \<emph\>Format - Page\</emph\> command, and go to the \<emph\>Page\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3147335				0	hi	Under \<emph\>Margins\</emph\> you can define the maximum or minimum possible value for the page margins (left, right, top, and bottom). Click into the respective control, then press the Page Up or Page Down key. The preview displays a dashed line around the printable range.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pageformat_max.xhp	0	help	par_id3145120				0	hi	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to close the dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
