helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\import_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id9207434				0	hi	Choose the file type "HTML Document" to open in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer/Web. This is the default for HTML documents in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\import_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id7215491				0	hi	All the options of \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer/Web are now available to you, such as \<emph\>Show HTML source\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\import_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id2299874				0	hi	Choose "HTML Document (\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer)" to open in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\import_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id1727347				0	hi	All the options of \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer are now available to you. Not all options that \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer offers for editing of documents can be saved in HTML format.				20200411 15:09:53
