helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3156113				0	hi	वर्तमान दस्तावेज़ काला और सफेद में छपेगा				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147653				0	hi	Printing in black and white in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Impress and \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Draw				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3149233				0	hi	Choose Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Impress or Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Draw, as appropriate.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3150275				0	hi	Then choose \<emph\>Print\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3147573	12			0	hi	Under \<emph\>Quality,\</emph\> select either \<emph\>Grayscale\</emph\> or \<emph\>Black & white\</emph\> and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3154307				0	hi	When either of these options is selected, all presentations or drawings will be printed without color. If you only want to print in black for the \<emph\>current\</emph\> print job, select the option in \<emph\>File - Print - %PRODUCTNAME Draw/Impress\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3149786	15			0	hi	               \<emph\>Grayscale\</emph\> converts all colors to a maximum of 256 gradations from black to white. All text will be printed in black. A background set by \<emph\>Format - Page - Background\</emph\> will not be printed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3145610	16			0	hi	               \<emph\>Black & white\</emph\> converts all colors into the two values black and white. All borders around objects are printed black. All text will be printed in black. A background set by \<emph\>Format - Page - Background\</emph\> will not be printed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153896				0	hi	सिर्फ पाठ को काला और सफेद में छापना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3147559				0	hi	In \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer you can choose to print color-formatted text in black and white. You can specify this either for all subsequent text documents to be printed, or only for the current printing process.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150358				0	hi	सभी पाठ दस्तावेज़ को काला और सफेद पाठ के साथ छापना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3150541				0	hi	Choose Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer or Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer/Web.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3147084				0	hi	Then choose \<emph\>Print\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3154910	22			0	hi	Under \<emph\>Contents,\</emph\> mark \<emph\>Print black\</emph\> and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3144762				0	hi	सभी पाठ दस्तावेज़ों या एचटीएमएल दस्तावेज़ों को काले पाठ से छापा जाएगा				20200411 15:09:53
