helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3152933				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\>. Then click the \<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	par_id3149667				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Print text in black\</emph\> and click \<emph\>Print\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
