helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3149827				0	hi	Point to the selected area and press the mouse button. Keep the mouse button pressed for a moment, then drag the area into the text document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3152780	32			0	hi	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WIN\"\>If the documents are not visible next to each other, first drag the mouse pointer to the destination document button. Continue to hold down the mouse button. The document is displayed, and you can move the mouse pointer within the document. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3156346				0	hi	Once the cursor is located in the place where you want to insert the sheet area, release the mouse button. The sheet area is inserted as an OLE object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3154047				0	hi	आप किसी भी समय ओएलई वस्तु चुन तथा संपादित कर सकते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
