helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3155389				0	hi	Alternatively, select the object and choose \<emph\>Edit - Object - Edit\</emph\> or choose \<emph\>Edit\</emph\> from the context menu. You edit the object in its own frame within the text document, but you see the icons and menu commands needed for spreadsheets.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3154860				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Open\</emph\> to open the source document of the OLE object.				20200411 15:09:53
