helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\change_title.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156324				0	hi	\<variable id=\"change_title\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/change_title.xhp\" name=\"Changing the Title of a Document\"\>Changing the Title of a Document\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\change_title.xhp	0	help	par_id3152801				0	hi	You can specify a title for your document. Some file manager utilities can display the titles next to the filenames of your documents.				20200411 15:09:53
