helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\viewing_file_properties.xhp	0	help	bm_id3152594				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>properties;files\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>files;properties\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>viewing;file properties\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\viewing_file_properties.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152594				0	hi	\<variable id=\"viewing_file_properties\"\>\<variable id=\"viewing\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/viewing_file_properties.xhp\" name=\"Viewing File Properties\"\>Viewing File Properties\</link\>\</variable\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\viewing_file_properties.xhp	0	help	par_id3147399				0	hi	File properties, such as author name, subject, and keywords, help you manage and identify your documents. $[officename] also tracks file statistics, including the number of words and the number of pages in a document, and automatically adds the statistics as part of the file property.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\viewing_file_properties.xhp	0	help	par_id3147834				0	hi	You can view file properties for the current document\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WIN\"\> or for a document in the Windows File Open dialog \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\viewing_file_properties.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159233				0	hi	मौजूदा दस्तावेज़ के फ़ाइल गुणों को देखने के लिए:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\viewing_file_properties.xhp	0	help	par_id3153311				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>File - Properties\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\viewing_file_properties.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150443				0	hi	विंडोज़ फ़ाइल खोलें संवाद में सूची बद्ध किए दस्तावेज़ों के फ़ाइल गुण देखने के लिए				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\viewing_file_properties.xhp	0	help	par_id3166460				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>File - Open\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
