helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155448				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>tables in databases; creating in design view (manually)\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>designing; database tables\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>properties;fields in databases\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>fields;database tables\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>AutoValue (Base)\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>primary keys;design view\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149798				0	hi	\<variable id=\"data_tabledefine\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/data_tabledefine.xhp\" name=\"Table Design\"\>Table Design\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id3155535				0	hi	This section contains information about how to create a new database table in the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/05010000.xhp\" name=\"design view\"\>design view\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id3154288				0	hi	Open the database file of the database where you want a new table. Click the \<emph\>Tables\</emph\> icon. Choose \<emph\>Create Table in Design View\</emph\> to create a new table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id3146798				0	hi	डिज़ाइन दृश्य में आप अब अपनी तालिका के लिए क्षेत्र तैयार कर सकते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id3153349				0	hi	Enter new fields in rows from top to bottom. Click the \<emph\>Field Name\</emph\> cell and enter a field name for each data field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id1595507				0	hi	Include a "primary key" data field. Base needs a primary key to be able to edit the table contents. A primary key has unique contents for each data record. For example, insert a numerical field, right-click the first column, and choose \<emph\>Primary Key\</emph\> from the context menu. Set \<emph\>AutoValue\</emph\> to "Yes", so Base can automatically increment the value for each new record.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id3150084				0	hi	In the next cell to the right, define the \<emph\>Field Type\</emph\>. When you click in the cell, you can select a field type in the combo box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id3154760				0	hi	Each field can only accept data corresponding to the specified field type. For example, it is not possible to enter text in a number field. Memo fields in dBASE III format are references to internally-managed text files which can hold up to 64KB text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id3149456				0	hi	You can enter an optional \<emph\>Description\</emph\> for each field. The text of the description will appear as a tip on the column headings in the table view.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153379				0	hi	क्षेत्र गुण				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id3148798				0	hi	प्रत्येक चयनित डाटा क्षेत्र के लिए गुण भरें. डाटाबेस क़िस्म के आधार पर कुछ इनपुट सुविधाएँ उपलब्ध नहीं होंगी.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id3144762				0	hi	In the \<emph\>Default value\</emph\> box, enter the default contents for every new record. This contents can be edited later.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id3150869				0	hi	In the \<emph\>Entry required\</emph\> box, specify whether or not the field may remain empty.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_tabledefine.xhp	0	help	par_id3154908				0	hi	For the \<emph\>Length\</emph\> box, a combo box may be shown that provides the available choices.				20200411 15:09:53
