helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\startcenter.xhp	0	help	par_id1022200911011855				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The Templates icon opens the Templates and Documents dialog.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
