helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152801				0	hi	\<variable id=\"configure_overview\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/configure_overview.xhp\" name=\"Configuring $[officename]\"\>Configuring $[officename]\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	hi	You can customize your $[officename] to suit your needs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3155421				0	hi	Use \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06140000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Customize\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Customize\</emph\>\</link\> to open the \<emph\>Customize\</emph\> dialog to change toolbars, menus and other user interface items.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3145071				0	hi	You are free to change the items on the menu bar. You can delete items, add new ones, copy items from one menu to another, rename them, and so on.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3149811				0	hi	औजारपट्टियाँ आसानी से कॉन्फ़िगर की जा सकती हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3150443				0	hi	शॉर्टकट कुंजियों को आप बदल सकते हैं				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	opt3153345				0	hi	You can change default settings of $[officename] to suit your needs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	optid3155421				0	hi	Use \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/010000000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</link\> to open the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> dialog to change a variety of settings you will use in $[officename] modules. Items presented in the \<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\> menu will change depending on the module you are using.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	opt3145071				0	hi	In \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/language_select.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - Language Settings\</emph\>\</link\>, you will find options for your default language and currency setting.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	opt3149811				0	hi	In \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040000.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - $[officename] Writer - Basic Fonts\</emph\>\</link\>, you will find default font settings. Change these to suit your preferences. Fonts can easily be changed on per document basis.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	opt3150443				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010900.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - Print\</emph\>\</link\> contains a number of print customizations that may be useful for your particular needs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3155388				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/06140000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Customize\"\>Tools - Customize\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	opt3155388				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01000000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options\"\>Tools - Options\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	Adding Clickable Hotspots to Images				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150502				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>ImageMap; editor\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>editors; ImageMap editor\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>images; ImageMap\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>pictures; ImageMap\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>hotspots;adding to images\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>URL;in pictures\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN10631				0	hi	\<variable id=\"imagemap\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/imagemap.xhp\"\>Adding Clickable Hotspots to Images\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN1064F				0	hi	An ImageMap allows you to attach URLs to specific areas, called hotspots, on a picture in your document. An image map is a group of one or more hotspots.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN1066C				0	hi	You can draw three types of hotspots: rectangles, ellipses, and polygons. When you click a hotspot, the URL is opened in the browser window or frame that you specify. You can also specify the text that appears when your mouse rests on the hotspot.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN10677				0	hi	To add a clickable hotspot to an image				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN1067E				0	hi	Position the cursor where you want the ImageMap in your document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN10682				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Picture - From File\</emph\>, select and insert a bitmap picture.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN1068A				0	hi	With the picture selected, choose \<emph\>Edit - ImageMap\</emph\>. You see the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02220000.xhp\"\>ImageMap Editor\</link\>, which displays the picture at the background.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A0				0	hi	Use the icons in the ImageMap Editor to draw a hotspot shape, for example a rectangle, over the image at the background.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A3				0	hi	You can see an extended help text on the functions of each icon when you enable Extended Help in \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AB				0	hi	Enter the "Address" URL that will be shown in a Web browser when the user clicks the hotspot.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AF				0	hi	Optionally, enter the "Text" that will be shown as a tip when the user points the mouse to the hotspot.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B3				0	hi	Click the Apply button to apply your changes, and close the ImageMap Editor.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B7				0	hi	Save the document in the %PRODUCTNAME or HTML format.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\imagemap.xhp	0	help	par_idN106BA				0	hi	You may save the ImageMap as a file and upload that file to a Web server, for example.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\active_help_on_off.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	विस्तृत नुस्ख़ों को चालू या बन्द करना				20200411 15:09:53
