helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10617				0	hi	Using forms, you can define how to present the data. Open a text document or a spreadsheet and insert the controls such as push buttons and list boxes. In the properties dialogs of the controls, you can define what data the forms should display.				20200411 15:09:53
