helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN1061E				0	hi	In %PRODUCTNAME, you can create a new form using the \<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01090000.xhp\"\>Form Wizard\</link\>:				20200411 15:09:53
