helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autohide.xhp	0	help	par_id3152921	64			0	hi	Click the button on the edge of the docked window to show or hide the docked window. The AutoHide function allows you to temporarily show a hidden window by clicking on its edge. When you click in the document, the docked window hides again. 				20200411 15:09:53
