helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_legend.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147291				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>charts; editing legends\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>legends; charts\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>editing; chart legends\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>formatting; chart legends\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
