helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	hd_id3083278				0	hi	\<variable id=\"language_select\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/language_select.xhp\" name=\"Selecting the Document Language\"\>Selecting the Document Language\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3150040				0	hi	The language you select for your document determines the dictionary used for spellcheck, thesaurus and hyphenation, the decimal and thousands delimiter used and the default currency format.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3153093				0	hi	जो भाषा आपने चुना है वह सम्पूर्ण दस्तावेज़ के लिए लागू होगा.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3152578				0	hi	Within the document, you can apply a separate language to any paragraph style. This has priority over the language of the whole document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3152886				0	hi	You can assign a language to selected pieces of text in a paragraph, either by direct formatting or with a character style. This assignment has priority over the paragraph style and document language.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146121				0	hi	सम्पूर्ण दस्तावेज़ के लिए भाषा चुनना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3083443				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\</emph\>. Go to \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01140000.xhp\" name=\"Language Settings - Languages\"\>\<emph\>Language Settings - Languages\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3149664				0	hi	Under \<emph\>Default languages for documents\</emph\>, select the document language for all newly created documents. If you mark \<emph\>For the current document only\</emph\>, your choice will only apply to the current document. Close the dialog with \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152938				0	hi	अनुच्छेद शैली के लिए भाषा चुनना				20200411 15:09:53
