helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3145367				0	hi	Open the context menu and select \<emph\>Edit Paragraph Style\</emph\>. This opens the \<emph\>Paragraph Style\</emph\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
