helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	hd_id8703268				0	hi	Adding More Text Languages				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id7919248				0	hi	Dictionaries are supplied and installed as extensions. Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Language - More Dictionaries Online\</item\> to open the dictionaries page in your default web browser.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id5174108				0	hi	Select a dictionary in the list of descriptions. Click the heading in a dictionary description that you want to get.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id2897427				0	hi	In the next page, click the Get It icon to download the dictionary extension. Note the folder name to which your browser downloads the file. Download additional dictionaries as you like.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3906979				0	hi	In %PRODUCTNAME, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Extension Manager\</item\> and click Add to install the downloaded extensions.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id0220200911174493				0	hi	After you installed the extensions, you should close %PRODUCTNAME (including the Quickstarter), and restart.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	hd_id9100924				0	hi	Setting UI Language				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id2761314				0	hi	A standard installation of %PRODUCTNAME software will give you a user interface (UI) of your chosen language.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3912778				0	hi	Most users download the American English version, which gives you English menu commands and English application help. If you want another language for the menus (and for the application help, if available in that language), change the UI language as follows.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3163853				0	hi	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language Settings - Languages\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id121158				0	hi	Select another UI language in the "User interface" listbox.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id3806878				0	hi	Click OK and restart the %PRODUCTNAME software.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id130619				0	hi	If the listbox doesn't list the language that you want, see "Adding More UI Languages".				20200411 15:09:53
