helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3147265				0	hi	%PRODUCTNAME stores the information about the created reports in the database file.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>File - Open\</emph\> and select the database file.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3151054				0	hi	In the database file window, click the \<emph\>Reports\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3156280				0	hi	Double-click one of the report names to open the report.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_idN1077D				0	hi	These links are added automatically when you create a new report by the Report Wizard or in the Report Builder window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	hd_id1695608				0	hi	Editing a Report Created in the Report Builder Window				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id7510910				0	hi	Right-click the name of a report in the database file window, then choose Edit.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id8138065				0	hi	The Report Builder window opens with the report's information loaded. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id5086825				0	hi	Use the toolbars and menu commands and drag-and-drop to edit the report as stated in the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/rep_main.xhp\"\>Report Builder\</link\> guide.				20200411 15:09:53
