helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_barformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3149182				0	hi	Click on any bar of the bar series you want to edit. All bars of this series are now selected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_barformat.xhp	0	help	par_id720847				0	hi	If you want to edit only one bar, click again on that bar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_barformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3147275				0	hi	In the context menu choose \<emph\>Object Properties\</emph\>. Then choose the \<emph\>Area\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_barformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3146797				0	hi	Click on \<emph\>Bitmap\</emph\>. In the list box select a bitmap as a texture for the currently selected bars. Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to accept the setting.				20200411 15:09:53
