helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3154150				0	hi	Double-click the ruler to open the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030300.xhp\" name=\"Paragraph\"\>\<emph\>Paragraph\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3154145				0	hi	Double-click the white area of the ruler to set one tab. The \<emph\>Paragraph\</emph\> dialog appears with the \<emph\>Tabs\</emph\> tab page open.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145748				0	hi	मापनी पर टैब को खिसकाना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3145264				0	hi	माउस के जरिए मापनी पर प्रत्येक टैब रोक को खिसकाना.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3159156				0	hi	To move several tab stops on the ruler, press the Shift key before you click a tab. Drag one tab while continuing to press Shift to move that tab as well as all the tabs to the right of it. The spacing between those tabs remains the same.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3147349	23			0	hi	Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> when you drag a tab on the ruler to move that tab and all the tabs to the right of it. This results in the spacing between those tabs changing proportionally to their distance from the margin.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146146				0	hi	टैब के गुणों को बदलना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3145646				0	hi	टैब क़िस्म को बदलने के लिए, मापनी पर बदलने हेतु टैब को क्लिक करें, फिर कॉन्टेक्स्ट मेन्यू को खोलने के लिए दायाँ क्लिक करें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154729				0	hi	टैब मिटाना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3148879				0	hi	किसी टैब को मिटाने के लिए, टैब को मापनी से बाहर खींचकर ले जाते समय माउस बटन को दबाकर रखें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151074				0	hi	डिफ़ॉल्ट्स बदलना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3151059				0	hi	If you want to change the settings of your default tab stops, you will find further information under \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040900.xhp\" name=\"Text Document - General\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - General\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060300.xhp\" name=\"Spreadsheet - General\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Calc - General\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01070500.xhp\" name=\"Drawing - General\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Draw - General\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01070500.xhp\" name=\"Presentation - General\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Impress - General\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>(module name) - General\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> in the Options dialog box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3146972				0	hi	The \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000001.xhp#kontextmenue\" name=\"context menu\"\>context menu\</link\> of the ruler allows you to change the displayed units of measurement. These changes are only valid until you exit $[officename], and they only apply to the ruler on whose context menu you made the change. If you want to change the ruler measurement units permanently, choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - [Document type] - View\</emph\> and change the measurement unit there.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\tabs.xhp	0	help	par_id3148429				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/swriter/main0213.xhp\" name=\"Ruler\"\>Ruler\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	Creating XML Filters 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	bm_id7007583				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>testing XML filters\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>XML filters;creating/testing\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	hd_id1413922				0	hi	\<variable id=\"xsltfilter\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/xsltfilter_create.xhp\"\>Creating XML Filters\</link\> \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN1053D				0	hi	 %PRODUCTNAME के लिए एक्सएमएल फ़िल्टर बनाना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN109A9				0	hi	When you create an XML filter for %PRODUCTNAME, you need to design an \<emph\>XSLT stylesheet\</emph\> that can convert to and from the OpenDocument XML file format.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN109B0				0	hi	For more information about the OpenDocument XML format, go to \<link href=\"https://xml.openoffice.org/\"\>https://xml.openoffice.org/\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN109C5				0	hi	If you want, you can include a \<emph\>template\</emph\> with your filter to apply %PRODUCTNAME styles to an XML document that you import.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN109CC				0	hi	You can also include the \<emph\>Document Type Definition\</emph\> (DTD) for the external XML format so you can validate the XML format, for example, when you test the filter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10531				0	hi	To Create an XML Filter				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN109E0				0	hi	Create an XSLT transformation \<emph\>stylesheet\</emph\> that maps the elements of the external XML format to the elements of the OpenDocument XML file format and back again.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN109E8				0	hi	Create a template that assigns %PRODUCTNAME styles to elements in the external XML format when you import a file in this format into %PRODUCTNAME.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN109EC				0	hi	In %PRODUCTNAME Writer, create a text document, and choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - XML Filter Settings\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN109F4				0	hi	Click \<emph\>New\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN109FC				0	hi	In the \<emph\>XML Filter\</emph\> dialog, click the \<emph\>General\</emph\> tab, and define the properties of the filter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A03				0	hi	In the \<emph\>Filter Name\</emph\> box, enter a name for the XML filter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10CA1				0	hi	This name is displayed in the \<emph\>XML Filter Settings\</emph\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A09				0	hi	In the \<emph\>Application\</emph\> box, select the %PRODUCTNAME application that the filter is for.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A0F				0	hi	In the \<emph\>Name of File Type\</emph\> box, enter the file type that the filter is for.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10CC6				0	hi	This name is displayed in the list of file types in the \<emph\>Open\</emph\>, \<emph\>Export\</emph\>, and \<emph\>Save As\</emph\> dialogs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A15				0	hi	In the \<emph\>File extension\</emph\> box, enter the extension for the exported file.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A1B				0	hi	फ़ाइल को अन्य XML फ़ाइलों से अलग करने के लिए,  *.xml से भिन्न एक्सटेंशन भरें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A1F				0	hi	On the \<emph\>Transformation\</emph\> tab page, define the transformation properties for the filter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A26				0	hi	(Optional) In the \<emph\>DocType\</emph\> box, enter the document type identifier for the external file format.				20200411 15:09:53
