helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_beamer.xhp	0	help	par_id3151111				0	hi	A fast way of copying from a data source into a text or spreadsheet document, or of creating forms based on a data source, is by drag-and-drop.				20200411 15:09:53
