helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	त्रुटि रपट औज़ार				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150616				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>Error Report Tool\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>reports;error reports\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>crash reports\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>activating;Error Report Tool\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150616				0	hi	\<variable id=\"error_report\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/error_report.xhp\" name=\"Error Report Tool\"\>Error Report Tool\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	hi	The Error Report Tool starts automatically when a program crash occurs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088				0	hi	The Error Report Tool gathers all necessary information that can help the program developers to improve the code, so that in later versions this error can possibly be avoided. Please help us to improve the software and send the generated error report.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148538				0	hi	त्रुटि रपट औजार प्रारंभ करना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3149811				0	hi	With most program crashes the Error Report Tool will start automatically.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154046				0	hi	रपट पूरा करना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3147335				0	hi	On the main Error Report Tool dialog, you can enter some additional information that may help the developers to localize the error. For example, if the error only appears after a change in your hardware or software environment, or if you clicked on a button, please include that information.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159399				0	hi	त्रुटि रपट भेजना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3150504				0	hi	The Error Report Tool uses the HTTP PUT / SOAP protocol to send the report data. You may optionally enter some descriptive text that will help us to identify the context of the program crash. Then click the \<emph\>Send\</emph\> button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	hi	You will not get an answer to your error report. If you need support, please visit the \<link href=\"text/shared/main0108.xhp\"\>support forum\</link\> on the Internet.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3153526				0	hi	You may choose to respond to questions that the developers may have about the reported error. Mark the check box if you allow to be contacted by e-mail, should additional information be required. By default this box is not marked, so you will not get any e-mail.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150792				0	hi	क्या डाटा भेजा गया?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3154366				0	hi	The error report consists of several files. The main file contains information about the error type, operating system name and version, memory usage, and the description that you entered. You can click the \<emph\>Show Report\</emph\> button on the main dialog of the Error Report Tool to view what will get sent in the main file.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3151177				0	hi	In addition, relevant memory contents and stack traces are gathered by some system standard tools ("dbhhelp.dll" on Windows systems, "pstack" on UNIX systems). This information will be sent also.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_fromgallery.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	गैलरी से चित्र नक़ल करना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_fromgallery.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145345				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>Gallery;dragging pictures to draw objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>draw objects;dropping Gallery pictures\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>drag and drop;from Gallery to draw objects\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_fromgallery.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145345				0	hi	\<variable id=\"dragdrop_fromgallery\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/dragdrop_fromgallery.xhp\" name=\"Copying Graphics From the Gallery\"\>Copying Graphics From the Gallery\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_fromgallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3155535				0	hi	यदि गैलरी से आप चित्र को पाठ, स्प्रेडशीट या प्रेज़ेन्टेशन दस्तावेज़ पर खींच लाते हैं, चित्र यहाँ प्रविष्ट हो जाएगा.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_fromgallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3149762				0	hi	If you release the graphic \<emph\>directly on a draw object\</emph\>, please note the following:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_fromgallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3153825				0	hi	If you move the graphic (drag it without pressing any key, in which case no additional symbol appears next to the mouse pointer), only the attributes are copied from the graphic and applied to the draw object on which you release the mouse button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_fromgallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3153665				0	hi	If you copy the graphic (drag it while holding down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key, in which case a plus sign appears next to the mouse pointer), the graphic will be inserted as an object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_fromgallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3154514				0	hi	If you create a hyperlink (drag while holding down Shift and \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, in which case a linking arrow appears next to the mouse pointer), the drawing object is replaced by the graphic from the Gallery, but the position and size of the replaced draw object are retained.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_queries.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	क्वैरीज़ के साथ कार्य करना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_queries.xhp	0	help	bm_id840784				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>databases;creating queries\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>filtering;data in databases\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>queries;defining (Base)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>defining;queries (Base)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>wizards;database queries\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Query Wizard (Base)\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_queries.xhp	0	help	par_idN105F9				0	hi	\<variable id=\"data_queries\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/data_queries.xhp\"\>Working with Queries\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_queries.xhp	0	help	par_idN10617				0	hi	If you often want to access only a subset of your data that can be well defined by a filter condition, you can define a query. This is basically a name for the new view at the filtered data. You open the query and see the current data in the table layout that you defined.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_queries.xhp	0	help	par_idN1061A				0	hi	क्वैरी विज़ॉर्ड के जरिए नया क्वैरी बनाना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_queries.xhp	0	help	par_idN1061E				0	hi	In %PRODUCTNAME you can create a new query using the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/querywizard00.xhp\"\>Query Wizard\</link\>:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_queries.xhp	0	help	par_idN10632				0	hi	Open the database file where you want to create the new query.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_queries.xhp	0	help	par_idN10636				0	hi	In the left pane of the database window, click the \<emph\>Queries\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_queries.xhp	0	help	par_idN1063E				0	hi	Click \<emph\>Use Wizard to Create Query\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_queries.xhp	0	help	par_idN10645				0	hi	डिज़ाइन दृश्य के साथ नया क्वैरी बनाना				20200411 15:09:53
