helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147571	15			0	hi	\<variable id=\"border_paragraph\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/border_paragraph.xhp\" name=\"Defining Borders for Paragraphs\"\>Defining Borders for Paragraphs\</link\> \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159233				0	hi	Setting a Predefined Border Style				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3156113				0	hi	संकेतक को अनुच्छेद में रखें जिसके लिए आप किनारा निर्धारित करना चाहते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3149398				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Format - Paragraph - Borders\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3156326				0	hi	Select one of the default border styles in the \<emph\>Default\</emph\> area.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3154285				0	hi	Select a line style and color for the selected border style in the \<emph\>Line\</emph\> area. These settings apply to all border lines that are included in the selected border style.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3153665				0	hi	Select the distance between the border lines and the page contents in the \<emph\>Spacing to contents\</emph\> area. You can only change distances to edges that have a border line defined.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3153543				0	hi	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to apply the changes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149237				0	hi	Setting a Customized Border Style				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3155388				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Format - Paragraph - Borders\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3148943				0	hi	In the \<emph\>User-defined\</emph\> area select the edge(s) that you want to appear in a common layout. Click on an edge in the preview to toggle the selection of an edge.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3148948				0	hi	Select a line style and color for the selected border style in the \<emph\>Line\</emph\> area. These settings apply to all border lines that are included in the selected border style.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3152811				0	hi	Repeat the last two steps for every border edge.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3150793				0	hi	Select the distance between the border lines and the page contents in the \<emph\>Spacing to contents\</emph\> area. You can only change distances to edges that have a border line defined.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3151178				0	hi	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to apply the changes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_graphic.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	दस्तावेज़ों में चित्र नक़ल करना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_graphic.xhp	0	help	bm_id3159201				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>drag and drop; pictures\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>pictures; drag and drop between documents\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>copying;pictures, between documents\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>pasting;pictures from other documents\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_graphic.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159201				0	hi	\<variable id=\"dragdrop_graphic\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/dragdrop_graphic.xhp\" name=\"Copying Graphics Between Documents\"\>Copying Graphics Between Documents\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id3155805				0	hi	You can copy a graphic from one document to another by drag-and-drop. If you plan to publish your document, please observe copyright laws and obtain the consent of the authors.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id3147576				0	hi	उस दस्तावेज़ को खोलें जिसमें आप चित्र वस्तु को प्रविष्ट करना चाहते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id3155338				0	hi	उस दस्तावेज़ को खोलें जहाँ से आप चित्र की नक़ल करना चाहते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id3149182				0	hi	Click the graphic while pressing the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key, to select it without executing any hyperlinks it may refer to.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id3151110				0	hi	माउस बटन को दबाएँ रखें तथा थोड़ी देर इंतजार करें ताकि वस्तु को आंतरिक मेमोरी में नक़ल किया जा सके.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id3149763	21			0	hi	Drag the graphic into the other document. \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WIN\"\>If the documents are not visible side by side, first move the mouse pointer to the button of the target document while keeping the mouse button pressed. The document in question is then displayed and you can move the mouse pointer into the document. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id3155628				0	hi	जैसे ही धूसर पाठ संकेतक उस स्थान को इंगित करता है जहाँ आप चित्र की नक़ल प्रविष्ट करना चाहते हैं, वैसे ही माउस बटन को छोड़ दें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id3150276				0	hi	यदि चित्र किसी हायपरलिंक से कनेक्टेड है तो हायपरलिंक प्रविष्ट होता है न कि चित्र.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	दस्तावेज़ के संस्करणों की तुलना करना 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154788				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>documents; comparing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>comparisons;document versions\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>versions; comparing documents\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>changes;comparing to original\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>review function; comparing documents\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154788				0	hi	\<variable id=\"redlining_doccompare\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/redlining_doccompare.xhp\" name=\"Comparing Versions of a Document\"\>Comparing Versions of a Document\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	par_id4186223				0	hi	The review function is available in %PRODUCTNAME for text documents and spreadsheet documents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	par_id3995178				0	hi	Imagine you have some co-authors or reviewers who collaborate with you writing your original document. One day you send out copies of your document to all reviewers. You ask them to edit the copy and send it back.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	par_id9948423				0	hi	Normally, the reviewers enable change tracking by \<emph\>Edit - Changes - Record\</emph\> and you can easily see the changes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	par_id3155421				0	hi	If one of the authors has made changes to a document without recording them, you can compare the changed document to your original document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	par_id3153087				0	hi	Open the reviewer's document and then choose \<emph\>Edit - Compare Document\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	par_id4208807				0	hi	You should always start with opening the newer document and compare it with the older document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	par_id3145315				0	hi	A file selection dialog appears. Select your older original document and confirm the dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	par_id3149762				0	hi	\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> combines both documents into the reviewer's document. All text passages that occur in the reviewer's document but not in the original are identified as having been inserted, and all text passages that got deleted by the reviewer are identified as deletions.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	par_id3145674				0	hi	You can now accept or reject the insertions and deletions. At the end you may save the reviewer's document as a new original with a new name.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	सामग्रियों को विशिष्ट फ़ॉर्मेट में चिपकाना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	bm_id3620715				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>clipboard;pasting formatted/unformatted text\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>inserting;clipboard options\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>pasting;formatted/unformatted text\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>text formats;pasting\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>formats;pasting in special formats\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10725				0	hi	\<variable id=\"pasting\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/pasting.xhp\"\>Pasting Contents in Special Formats\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10743				0	hi	Contents that are stored on the clipboard can be pasted into your document using different formats. In %PRODUCTNAME you can choose how to paste the contents using a dialog or a drop-down icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10746				0	hi	उपलब्ध विकल्प क्लिपबोर्ड की सामग्रियों पर निर्भर करता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144547360				0	hi	In Writer text documents, you can press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl+Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+V to paste the contents of the clipboard as unformatted text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10749				0	hi	प्रतीक मेन्यू के जरिए क्लिपबोर्ड की सामग्रियों को चिपकाना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10750				0	hi	Click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Paste\</emph\> icon on the Standard Bar to open the menu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10758				0	hi	विकल्पों में से कोई एक चुनें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN1075B				0	hi	If you do not like the result, click the \<emph\>Undo\</emph\> icon and then paste again with another option.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10762				0	hi	क्लिपबोर्ड की सामग्रियों को संवाद के जरिए चिपकाना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10769				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Paste special\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10771				0	hi	Select one of the options and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10774				0	hi	If you are in a spreadsheet and the contents of the clipboard are spreadsheet cells, then a different \<emph\>Paste Special\</emph\> dialog appears. Use the \<emph\>Paste Special\</emph\> dialog to copy cells using basic or advanced options.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN1077E				0	hi	\<emph\>Transpose\</emph\>: swaps the rows and the columns of the cell range to be pasted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10785				0	hi	\<emph\>Link\</emph\>: pastes the cell range as a link. If the source file changes, the pasted cells change also.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN1078C				0	hi	The other options are explained in the help, when you call the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02070000.xhp\"\>Paste Special\</link\> dialog from within %PRODUCTNAME Calc.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN107BA				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/02070000.xhp\"\>Paste Special\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
