helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_idN107E7				0	hi	Open the Windows \<emph\>Start\</emph\> button, choose \<emph\>Control Panel\</emph\>, double-click \<emph\>Add or Remove Programs\</emph\>, select the %PRODUCTNAME %PRODUCTVERSION entry, click \<emph\>Change\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3146794				0	hi	In Setup, choose the \<emph\>Modify\</emph\> option and click \<emph\>Next\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3151054				0	hi	Open the \<emph\>Optional Components\</emph\> entry, then open the \<emph\>Mobile Device Filters\</emph\> entry. Select the filters you want to install.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3154138				0	hi	Click \<emph\>Next\</emph\>, \<emph\>Next\</emph\>, \<emph\>Install\</emph\>, \<emph\>Finish\</emph\> to install the filters and exit the Setup program.				20200411 15:09:53
