helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3150499				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_LISTBOX_TP_HELP_SEARCH_LB_RESULT\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Lists the headings of the pages found in your full-text search. To display a page, double-click its entry.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
