helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150983				0	hi	अपरकेस शब्दों को जाँचें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3152582				0	hi	निर्धारित करता है कि वर्तनीजाँच के दौरान कैपिटलाइज़ेशन जाँचा जाए.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150826				0	hi	संख्या सहित शब्दों को जाँचें. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150208				0	hi	निर्धारित करता है कि शब्द जिसमें संख्याएँ हैं उन्हें भी जाँचना है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147509				0	hi	केपिटलाइज़ेशन जाँचें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154200				0	hi	वर्तनी जाँच के समय शब्द के प्रारंभ में केपिटल अक्षरों के उचित उपयोग को जाँचता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166424				0	hi	विशेष प्रदेशों को जाँचें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150345				0	hi	Specifies that special regions, such as drawing text, are checked during spellcheck.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166429				0	hi	टाइप करने के दौरान वर्तनी जांचें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155531				0	hi	\<variable id=\"automatisch\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SpellOnline\"\>Automatically checks spelling as you type, and underlines errors.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156291				0	hi	Typing errors are highlighted in the document with a red underline. If you place the cursor over a word marked in this way, you can open the context menu to obtain a list of corrections. Select a correction to replace the word. If you make the same mistake again while editing the document, it will be marked as an error again.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153815				0	hi	To place the word pair in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040200.xhp\" name=\"AutoCorrect replacement table\"\>AutoCorrect replacement table\</link\>, open the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040500.xhp\" name=\"AutoCorrect context menu\"\>AutoCorrect context menu\</link\> and choose \<emph\>AutoCorrect\</emph\>. Make your selection from the submenu. The word is replaced and at the same time the word pair is placed in the replacement table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150111	53			0	hi	हाइफ़नेशन् केलिए न्यूनतम शब्द संख्या: 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150316				0	hi	Specifies the minimum number of characters required for automatic hyphenation to be applied. \<ahelp hid=\"HID_LNGDLG_NUM_PREBREAK\" visibility=\"hidden\"\> Type the minimum number of characters that must come before or after the hyphen.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148823				0	hi	लाइन ब्रेक से पहले अक्षर				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156029				0	hi	Sets the minimum number of characters of the word to be hyphenated that must remain at the end of the line.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154956				0	hi	लाइन ब्रेक के बाद अक्षर				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149439				0	hi	अगली पंक्ति के लिए आवश्यक हायफनेटेड शब्द के लिए अक्षरों की न्यूनतम संख्या निर्धारित करता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156337				0	hi	पूछे बगैर हायफन डालें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3151130				0	hi	Specifies that you will never be asked for a manual hyphenation. If the field is not marked, when a word is not recognized you will be presented with a dialog for entering hyphens.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155900				0	hi	विशिष्ट क्षेत्र में हायफन डालें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155098				0	hi	निर्धारित करता है कि क्या हायफनेशन को पाद सूचनाओं, पाद-टिप्पणियों तथा शीर्ष-टिप्पणियों में भी लागू किया जाना है.				20200411 15:09:53
