helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01011000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148685				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR_NUMERICFIELD_OFA_TP_MEMORY_ED_UNDO\"\>You can specify the number of steps which can be undone by selecting a number from the list.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01011000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147530				0	hi	चित्र कैश				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01011000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145069				0	hi	The graphics cache saves the graphics contained in a document in your computer's main memory. This means that the attributes of a graphic stored in the cache do not have to be re-calculated if you return to the page containing the graphic after scrolling through a document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01011000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154924				0	hi	$[officename] के लिए (मे.बा.) इस्तेमाल करें				20200411 15:09:53
