helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3159346	43			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE_CB_NUMFMT_FORMATTING\"\>If\<emph\> Number format recognition \</emph\>is not marked, only input in the format that has been set at the cell is accepted. Any other input resets the format to \<emph\>Text\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
