helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3149416				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_REDLINE_OPT\"\>Defines the appearance of changes in the document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3156153				0	hi	To record or show changes in your text or spreadsheet document, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02230000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Changes\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Changes - Record\</emph\>\</link\> or \<emph\>Edit - Changes - Show\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155419				0	hi	पाठ प्रदर्शन				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3144510				0	hi	Defines the settings for displaying recorded changes. Select the type of change and the corresponding display attribute and color. The preview field shows the effect of the selected display options.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148550				0	hi	प्रविष्टियाँ / गुण				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_REDLINE_OPT_LB_INS_ATTR\"\>Specifies how changes in the document are displayed when text is inserted.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152812				0	hi	मिटाना / गुण				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154365				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_REDLINE_OPT_LB_DEL_ATTR\"\>Specifies how changes in the document are displayed when text is deleted. If you record text deletions, the text is displayed with the selected attribute (for example, strikethrough) and is not deleted.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148674				0	hi	परिवर्तित गुण / गुण				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3151042				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_REDLINE_OPT_LB_CHG_ATTR\"\>Defines how changes to text attributes are displayed in the document. These changes affect attributes such as bold, italic or underline.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153105				0	hi	रंग				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3145419				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_REDLINE_OPT_LB_CHG_COL\"\>You can also choose a color to display each type of recorded change. When you choose the condition "By author" in the list, the color is automatically determined by $[officename], then modified to match to the author of each change.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145607				0	hi	पंक्तियाँ बदलीं				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3149562				0	hi	To indicate which lines of the text have been changed, you can define a mark that appears in the left or right page margin.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145785				0	hi	चिह्नित				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154638				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_REDLINE_OPT:LB_MARKPOS\"\>Defines if and where changed lines in the document are marked.\</ahelp\> You can set the markings so that they always appear on the left or right page margin, or on the outer or inner margin.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163713				0	hi	रंग				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_REDLINE_OPT:LB_LC_COL\"\>Specifies the color for highlighting the changed lines in the text.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	छपाई विकल्प				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147323				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>printing; colors in grayscale\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>grayscale printing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>colors; printing in grayscale\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>printing; warnings\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>paper size warning\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148946				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010900.xhp\" name=\"Print Options\"\>Print Options\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3150359				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the print setting options.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148451				0	hi	छपाई डाटा कम करें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3154910				0	hi	You can reduce the amount of data to be sent to the printer. Reducing the print data increases the print speed because the print files are smaller. This makes it easier for printers with a smaller memory to print. Reducing print data can result in slightly lower print quality.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147085				0	hi	हेतु विन्यास				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3158407				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_RADIOBUTTON_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_RB_PRINTFILEOUTPUT\"\>Specifies whether the print settings apply to direct printing or to printing to a file.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145786				0	hi	पारदर्शिता कम करें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3159154				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_REDUCETRANSPARENCY\"\>If you mark this field the transparent objects will be printed like normal, non-transparent objects, depending on your selection in the following two option buttons.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3156444				0	hi	Transparency cannot be output directly to a printer. The areas of the document in which transparency is to be visible must therefore always be calculated as bitmaps and sent to the printer. Depending on the size of the bitmaps and the print resolution a large amount of data may result.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147441				0	hi	Automatically				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3150488				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_RADIOBUTTON_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_RB_REDUCETRANSPARENCY_AUTO\"\>Specifies that the transparency is only printed if the transparent area covers less than a quarter of the entire page.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149417				0	hi	कोई पारदर्शिता नहीं				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3153878				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_RADIOBUTTON_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_RB_REDUCETRANSPARENCY_NONE\"\>With this option transparency is never printed.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149960				0	hi	बिटमेप कम करें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3148455				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_REDUCEBITMAPS\"\>Specifies that bitmaps are printed with reduced quality. The resolution can only be reduced and not increased.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149400				0	hi	उच्च / सामान्य छपाई क्वालिटी				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3154510	76			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_RADIOBUTTON_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_RB_REDUCEBITMAPS_NORMAL\"\>High print quality corresponds to a resolution of 300dpi. Normal print quality corresponds to a resolution of 200dpi. \</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146969				0	hi	Resolution				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3154270				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_LISTBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_LB_REDUCEBITMAPS_RESOLUTION\"\>Specifies the maximum print quality in dpi. The resolution can only be reduced and not increased.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146789				0	hi	पारदर्शी वस्तुएं शामिल करें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_REDUCEBITMAPS_TRANSPARENCY\"\>If this field is marked, the reduction in print quality for bitmaps also applies to the transparent areas of objects.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154362				0	hi	अनुपात कम करें				20200411 15:09:53
