helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01160100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147571				0	hi	निर्धारित करता है कि कैसे डाटा स्रोत के कनेक्शनों को एकत्र किया जाए.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01160100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088	3			0	hi	The\<emph\> Connections \</emph\>facility allows you to stipulate that connections that are no longer needed are not deleted immediately, but are kept free for a certain period of time. If a new connection to the data source is needed in that period, the free connection can be used for this purpose.				20200411 15:09:53
