helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id5319071				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Type the name of the proxy server for HTTPS. Type the port in the right-hand field.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150543				0	hi	एफटीपी प्रॉक्सी				20200411 15:09:53
