helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10685				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select the language used for the user interface, for example menus, dialogs, help files. You must have installed at least one additional language pack or a multi-language version of %PRODUCTNAME.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id0125201009445727				0	hi	The "Default" entry selects the language of the user interface for the operating system. If this language is not available in the %PRODUCTNAME installation, the language of the %PRODUCTNAME installation is the default language.				20200411 15:09:53
