helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3145673				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR:NUMERICFIELD:RID_OFAPAGE_HTMLOPT:NF_SIZE7\"\>Use the spin buttons \<emph\>Size 1\</emph\> to \<emph\>Size 7\</emph\> to define the respective font sizes for the HTML <font size=1> to <font size=7> tags.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
