helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	par_id3157892				0	hi	<META NAME="Info field name" CONTENT="Field Content">				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	par_id3155855	22			0	hi	When you import an HTML containing these META tags, the contents of the tags are added to the corresponding $[officename] file property box. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	par_id0926200812164481				0	hi	Keywords must be separated by commas. A keyword can contain white space characters or semicolons.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163822				0	hi	युक्तियाँ आयात				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	par_id3155307				0	hi	When you import an HTML document, following META tags are automatically converted to $[officename] fields: <META HTTP-EQUIV="REFRESH"...> and <META NAME="..." ...> , where NAME equals to AUTHOR, CREATED, CHANGED, CHANGEDBY, DESCRIPTION, KEYWORDS or CLASSIFICATION.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	par_id3146146				0	hi	स्क्रिप्ट, टिप्पणियाँ तथा मेटा (META) टैग्स जिन्हें सीधे ही तालिका (TABLE) टैग के पहले रखा जाता है वे तालिका के प्रथम कक्ष में प्रविष्ट होते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	par_id3155366				0	hi	एचटीएमएल दस्तावेज़ के हेडर में स्क्रिप्ट तथा मेटा टैग्स दस्तावेज के प्रथम अनुच्छेद में आयात किए जाते हैं व वहीं एंकर किए जाते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	par_id3152885				0	hi	To set the options for importing HTML tags, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Load/Save - HTML Compatibility\</emph\>. A known META tag contains either "HTTP-EQUIV" or "NAME", and are imported as $[officename] comments. The only exception is <META NAME="GENERATOR"...>, which is ignored.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163717				0	hi	युक्तियाँ निर्यात				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\about_meta_tags.xhp	0	help	par_id3159180				0	hi	Comments and script fields at the beginning of the first paragraph in a document are exported to the header of an HTML document. If the document begins with a table, the first paragraph in the first cell of the table is exported to the header of the HTML document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020700.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	ऐशियाई टाइपोग्राफी				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020700.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155620				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>Asian typography\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>formatting; Asian typography\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>paragraphs; Asian typography\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>typography; Asian\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155620				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020700.xhp\" name=\"Asian Typography\"\>Asian Typography\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020700.xhp	0	help	par_id3153124				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Set the typographic options for cells or paragraphs in Asian language files. To enable Asian language support, choose \<emph\>Language Settings - Languages\</emph\> in the Options dialog box, and then select the \<emph\>Enabled\</emph\> box in the \<emph\>Asian language support\</emph\> area.\</ahelp\> The Asian typography options are ignored in HTML documents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147571				0	hi	लाइन परिवर्तन				20200411 15:09:53
