helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145072				0	hi	निषिद्ध अक्षरों की सूची को लाइन के प्रारंभ और अंत में लागू करें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020700.xhp	0	help	par_id3153683				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_TRISTATEBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_PARA_ASIAN_CB_AS_FORBIDDEN\"\>Prevents the characters in the list from starting or ending a line. The characters are relocated to either the previous or the next line.\</ahelp\> To edit the list of restricted characters, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language Settings - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01150100.xhp\" name=\"Asian Layout\"\>Asian Layout\</link\>\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149751				0	hi	हैंगिंग विराम-चिन्ह स्वीकारें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020700.xhp	0	help	par_id3149096				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_TRISTATEBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_PARA_ASIAN_CB_AS_HANG_PUNC\"\>Prevents commas and periods from breaking the line. Instead, these characters are added to the end of the line, even in the page margin.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
