helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152920				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select the type of record that you want to create. $[officename] inserts a number in the \<emph\>Type\</emph\> column of the record that corresponds to the type that you select here.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
