helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	bm_id3146765				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>regular expressions; list of\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>lists;regular expressions\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>replacing;tab stops (regular expressions)\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>tab stops;regular expressions\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>concatenation, see ampersand symbol\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>ampersand symbol, see also operators\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146765				0	hi	\<variable id=\"02100001\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/02100001.xhp\"\>List of Regular Expressions\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149741				0	hi	अक्षर				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3155577				0	hi	परिणाम / इस्तेमाल				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id6600543				0	hi	कोई भी अक्षर				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id9824518.00000001				0	hi	Represents the given character unless otherwise specified.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3152427				0	hi	.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149031				0	hi	Represents any single character except for a line break or paragraph break. For example, the search term "sh.rt" returns both "shirt" and "short".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154682				0	hi	^				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3155351				0	hi	Only finds the search term if the term is at the beginning of a paragraph. Special objects such as empty fields or character-anchored frames, at the beginning of a paragraph are ignored. Example: "^Peter".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3159194				0	hi	$				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3152542				0	hi	Only finds the search term if the term appears at the end of a paragraph. Special objects such as empty fields or character-anchored frames at the end of a paragraph are ignored. Example: "Peter$".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3156414				0	hi	*				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	hi	 "*" के सामने शून्य या अधिक अक्षर ढूंढता है. उदाहरण के लिए, "Ab*c" ढूंढता है "Ac", "Abc", "Abbc", "Abbbc", और इसी तरह.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147399				0	hi	+				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3157958				0	hi	 "+" के सामने एक या अधिक अक्षरों को ढूंढता है. उदाहरण के लिए, "AX.+4" ढूंढता है "AXx4", परंतु "AX4" नहीं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145313				0	hi	The longest possible string that matches this search pattern in a paragraph is always found. If the paragraph contains the string "AX 4 AX4", the entire passage is highlighted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3143267				0	hi	?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153684				0	hi	 "?" के सामने शून्य या कोई एक अक्षर ढूंढता है. उदाहरण के लिए, "Texts?" ढूंढता है "Text" तथा "Texts" तथा "x(ab|c)?y" ढूंढता है "xy", "xaby", या "xcy".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	hi	\\				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147209				0	hi	Search interprets the special character that follows the "\\" as a normal character and not as a regular expression (except for the combinations \\n, \\t, \\>, and \\<). For example, "tree\\." finds "tree.", not "treed" or "trees".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3152945				0	hi	\\n				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153700				0	hi	Represents a line break that was inserted with the Shift+Enter key combination. To change a line break into a paragraph break, enter \<emph\>\\n\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Search for\</emph\> and \<emph\>Replace with\</emph\> boxes, and then perform a search and replace.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id9262672				0	hi	\\n in the \<emph\>Search for\</emph\> text box stands for a line break that was inserted with the Shift+Enter key combination.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id2366100				0	hi	\\n in the \<emph\>Replace with\</emph\> text box stands for a paragraph break that can be entered with the Enter or Return key.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153258				0	hi	\\t				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3157809				0	hi	Represents a tab. You can also use this expression in the \<emph\>Replace with\</emph\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150670				0	hi	\\b				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153666				0	hi	Match a word boundary. For example, "\\bbook" finds "bookmark" but not "checkbook" whereas "book\\b" finds "checkbook" but not "bookmark". The discrete word "book" is found by both search terms.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149576				0	hi	^$				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3151245				0	hi	रिक्त अनुच्छेद को ढूंढता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3148550				0	hi	^.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3159413				0	hi	अनुच्छेद के प्रथम अक्षर को ढूंढता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147282				0	hi	& or $0				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153961				0	hi	Adds the string that was found by the search criteria in the \<emph\>Search for\</emph\> box to the term in the \<emph\>Replace with\</emph\> box when you make a replacement.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149650				0	hi	For example, if you enter "window" in the \<emph\>Search for\</emph\> box and "&frame" in the \<emph\>Replace with\</emph\> box, the word "window" is replaced with "windowframe".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150543				0	hi	You can also enter an "&" in the \<emph\>Replace with\</emph\> box to modify the \<emph\>Attributes\</emph\> or the \<emph\>Format\</emph\> of the string found by the search criteria.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145419				0	hi	[abc123]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154630				0	hi	किसी एक अक्षर का प्रतिनिधित्व करता है कोष्ठकों के बीच है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3156293				0	hi	[a-e]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149167				0	hi	Represents any of the characters that are between a and e, including both start and end characters				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id100520090232005				0	hi	The characters are ordered by their code numbers.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3155994				0	hi	[a-eh-x]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3148676				0	hi	किसी भी अक्षर का प्रतिनिधित्व करता है जो a-e तथा h-x के बीच नहीं है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145318				0	hi	[^a-s]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153351				0	hi	किसी भी अक्षर का प्रतिनिधित्व करता है जो a तथा s के बीच नहीं है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3156543				0	hi	\\xXXXX				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768				0	hi	अपने चार अक्षरों के हेक्साडेसीमल कोड (XXXX) पर आधारित विशिष्ट अक्षर का प्रतिनिधित्व करता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3159252				0	hi	The code for the special character depends on the font used. You can view the codes by choosing \<emph\>Insert - Special Character\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153951				0	hi	|				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154985				0	hi	Finds the terms that occur before the "|" and also finds the terms that occur after the "|". For example, "this|that" finds "this" and "that".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147376				0	hi	{2}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150103				0	hi	निर्धारित करता है कि ओपनिंग कोष्ठक के सामने कितनी मर्तबा अक्षर आएगा. उदाहरण के लिए, "tre{2}" ढूंढता है "tree".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3151289				0	hi	{1,2}				20200411 15:09:53
