helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153573				0	hi	Defines the characters inside the parentheses as a reference. You can then refer to the first reference in the current expression with "\\1", to the second reference with "\\2", and so on.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3156061				0	hi	For example, if your text contains the number 13487889 and you search using the regular expression (8)7\\1\\1, "8788" is found.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id2367931				0	hi	आप शब्दों को समूहीकृत करने के लिए () का इस्तेमाल भी कर सकते हैं, उदाहरण के लिए, "a(bc)?d" ढूंढता है "ad" या "abcd".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id9200109				0	hi	In the \<emph\>Replace with\</emph\> box:				20200411 15:09:53
