helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06050600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153063				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_NUM_POSITION:LB_ALIGN\"\>Set the alignment of the numbering symbols. Select "Left" to align the numbering symbol to start directly at the "Aligned at" position. Select "Right" to align the symbol to end directly before the "Aligned at" position. Select "Centered" to center the symbol around the "Aligned at" position.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06050600.xhp	0	help	par_id3147422				0	hi	The \<emph\>Numbering alignment\</emph\> option does not set the alignment of the paragraph.				20200411 15:09:53
