helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3160463				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ObjectAlignLeft\"\>Aligns the left edges of the selected objects. If only one object is selected in Draw or Impress, the left edge of the object is aligned to the left page margin.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
