helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150445	3			0	hi	\<variable id=\"mehrfachselektion\"\>To align the individual objects in a group, \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>choose \<emph\>Format - Group - Edit Group\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>double-click\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> to enter the group, select the objects, right-click, and then choose an alignment option. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
