helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	hd_id8296151				0	hi	Export bookmarks as named destinations				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_id4809411				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The bookmarks (targets of references) in PDF files can be defined as rectangular areas. Additionally, bookmarks to named objects can be defined by their names. Enable the checkbox to export the names of objects in your document as valid bookmark targets. This allows to link to those objects by name from other documents.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	hd_id6454969				0	hi	Convert document references to PDF targets				20200411 15:09:53
