helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05350400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154984				0	hi	Illumination				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05350400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155391				0	hi	Specify the light source for the object, as well as the color of the light source and of the ambient light. You can define up to eight different light sources.				20200411 15:09:53
