helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02200200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154230				0	hi	This menu command is inserted into \<emph\>Edit – Objects\</emph\> submenu by the application that created the linked object. Depending on the application, the “Open” command for the OLE object might have a different name.				20200411 15:09:53
