helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150037				0	hi	The text color is ignored when printing, if the \<emph\>Print black\</emph\> check box is selected in \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040400.xhp\" name=\"Writer - Print\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Print\</emph\>\</link\> in the Options dialog box.				20200411 15:09:53
