helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id2711264				0	hi	The Properties window of the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/rep_main.xhp\"\>Report Builder\</link\> always shows the properties of the currently selected object in the Report Builder view.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id1080660				0	hi	Press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Shift-F1\</item\> and point with the mouse at an input box to see a help text for this input box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id7175817				0	hi	On first start of the Report Builder, the Properties window shows the \<emph\>Data\</emph\> tab page for the whole report.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id9895931				0	hi	Select a table from the Contents list, then press Tab or click outside the input box to leave the input box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id3587145				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The Add Field window is shown automatically when you have selected a table in the Contents box and leave that box. You can also click the Add Field icon on the toolbar, or choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>View - Add Field\</item\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id6993926				0	hi	The \<emph\>General\</emph\> tab page can be used to change the name of the report, and to disable the Page Header or Page Footer areas, among others.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id3729361				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>To display the Data or General tab page for the whole report, choose Edit - Select Report.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id1768852				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Groups are kept together by page or by column (default). You must enable Keep Together also.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id6304818				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies in which context the page header will be printed: on all pages, or not on pages with a report header or footer.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id401623				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies in which context the page footer will be printed: on all pages, or not on pages with a report header or footer\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id2162236				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies to print repeated values.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id7022003				0	hi	If you click the Page Header or Page Footer area without selecting any object, you see the \<emph\>General\</emph\> tab page for that area.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id7004303				0	hi	You can edit some visual properties for the area.				20200411 15:09:53
