helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id8257087				0	hi	Select the format for the page numbers, either "Page N" or "Page N of M", where N stands for the current page number, and M for the total number of pages in the report.				20200411 15:09:53
