helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3166430				0	hi	SQL				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152993				0	hi	प्रभाव				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155377				0	hi	कोई फंक्शन नहीं				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155533				0	hi	कोई फंक्शन चलाया नहीं जा सकेगा.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3166420				0	hi	औसत				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145268				0	hi	AVG				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154486				0	hi	क्षेत्र का अंकगणितीय औसत (mean) की गणना करता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149979				0	hi	गणना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154260				0	hi	COUNT				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155810				0	hi	तालिका में रेकॉर्ड की संख्या निर्धारित करता है. रिक्त क्षेत्र गिना जा सकता है (a) या नहीं (b).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151333				0	hi	a) COUNT(*): Passing an asterisk as the argument counts all records in the table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152889				0	hi	b) COUNT(column): Passing a field name as an argument counts only fields in which the field name in question contains a value. Null values (empty fields) will not be counted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153067				0	hi	अधिकतम				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148840				0	hi	MAX				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159221				0	hi	क्षेत्र का अधिकतम मूल्य की गणना करता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146866				0	hi	न्यूनतम				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148604				0	hi	MIN				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3157982				0	hi	क्षेत्र के न्यूनतम मूल्य की गणना करता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154828				0	hi	योग				20200411 15:09:53
