helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154536				0	hi	संबद्ध क्षेत्र के कुल मूल्यों के योग की गणना करता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148820				0	hi	समूह				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145375				0	hi	GROUP BY				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149438				0	hi	Groups query data according to the field name selected. Functions are executed according to the specified groups. In SQL, this option corresponds to the GROUP BY clause. If a criterion is added, this entry appears in the SQL HAVING.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156038				0	hi	एसक्यूएल कथन में आप सीधे ही फ़ंक्शन काल प्रविष्ट कर सकते हैं. सिंटेक्स है:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156340				0	hi	SELECT FUNCTION(column) FROM table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155075				0	hi	उदाहरण के लिए, योग निकालने के लिए एसक्यूएल में फ़ंक्शन काल है:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154591				0	hi	SELECT SUM("Price") FROM "Article".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159205				0	hi	Except for the \<emph\>Group\</emph\> function, the above functions are so-called Aggregate functions. These are functions that calculate data to create summaries from the results. Additional functions that are not listed in the list box might be also possible. These depend on the specific database system in use and on the current state of the Base driver.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148651				0	hi	To use other functions not listed in the list box, you must enter them under \<emph\>Field\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155098				0	hi	You can also assign aliases to function calls. If the query is not to be displayed in the column header, enter the desired name under \<emph\>Alias\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155539				0	hi	एसक्यूएल वक्तव्य में संबंधित फंक्शन होगा:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149425				0	hi	SELECT FUNCTION() AS alias FROM table				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3144431				0	hi	उदाहरण				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154614				0	hi	SELECT COUNT(*) AS count FROM "Item"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154610				0	hi	यदि आप इस फ़ंक्शन को चलाते हैं तो, आप कोई अतिरिक्त स्तम्भ क्वैरी के लिए प्रविष्ट नहीं कर सकते हैं सिवाय इन स्तम्भों को "समूह" फ़ंक्शन के रुप में प्राप्त करने के.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154644				0	hi	\<emph\>Examples\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151120				0	hi	In the following example, a query is run through two tables: an "Item" table with the "Item_No" field and a "Suppliers" table with the "Supplier_Name" field. In addition, both tables have a common field name "Supplier_No."				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155144				0	hi	The following steps are required to create a query containing all suppliers who deliver more than three items.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153240				0	hi	"Item" तथा "Suppliers" तालिकाएँ क्वैरी डिज़ाइन में प्रविष्ट करें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148807				0	hi	Link the "Supplier_No" fields of the two tables if there is not already a relation of this type.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3161652				0	hi	Double-click the "Item_No" field from the "Item" table. Display the \<emph\>Function\</emph\> line using the context menu and select the Count function.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151009				0	hi	क्राइटेरियन के रूप में >3 प्रविष्ट करें तथा दृष्टिगोचर क्षेत्र को अक्षम करें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145601				0	hi	Double-click the "Supplier_Name" field in the "Suppliers" table and choose the Group function.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147512				0	hi	Run the query.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148638				0	hi	If the "price" (for the individual price of an article) and "Supplier_No" (for the supplier of the article) fields exist in the "Item" table, you can obtain the average price of the item that a supplier provides with the following query:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153045				0	hi	क्वैरी डिज़ाइन में "Item" तालिका प्रविष्ट करें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149802				0	hi	 "Price" तथा "Supplier_No" क्षेत्रों को दोहरा क्लिक करें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153554				0	hi	Enable the \<emph\>Function\</emph\> line and select the Average function from the "Price" field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155597				0	hi	You can also enter "Average" in the line for the alias name (without quotation marks).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151191				0	hi	 "Supplier_No" क्षेत्र के लिए समूह चुनें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155547				0	hi	Run the query.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147549				0	hi	निम्न कॉन्टेक्स्ट मेन्यू कमांड तथा प्रतीक उपलब्ध हैं:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154172				0	hi	Functions				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150414				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_QRYDGN_ROW_FUNCTION\"\>Shows or hides a row for selection of functions.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149872				0	hi	तालिका नाम				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147246				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_QRYDGN_ROW_FUNCTION\"\>Shows or hides the row for the table name.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145117				0	hi	अलियास नाम				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155754				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_QRYDGN_ROW_FUNCTION\"\>Shows or hides the row for the alias name.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153298				0	hi	स्पष्ट मूल्य				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147500				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_QRYDGN_ROW_FUNCTION\"\>Applies only distinct values to the query.\</ahelp\> This applies to records containing data that appears several times in the selected fields. If the \<emph\>Distinct Values\</emph\> command is active, you will see only one record in the query (DISTINCT). Otherwise, you will see all records corresponding to the query criteria (ALL).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150436	159			0	hi	For example, if the name "Smith" occurs several times in your address database, you can choose the\<emph\> Distinct Values\</emph\> command to specify in the query that the name "Smith" will occur only once.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152352	160			0	hi	For a query involving several fields, the combination of values from all fields must be unique so that the result can be formed from a specific record. For example, you have "Smith in Chicago" once in your address book and "Smith in London" twice. With the\<emph\> Distinct Values\</emph\> command, the query will use the two fields "last name" and "city" and return the query result "Smith in Chicago" once and "Smith in London" once.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149825				0	hi	एसक्यूएल में, यह कमांड DISTINCT प्रेडिकेट के तदनुरूप है .				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148926				0	hi	फ़िल्टर शर्तें फ़ॉर्मूलेट करना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153162				0	hi	When formulating filter conditions, various operators and commands are available to you. Apart from the relational operators, there are SQL-specific commands that query the content of database fields. If you use these commands in the $[officename] syntax, $[officename] automatically converts these into the corresponding SQL syntax. You can also enter the SQL command directly. The following tables give an overview of the operators and commands:				20200411 15:09:53
