helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148541				0	hi	The example will give you all of the entries where the item name begins with 'The *'. This means that you can also search for characters that would otherwise be interpreted as placeholders, such as *, ?, _, % or the period.				20200411 15:09:53
