helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149134				0	hi	To query the content of a text field, you must put the expression between single quotes. The distinction between uppercase and lowercase letters depends on the database in use. LIKE, by definition, is case-sensitive (though some databases don't see it that strict).				20200411 15:09:53
