helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151265				0	hi	=1 returns all records where the Yes/No field has the status "Yes" or "On" (selected in black),				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152450				0	hi	नहीं				20200411 15:09:53
