helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\querywizard05.xhp	0	help	par_idN10556				0	hi	Specifies whether to group the query. The data source must support the SQL statement "Order by clauses" to enable this page of the Wizard.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\querywizard05.xhp	0	help	par_idN10589				0	hi	समूह के अनुसार				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\querywizard05.xhp	0	help	par_idN1058D				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays all fields that are to be used to group the query.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
