helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154288				0	hi	\<variable id=\"sqltext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens a dialog where you can enter an SQL command for administering a database.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147275				0	hi	You can only enter administration commands in this dialog, such as Grant, Create Table, or Drop Table, and not filter commands. The commands that you can enter depend on the data source, for example, dBASE can only run some of the SQL commands list here.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154860				0	hi	To run an SQL query for filtering data in the database, use the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/02010100.xhp\" name=\"Query Design\"\>Query Design View\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11080000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149514				0	hi	चलाने के लिए कमांड 				20200411 15:09:53
