helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154515				0	hi	Creates a new \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/30000000.xhp\" name=\"Adabas database\"\>Adabas database\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
