helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\comment.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154657				0	hi	दस्तावेज़ के सूत्र में दिखाई न दे ऐसी टिप्पणी कैसे जोड़ी जा सकती है?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\comment.xhp	0	help	par_id3149499				0	hi	A comment begins with a double percent sign \<emph\>%%\</emph\>, and extends to the next line-end character (Enter key). Everything that lies in between is ignored and is not printed out. If there are percent signs in the text, they are treated as part of the text.				20200411 15:09:53
