helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153923				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH:METRICFIELD:RID_FONTSIZEDIALOG:6\"\>Select the relative size for names and other function elements in a formula in proportion to the base size.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
