helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090908.xhp	0	help	par_id3145790				0	hi	Here is an example of how to create a square root with \<emph\>$[officename] Math\</emph\>. If you want to use the example in your own formula, copy it to the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window using the clipboard.				20200411 15:09:53
