helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_net.xhp	0	help	par_id40589				0	hi	On the first page of the \<link href=\"text/schart/01/wiz_chart_type.xhp\"\>Chart Wizard\</link\> you can choose a chart type. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_net.xhp	0	help	hd_id1391338				0	hi	Net				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_net.xhp	0	help	par_id7812433				0	hi	A Net chart displays data values as points connected by some lines, in a grid net that resembles a spider net or a radar tube display.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_net.xhp	0	help	par_id3512375				0	hi	For each row of chart data, a radial is shown on which the data is plotted. All data values are shown with the same scale, so all data values should have about the same magnitude.				20200411 15:09:53
