helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_bar.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	Chart Type Column and Bar				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_bar.xhp	0	help	bm_id4919583				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>column charts\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>bar charts\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>chart types;column and bar\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_bar.xhp	0	help	hd_id649433				0	hi	\<variable id=\"type_column_bar\"\>\<link href=\"text/schart/01/type_column_bar.xhp\"\>Chart Type Column and Bar\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_bar.xhp	0	help	par_id3430585				0	hi	On the first page of the \<link href=\"text/schart/01/wiz_chart_type.xhp\"\>Chart Wizard\</link\> you can choose a chart type. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_bar.xhp	0	help	hd_id9826960				0	hi	Column				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_bar.xhp	0	help	par_id2244026				0	hi	This type shows a bar chart or bar graph with vertical bars. The height of each bar is proportional to its value. The x axis shows categories. The y axis shows the value for each category.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_bar.xhp	0	help	par_id1281167				0	hi	Normal - this subtype shows all data values belonging to a category next to each other. Main focus is on the individual absolute values, compared to every other value.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_bar.xhp	0	help	par_id3249000				0	hi	Stacked - this subtype shows the data values of each category on top of each other. Main focus is the overall category value and the individual contribution of each value within its category.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_bar.xhp	0	help	par_id6968901				0	hi	Percent - this subtype shows the relative percentage of each data value with regard to the total of its category. Main focus is the relative contribution of each value to the category's total.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_bar.xhp	0	help	par_id2224494				0	hi	You can enable a \<link href=\"text/schart/01/three_d_view.xhp\"\>3D view\</link\> of the data values. The "realistic" scheme tries to give the best 3D look. The "simple" scheme tries to mimic the chart view of other Office products.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_bar.xhp	0	help	par_id7359233				0	hi	For 3D charts, you can select the shape of each data value from Box, Cylinder, Cone, and Pyramid.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_bar.xhp	0	help	hd_id955839				0	hi	Bar				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_bar.xhp	0	help	par_id6596881				0	hi	This type shows a bar chart or bar graph with horizontal bars. The length of each bar is proportional to its value. The y axis shows categories. The x axis shows the value for each category.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_column_bar.xhp	0	help	par_id8750572				0	hi	The subtypes are the same as for the Column type.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	Y Axis				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040200.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145673				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>Y axes; formatting\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145673				0	hi	Y Axis				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155628	2			0	hi	\<variable id=\"yachse\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DiagramAxisY\"\>Opens the\<emph\> Y Axis \</emph\>dialog, to change properties of the Y axis.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
