helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147577				0	hi	Draws an arc in the current document. To draw an arc, drag an oval to the size you want, and then click to define the starting point of the arc. Move your pointer to where you want to place the endpoint and click. You do not need to click on the oval. To draw an arc that is based on a circle, hold down Shift while you drag.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152771				0	hi	\<image id=\"img_id3152778\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_arc.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152778\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
