helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ConnectorToolbox\"\>Open the \<emph\>Connectors\</emph\> toolbar, where you can add connectors to objects in the current slide. A connector is a line that joins objects, and remains attached when the objects are moved. If you copy an object with a connector, the connector is also copied.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
