helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154022				0	hi	\<variable id=\"table_insert\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/table_insert.xhp\" name=\"Including Spreadsheets in Slides\"\>Including Spreadsheets in Slides\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id4231086				0	hi	You can apply different methods to insert spreadsheet cells into your Impress slides or Draw pages:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id9209875				0	hi	Insert a native table - you enter the data into the cells and apply fancy formatting using the Table Design section on the Tasks pane.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3044526				0	hi	Insert a new table as an OLE object or insert an existing file as an OLE object - you can specify the link to a file to be a live link to the latest data saved in a spreadsheet file.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id137333				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter the number of columns for the new table.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id8626667				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter the number of rows for the new table.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551581				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Define the vertical alignment of selected or all cell contents. Split or merge cells.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551553				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>All selected cells are merged into one cell.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551535				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The selected cell is split into several cells. You see the Split Cells dialog box.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551651				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The cell contents are align at the top of the cells.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551697				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The cell contents are aligned vertically centered in the cells.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551632				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The cell contents are aligned at the bottom of the cells.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_idN10626				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Selects the current table.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551734				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Choose commands for the selected or all rows.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200804080035				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Distributes the height of the selected or all rows to the same size. The height of the table is not changed.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200804080063				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>If currently no cell is selected, all rows will be selected. If currently cells are selected, all rows containing the selected cells will be selected.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id091620080408008				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>If currently no cell is selected, a new row will be inserted at the bottom of the table. If currently cells are selected, as many new rows as the selection has will be inserted below the selection.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200804080050				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>All rows of the current selection will be deleted.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200804163012				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Choose commands for the selected or all columns.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200804163092				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Distributes the width of the selected or all columns to the same size. The width of the table is not changed.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200804163046				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>If currently no cell is selected, all columns will be selected. If currently cells are selected, all columns containing the selected cells will be selected.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200804163128				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>If currently no cell is selected, a new column will be inserted at the right border of the table. If currently cells are selected, as many new columns as the selection has will be inserted right of the selection.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200804163127				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>All columns of the current selection will be deleted.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200804163151				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Align the table within the page or slide.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id8594317				0	hi	Inserting a native table				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id7184972				0	hi	Go to the Impress slide or Draw page where you want to insert the table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id248115				0	hi	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Table\</item\> or use the Table icon on the Standard toolbar to insert a table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id2748496				0	hi	Double-click the table and enter or paste the data into the cells. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id8270210				0	hi	Select some cell contents and right-click to open the context menu. Choose commands to change the cell's contents, like font size and line spacing.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id6820276				0	hi	Right-click the table border to open the table's context menu. Use the table's context menu to enter a name and description for the table, or to distribute the rows or columns equally, among other commands.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551725				0	hi	Select some cells and right-click to open a context menu, where you can insert or delete rows and columns, among other commands. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id091620080355171				0	hi	To select a rectangular area of cells, point to a cell in one corner of the rectangle, hold down the mouse button, and drag the mouse to the opposite corner of the rectangle, then release the mouse button. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551880				0	hi	To select one cell, point to that cell, hold down the mouse button, and drag the mouse to the next cell and back, then release the mouse button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151075				0	hi	Inserting a new spreadsheet as an OLE object				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3150715				0	hi	You can add a blank $[officename] Calc spreadsheet to a slide as an OLE object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749				0	hi	Go to the slide where you want to insert the spreadsheet.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3146313	18			0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Insert - OLE- Object\</emph\>. Click \<emph\>Create new\</emph\> and select the %PRODUCTNAME Spreadsheet. Click OK. Click in the spreadsheet to enter your data. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id2466505				0	hi	Click outside the spreadsheet to view the slide.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3148870				0	hi	To resize the spreadsheet without resizing the cells, double-click the spreadsheet, and then drag a corner handle. To resize the cells of the spreadsheet, click the spreadsheet, and then drag a corner handle.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150215				0	hi	Inserting a spreadsheet from a file				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154765				0	hi	When you insert an existing spreadsheet into your slide, changes that are made to the original spreadsheet file are not updated on your slide. You can, however, make changes to the spreadsheet in your slide.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145112				0	hi	Go to the slide where you want to insert the spreadsheet.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153075				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Object - OLE Object\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3150391				0	hi	Select \<emph\>Create from file\</emph\>, and click \<emph\>Search\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3150537	20			0	hi	Locate the file you want to insert, and then click\<emph\> OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id1616565				0	hi	Enable the \<emph\>Link to file\</emph\> checkbox to insert the file as a live link.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155256				0	hi	The entire spreadsheet is inserted into your slide. If you want to change the sheet that is displayed, double-click the spreadsheet, and then select a different sheet.				20200411 15:09:53
