helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146119				0	hi	\<variable id=\"individual\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/individual.xhp\" name=\"Creating a Custom Slide Show\"\>Creating a Custom Slide Show\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3150344				0	hi	You can create custom slide shows to meet the needs of your audience using slides within the current presentation.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150715				0	hi	मनपसंद स्लाइड शो बनाने के लिए:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3153712				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Slide Show - Custom Slide Shows\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3153966	62			0	hi	Click \<emph\>New\</emph\> and enter a name for your slide show in the \<emph\>Name \</emph\>box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3150249				0	hi	Under \<emph\>Existing Slides\</emph\>, select the slides you want to add to your slide show, and click the \<emph\>>>\</emph\> button. Hold down Shift to select a range of slides, or Ctrl to select multiple slides.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3153916				0	hi	You can change the order of the slides in your custom slide show, by dragging and dropping the slides under \<emph\>Selected Slides\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151387				0	hi	मनपसंद स्लाइड शो प्रारंभ करने के लिए:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3147403				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Slide Show - Custom Slide Show\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
