helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3149943				0	hi	Click \<emph\>Start\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3145593	56			0	hi	If you want the selected custom slide show to start when you click the \<emph\>Slide Show\</emph\> icon on the\<emph\> Presentation\</emph\> toolbar, or when you press F5, select \<emph\>Use Custom Slide Show\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145169				0	hi	स्लाइड शो चलाने हेतु विकल्प				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150335				0	hi	स्लाइड शो को हमेशा वर्तमान स्लाइड से प्रारंभ करने के लिए:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\individual.xhp	0	help	par_id3150014				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Impress - General\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
