helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\arrange_slides.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149499				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>slides; arranging\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>presentations; arranging slides\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>changing;order of slides\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>arranging;slides\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>ordering;slides\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
