helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_arrow_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3156382				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Format - Line\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Line Styles\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
