helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3148725	51			0	hi	In the \<emph\>Fill \</emph\>area, do one of the following:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3153040				0	hi	Select \<emph\>Color\</emph\>, and then click a color in the list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3150866				0	hi	Select \<emph\>Gradient\</emph\>, and then click a gradient style in the list.				20200411 15:09:53
