helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10792				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The animation list displays all animations for the current slide. \</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10798				0	hi	Each slide has one main animation that runs when the slide is shown.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1079C				0	hi	More animations may be present, which run when a shape is shown. If any of these animated shapes are present, they are listed in the lower half of the animation list. Tabs display the name of each shape that runs an animation.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1079F				0	hi	Each list entry can consist of the following columns, from left to right:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A5				0	hi	एक अतिरिक्त + अक्षर यह संकेत करता है कि पाठ अनुच्छेद एनीमेटेड हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
