helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107AD				0	hi	Column three shows a mouse icon if the animation is started by a mouse click, and a clock if the animation starts after the previous animation ends.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B1				0	hi	स्तम्भ चार में एक प्रतीक एनीमेशन प्रभाव को दिखाता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B5				0	hi	The fifth column shows the name of the shape for this animation effect and optionally the first characters of animated text.				20200411 15:09:53
