helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\super_subscript.xhp	0	help	par_id3154684				0	hi	कक्ष में अक्षर को चुनें जिसे आप सुपरस्क्रिप्ट या सबस्क्रिप्ट के रूप में रखना चाहते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\super_subscript.xhp	0	help	par_id3150439				0	hi	If, for example, you want to write H20 with a subscript 2, select the 2 in the cell (not in the input line).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\super_subscript.xhp	0	help	par_id3149260				0	hi	Open the context menu for the selected character and choose \<emph\>Character\</emph\>. You will see the \<emph\>Character\</emph\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\super_subscript.xhp	0	help	par_id3153142				0	hi	Click the \<emph\>Font Position\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\super_subscript.xhp	0	help	par_id3153954				0	hi	Select the \<emph\>Subscript\</emph\> option and click OK.				20200411 15:09:53
