helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150769				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>series; calculating\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>calculating; series\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>linear series\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>growth series\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>date series\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>powers of 2 calculations\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>cells; filling automatically\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>automatic cell filling\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>AutoFill function\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>filling;cells, automatically\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150769				0	hi	\<variable id=\"calc_series\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/calc_series.xhp\" name=\"Automatically Calculating Series\"\>Automatically Filling in Data Based on Adjacent Cells\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A8				0	hi	स्वतःभरें कमांड से या श्रेणी कमांड से कक्षों को आप डाटा से स्वचालित भर सकते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D3				0	hi	स्वचालित-भरना इस्तेमाल करना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D7				0	hi	स्वतःभरें स्वचालित रूप से डाटा श्रेणी ज़ेनरेट करता है जो निर्धारित पैटर्न पर आधारित होता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_id3154319				0	hi	On a sheet, click in a cell, and type a number.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN106CB				0	hi	किसी अन्य कक्ष में क्लिक करें तथा वापस उसी कक्ष में क्लिक करें जहाँ आपने संख्या टाइप किया है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_id3145272				0	hi	Drag the fill handle in the bottom right corner of the cell across the cells that you want to fill, and release the mouse button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_id3145801				0	hi	कक्ष आरोही संख्याओं से भरे जाएँगे.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EE				0	hi	To quickly create a list of consecutive days, enter \<item type=\"literal\"\>Monday\</item\> in a cell, and drag the fill handle.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_id9720145				0	hi	Hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>if you do not want to fill the cells with different values.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_id3154490				0	hi	If you select two or more adjacent cells that contain different numbers, and drag, the remaining cells are filled with the arithmetic pattern that is recognized in the numbers. The AutoFill function also recognizes customized lists that are defined under \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc - Sort Lists\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN10737				0	hi	You can double-click the fill handle to automatically fill all empty columns of the current data block. For example, first enter Jan into A1 and drag the fill handle down to A12 to get the twelve months in the first column. Now enter some values into B1 and C1. Select those two cells, and double-click the fill handle. This fills automatically the data block B1:C12.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN10713				0	hi	निर्धारित श्रेणी इस्तेमाल करना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749				0	hi	शीट में कक्ष दायरा चुनें जिसे आप भरना चाहते हैं				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_id3154754				0	hi	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit - Fill - Series\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN10716				0	hi	श्रेणी के लिए पैरामीटर चुनें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN10731				0	hi	If you select a \<emph\>linear\</emph\> series, the increment that you enter is \<emph\>added\</emph\> to each consecutive number in the series to create the next value.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN1073C				0	hi	If you select a \<emph\>growth\</emph\> series, the increment that you enter is \<emph\>multiplied\</emph\> by each consecutive number to create the next value.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN10747				0	hi	If you select a \<emph\>date\</emph\> series, the increment that you enter is added to the time unit that you specify.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_id3159173				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060400.xhp\" name=\"Sort lists\"\>Sort lists\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	Creating Pivot Tables				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148491				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>pivot tables\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>pivot table function; calling up and applying\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148491				0	hi	\<variable id=\"datapilot_createtable\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/datapilot_createtable.xhp\" name=\"Creating Pivot Tables\"\>Creating Pivot Tables\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3156023				0	hi	Position the cursor within a range of cells containing values, row and column headings.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3147264				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Data - Pivot Table - Create\</emph\>. The \<emph\>Select Source\</emph\> dialog appears. Choose \<emph\>Current selection\</emph\> and confirm with \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. The table headings are shown as buttons in the \<emph\>Pivot Table\</emph\> dialog. Drag these buttons as required and drop them into the layout areas "Page Fields", "Column Fields", "Row Fields" and "Data Fields".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3150868				0	hi	वांछित बटन को चार में से किसी एक क्षेत्र पर खींच लाएँ.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id7599414				0	hi	Drag a button to the \<emph\>Page Fields\</emph\> area to create a button and a listbox on top of the generated pivot table. The listbox can be used to filter the pivot table by the contents of the selected item. You can use drag-and-drop within the generated pivot table to use another page field as a filter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3154011				0	hi	If the button is dropped in the \<emph\>Data Fields\</emph\> area it will be given a caption that also shows the formula that will be used to calculate the data.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3146974				0	hi	By double-clicking on one of the fields in the \<emph\>Data Fields\</emph\> area you can call up the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12090105.xhp\" name=\"Data Field\"\>\<emph\>Data Field\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3156286				0	hi	Use the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Data Field\</item\> dialog to select the calculations to be used for the data. To make a multiple selection, press the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>key while clicking the desired calculation.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3150329				0	hi	The order of the buttons can be changed at any time by moving them to a different position in the area with the mouse.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3153714				0	hi	Remove a button by dragging it back to the area of the other buttons at the right of the dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3147338				0	hi	To open the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12090105.xhp\" name=\"Data Field\"\>\<emph\>Data Field\</emph\>\</link\> dialog, double-click one of the buttons in the \<emph\>Row\</emph\> or \<emph\>Column\</emph\> area. Use the dialog to select if and to what extent \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> calculates display subtotals.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3154020				0	hi	Exit the Pivot Table dialog by pressing OK. A \<emph\>Filter\</emph\> button will now be inserted, or a page button for every data field that you dropped in the \<emph\>Page Fields\</emph\> area. The pivot table is inserted further down.				20200411 15:09:53
