helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\specialfilter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153566				0	hi	Specify that only rows which either have the value \<item type=\"literal\"\>January\</item\> in the \<emph\>Month\</emph\> cells OR a value of under 160000 in the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> cells will be displayed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\specialfilter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147372				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Data - Filter - Advanced Filter\</emph\>, and then select the range A20:E22. After you click OK, only the filtered rows will be displayed. The other rows will be hidden from view.				20200411 15:09:53
