helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\webquery.xhp	0	help	par_id3155131				0	hi	With the help of the \<emph\>Web Page Query ($[officename] Calc)\</emph\> import filter, you can insert tables from HTML documents in a Calc spreadsheet.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\webquery.xhp	0	help	par_id3148575				0	hi	You can use the same method to insert ranges defined by name from a Calc or Microsoft Excel spreadsheet.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\webquery.xhp	0	help	par_id3149664				0	hi	निम्न प्रविष्ट विधियाँ उपलब्ध हैं:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\webquery.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146976				0	hi	संवादों के जरिए प्रविष्ट करना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\webquery.xhp	0	help	par_id3154319				0	hi	कक्ष संकेतक को वहाँ सेट करता है जहाँ नई सामग्री प्रविष्ट की जानी है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\webquery.xhp	0	help	par_id3145750				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Link to External Data\</emph\>. This opens the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04090000.xhp\"\>External Data\</link\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\webquery.xhp	0	help	par_id3149958				0	hi	Enter the URL of the HTML document or the name of the spreadsheet. Press Enter when finished. Click the \<emph\>...\</emph\> button to open a file selection dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\webquery.xhp	0	help	par_id3149400				0	hi	संवाद के बड़े सूची बक्से में,  नामित दायरे व तालिकाएँ चुनें जो आप प्रविष्ट करना चाहते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\webquery.xhp	0	help	par_id3155064				0	hi	आप यह भी निर्धारित कर सकते हैं कि दायरे व तालिकाएँ प्रत्येक n सेकण्डों में अद्यतन हों.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\webquery.xhp	0	help	par_id3155443				0	hi	The import filter can create names for cell ranges on the fly. As much formatting as possible is retained, while the filter intentionally does not load any images.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\webquery.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149021				0	hi	नेविगेटर के जरिए प्रविष्ट करना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\webquery.xhp	0	help	par_id3153965				0	hi	Open two documents: the $[officename] Calc spreadsheet in which the external data is to be inserted (target document) and the document from which the external data derives (source document).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\webquery.xhp	0	help	par_id3150205				0	hi	लक्ष्य दस्तावेज़ में नेविगेटर खोलें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\webquery.xhp	0	help	par_id3152990				0	hi	In the lower combo box of the Navigator select the source document. The Navigator now shows the range names and database ranges or the tables contained in the source document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\webquery.xhp	0	help	par_id3148842	20			0	hi	In the Navigator select the \<emph\>Insert as link\</emph\> drag mode \<image id=\"img_id3152985\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20238.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152985\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>.				20200411 15:09:53
