helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\webquery.xhp	0	help	par_id3144768				0	hi	If you have loaded an HTML document with the \<emph\>Web Page Query\</emph\> filter as the source document, you will find the tables in the Navigator, named continuously from "HTML_table1" onwards, and also two range names that have been created:				20200411 15:09:53
