helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	par_id3150519				0	hi	You will see the commands \<emph\>Row Height\</emph\> and \<emph\>Optimal row height\</emph\>. Choosing either opens a dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
