helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\database_define.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	डाटाबेस दायरा पारिभाषित करना 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\database_define.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154758				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>tables; database ranges\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>database ranges; defining\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>ranges; defining database ranges\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>defining;database ranges\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\database_define.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154758				0	hi	\<variable id=\"database_define\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/database_define.xhp\" name=\"Defining Database Ranges\"\>Defining a Database Range\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\database_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768				0	hi	You can define a range of cells in a spreadsheet to use as a database. Each row in this database range corresponds to a database record and each cell in a row corresponds to a database field. You can sort, group, search, and perform calculations on the range as you would in a database.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\database_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3145801	82			0	hi	You can only edit and access a database range in the spreadsheet that contains the range. You cannot access the database range in the %PRODUCTNAME Data Sources view. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\database_define.xhp	0	help	par_idN10648				0	hi	To define a database range				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\database_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3155064				0	hi	कक्ष दायरा चुनें जिसे आप डाटाबेस दायरा के रूप में निर्धारित करना चाहते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\database_define.xhp	0	help	par_idN10654				0	hi	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Data - Define Range\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\database_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3153715				0	hi	In the \<emph\>Name\</emph\> box, enter a name for the database range.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\database_define.xhp	0	help	par_idN1066A				0	hi	Click \<emph\>More\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\database_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3154253				0	hi	डाटाबेस दायरा के लिए विकल्प निर्धारित करें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\database_define.xhp	0	help	par_idN10675				0	hi	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	Merging and Splitting Cells				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147240				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>cells; merging/unmerging\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>tables; merging cells\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>cell merges\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>unmerging cells\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>merging;cells\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	hd_id8005005				0	hi	\<variable id=\"table_cellmerge\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/table_cellmerge.xhp\" name=\"Merging and Unmerging Cells\"\>Merging and Unmerging Cells\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	par_id8049867				0	hi	You can select adjacent cells, then merge them into a single cell. Conversely, you can take a large cell that has been created by merging single cells, and divide it back into individual cells.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	par_id0509200913480176				0	hi	When you copy cells into a target range containing merged cells, the target range gets unmerged first, then the copied cells are pasted in. If the copied cells are merged cells, they retain their merge state.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	hd_id235602				0	hi	Merging Cells				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	par_id1272927				0	hi	Select the adjacent cells.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	par_id6424146				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Format - Merge Cells\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	hd_id451368				0	hi	Canceling the merging of cells				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	par_id7116611				0	hi	Place the cursor in the cell to be split.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	par_id9493087				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Format - Merge Cells\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
