helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\integer_leading_zero.xhp	0	help	par_id3153194				0	hi	शून्य से प्रारंभ होने वाले पूर्णांकों को प्रविष्ट करने के यहाँ कई तरीके हैं:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\integer_leading_zero.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119				0	hi	Enter the number as text. The easiest way is to enter the number starting with an apostrophe (for example, \<item type=\"input\"\>'0987\</item\>). The apostrophe will not appear in the cell, and the number will be formatted as text. Because it is in text format, however, you cannot calculate with this number.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\integer_leading_zero.xhp	0	help	par_id3154013				0	hi	Format a cell with a number format such as \<item type=\"input\"\>\\0000\</item\>. This format can be assigned in the \<emph\>Format code\</emph\> field under the \<emph\>Format - Cells - Numbers\</emph\> tab, and defines the cell display as "always put a zero first and then the integer, having at least three places, and filled with zeros at the left if less than three digits".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\integer_leading_zero.xhp	0	help	par_id3153158				0	hi	If you want to apply a numerical format to a column of numbers in text format (for example, text "000123" becomes number "123"), do the following:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\integer_leading_zero.xhp	0	help	par_id3149377				0	hi	Select the column in which the digits are found in text format. Set the cell format in that column as "Number".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\integer_leading_zero.xhp	0	help	par_id3154944	60			0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Find & Replace\</emph\>               				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\integer_leading_zero.xhp	0	help	par_id3154510	61			0	hi	In the \<emph\>Search for\</emph\> box, enter \<item type=\"input\"\>^[0-9]\</item\>               				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\integer_leading_zero.xhp	0	help	par_id3155068	62			0	hi	In the \<emph\>Replace with\</emph\> box, enter \<item type=\"input\"\>&\</item\>               				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\integer_leading_zero.xhp	0	help	par_id3149018	63			0	hi	Check \<emph\>Regular expressions\</emph\>               				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\integer_leading_zero.xhp	0	help	par_id3156382	64			0	hi	Check \<emph\>Current selection only\</emph\>               				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\integer_leading_zero.xhp	0	help	par_id3146916	65			0	hi	Click \<emph\>Replace All\</emph\>               				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	उपयोक्ता पारिभाषित संख्या फ़ॉर्मेट				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	bm_id3143268				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>numbers;user-defined formatting\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>formatting; user-defined numbers\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>number formats; millions\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>format codes; user-defined number formats\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143268				0	hi	\<variable id=\"format_value_userdef\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/format_value_userdef.xhp\" name=\"User-defined Number Formats\"\>User-defined Number Formats\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3150400				0	hi	You can define your own number formats to display numbers in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Calc.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3150767				0	hi	उदाहरण के रुप में, संख्या 10,200,000 को 1.02 करोड़ (10.2 मिलियन) में दिखाने के लिए:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3150868				0	hi	उन कक्षों को चुनें जिसमें आप नया, उपयोक्ता निर्धारित फ़ॉर्मेट लागू करना चाहते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3149664				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Format - Cells - Numbers\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3149260				0	hi	In the \<emph\>Categories\</emph\> list box select "User-defined".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3148646				0	hi	In the \<emph\>Format code\</emph\> text box enter the following code:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3152596				0	hi	.#,, "मिलियन"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3144764				0	hi	ठीक है पर क्लिक करें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3155417				0	hi	The following table shows the effects of rounding, thousands delimiters (,), decimal delimiters (.) and the placeholders # and 0.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3146971				0	hi	संख्या				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3154757				0	hi	.#,, "मिलियन"				20200411 15:09:53
