helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	शीटों के नाम बदलना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150398				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>renaming;sheets\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>sheet tabs;renaming\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>tables;renaming\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>names; sheets\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150398				0	hi	\<variable id=\"rename_table\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/rename_table.xhp\" name=\"Renaming Sheets\"\>Renaming Sheets\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3155131				0	hi	शीट के नाम को क्लिक करें जिसे आप बदलना चाहते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3146976				0	hi	Open the context menu and choose the \<emph\>Rename Sheet\</emph\> command. A dialog box appears where you can enter a new name.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3149260				0	hi	Enter a new name for the sheet and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3149667				0	hi	Alternatively, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option key\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt key\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and click on any sheet name and enter the new name directly.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id0909200810502833				0	hi	Sheet names can contain almost any character. Some naming restrictions apply when you want to save the spreadsheet to Microsoft Excel format.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id090920081050283				0	hi	When saving to Microsoft Excel format, the following characters are not allowed in sheet names:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id090920081050281				0	hi	colon :				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id0909200810502897				0	hi	back slash \\				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id090920081050299				0	hi	forward slash /				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id0909200810502913				0	hi	question mark ?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id090920081050298				0	hi	asterisk *				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id0909200810502969				0	hi	left square bracket [				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id0909200810502910				0	hi	right square bracket ]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id0909200810502971				0	hi	single quote ' as the first or last character of the name				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id090920081050307				0	hi	In cell references, a sheet name has to be enclosed in single quotes ' if the name contains other characters than alphanumeric or underscore. A single quote contained within a name has to be escaped by doubling it (two single quotes). For example, you want to reference the cell A1 on a sheet with the following name:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id0909200810503071				0	hi	This year's sheet				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id0909200810503054				0	hi	The reference must be enclosed in single quotes, and the one single quote inside the name must be doubled:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id0909200810503069				0	hi	'This year''s sheet'.A1				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3155444				0	hi	The name of a sheet is independent of the name of the spreadsheet. You enter the spreadsheet name when you save it for the first time as a file. The document can contain up to 256 individual sheets, which can have different names.				20200411 15:09:53
