helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3153340				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DAI_FUNC_DIFFWEEKS\"\>Calculates the difference in weeks between two dates.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
