helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150037				0	hi	उदाहरण				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3147614				0	hi	WEEKSINYEAR(A1) returns 53 if A1 contains 1970-02-17, a valid date for the year 1970.				20200411 15:09:53
