helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id6776940				0	hi	The Options dialog for the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/solver.xhp\"\>Solver\</link\> is used to set some options.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id393993				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select a solver engine. The listbox is disabled if only one solver engine is installed. Solver engines can be installed as extensions.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id5871761				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Configure the current solver.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id6531266				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>If the current entry in the Settings listbox allows to edit a value, you can click the Edit button. A dialog opens where you can change the value.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id3912778				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter or change the value.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id3163853				0	hi	Use the Options dialog to configure the current solver engine.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id121158				0	hi	You can install more solver engines as extensions, if available. Open Tools - Extension Manager and browse to the Extensions web site to search for extensions.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id3806878				0	hi	Select the solver engine to use and to configure from the listbox. The listbox is disabled if onle one solver engine is installed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id130619				0	hi	In the Settings box, check all settings that you want to use for the current goal seeking operation. If the current option offers different values, the Edit button is enabled. Click Edit to open a dialog where you can change the value.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id9999694				0	hi	Click OK to accept the changes and to go back to the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/solver.xhp\"\>Solver\</link\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
