helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150447				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ShowColumn\"\>Choose this command to show previously hidden rows or columns.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155131				0	hi	To show a column or row, select the range of rows or columns containing the hidden elements, then choose \<emph\>Format - Row - Show\</emph\> or \<emph\>Format - Column - Show\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145748				0	hi	To show all hidden cells, first click in the field in the upper left corner. This selects all cells of the table.				20200411 15:09:53
