helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3148896				0	hi	\<item type=\"input\"\>=CELL("FILENAME";D2)\</item\> returns 'file:///X:/dr/own.sxc'#$Sheet1, if the formula in the current document X:\\dr\\own.sxc is located in Sheet1.				20200411 15:09:53
