helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151304				0	hi	सूत्र				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149898				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_FAP_FORMULA\"\>Displays the created formula. Type your entries directly, or create the formula using the wizard.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153249				0	hi	पीछे				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152869				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FORMULA:BTN_BACKWARD\"\>Moves the focus back through the formula components, marking them as it does so.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146966				0	hi	To select a single function from a complex formula consisting of several functions, double-click the function in the formula window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155762				0	hi	अगला				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149316	55			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FORMULA:BTN_FORWARD\"\>Moves forward through the formula components in the formula window.\</ahelp\> This button can also be used to assign functions to the formula. If you select a function and click the \<emph\>Next \</emph\>button, the selection appears in the formula window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159262				0	hi	सूत्र विंडो में हस्तांतरण के लिए चयन विंडो में किसी फ़ंक्शन पर दोहरा क्लिक करें.				20200411 15:09:53
