helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156400				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060100.xhp\" name=\"List of Categories and Functions\"\>List of Categories and Functions\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
