helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3154949				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_BESTIMMTHEITSMASS\"\>Returns the square of the Pearson correlation coefficient based on the given values.\</ahelp\> RSQ (also called determination coefficient) is a measure for the accuracy of an adjustment and can be used to produce a regression analysis.				20200411 15:09:53
