helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3156317	68			0	hi	            \<emph\>Number\</emph\> is the value between \<emph\>Start\</emph\> and \<emph\>End\</emph\> at which to evaluate the function.				20200411 15:09:53
