helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3166156				0	hi	\<emph\>DataX\</emph\> (optional) represents the X Data array.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3166176				0	hi	\<emph\>NewDataX\</emph\> (optional) represents the array of the X data, which are used for recalculating values.				20200411 15:09:53
