helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154684	6			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_DBNAMES:BTN_SIZE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Automatically inserts new rows and columns into the database range in your document when new records are added to the database.\</ahelp\> To manually update the database range, choose \<emph\>Data - Refresh\</emph\> \<emph\>Range\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
