helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_yearfrac.xhp	0	help	par_id3150899				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_YEARFRAC\"\> The result is a number between 0 and 1, representing the fraction of a year between \<emph\>StartDate\</emph\> and \<emph\>EndDate\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
