helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3149283				0	hi	\<item type=\"input\"\>=NORMDIST(70;63;5;0)\</item\> returns 0.03.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3149448				0	hi	\<item type=\"input\"\>=NORMDIST(70;63;5;1)\</item\> returns 0.92.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	bm_id3152934				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>PEARSON function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
