helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3153216				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_PEARSON\"\>Returns the Pearson product moment correlation coefficient r.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
