helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150440				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Language - Hyphenation\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156441				0	hi	The \<emph\>Format Cells\</emph\> dialog appears with the \<emph\>Alignment\</emph\> tab page open.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149260				0	hi	Mark the \<emph\>Wrap text automatically\</emph\> and \<emph\>Hyphenation active\</emph\> check boxes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153094				0	hi	ड्राइंग वस्तुओं के लिए हायफ़नेशन				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148577				0	hi	ड्राइंग वस्तु को चुनें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156285				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Language - Hyphenation\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147394				0	hi	Each time you call the command you turn the hyphenation for the drawing object on or off. A check mark shows the current status.				20200411 15:09:53
