helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_now.xhp	0	help	par_id3154897				0	hi	NOW()				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_now.xhp	0	help	par_id4598529				0	hi	NOW is a function without arguments.				20200411 15:09:53
