helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_now.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774				0	hi	\<item type=\"input\"\>=NOW()-A1\</item\> returns the difference between the date in A1 and now. Format the result as a number.				20200411 15:09:53
