helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_timevalue.xhp	0	help	par_id3152556	165			0	hi	         \<emph\>Text\</emph\> is a valid time expression and must be entered in quotation marks.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_timevalue.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146815				0	hi	उदाहरण				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_timevalue.xhp	0	help	par_id3146829	167			0	hi	         \<item type=\"input\"\>=TIMEVALUE("4PM")\</item\> returns 0.67. When formatting in time format HH:MM:SS, you then get 16:00:00.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_timevalue.xhp	0	help	par_id3153632	168			0	hi	         \<item type=\"input\"\>=TIMEVALUE("24:00")\</item\> returns 1. If you use the HH:MM:SS time format, the value is 00:00:00.				20200411 15:09:53
