helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id8455153				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The ASC function converts full-width to half-width ASCII and katakana characters. Returns a text string.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id9912411				0	hi	See \<link href=\"https://wiki.openoffice.org/wiki/Calc/Features/JIS_and_ASC_functions\"\>JIS and ASC Spreadsheet Functions\</link\> for a conversion table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id9204992				0	hi	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id1993774				0	hi	ASC("Text")				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id2949919				0	hi	            \<emph\>Text\</emph\> is the text that contains characters to be converted.				20200411 15:09:53
