helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12080500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147363				0	hi	The cells for the 1st and 2nd quarters each contain a sum formula for the three cells to their left. If you apply the \<emph\>AutoOutline\</emph\> command, the table is grouped into two quarters.				20200411 15:09:53
