helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153379				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:TABPAGE:TP_VALIDATION_ERROR\"\>Define the error message that is displayed when invalid data is entered in a cell.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154138				0	hi	आप मॅक्रो को त्रुटि संदेश के साथ भी प्रारंभ कर सकते हैं. इस पृष्ठ के अंत में एक उदाहरण मॅक्रो दिया गया है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156280				0	hi	अवैध मूल्यों को प्रविष्ट करने के समय त्रुटि संदेश दिखाएँ.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150768				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays the error message that you enter in the \<emph\>Contents\</emph\> area when invalid data is entered in a cell.\</ahelp\> If enabled, the message is displayed to prevent an invalid entry.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3146984	5			0	hi	In both cases, if you select "Stop", the invalid entry is deleted and the previous value is reentered in the cell. The same applies if you close the "Warning" and "Information" dialogs by clicking the \<emph\>Cancel \</emph\>button. If you close the dialogs with the \<emph\>OK\</emph\> button, the invalid entry is not deleted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152460				0	hi	टिप्पणी				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148646				0	hi	क्रिया				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3151115				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:TP_VALIDATION_ERROR:LB_ACTION\"\>Select the action that you want to occur when invalid data is entered in a cell.\</ahelp\> The "Stop" action rejects the invalid entry and displays a dialog that you have to close by clicking \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. The "Warning" and "Information" actions display a dialog that can be closed by clicking \<emph\>OK\</emph\> or \<emph\>Cancel\</emph\>. The invalid entry is only rejected when you click \<emph\>Cancel\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
