helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148822				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>calculating;rates of return\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>RRI function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
