helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3154901				0	hi	\<emph\>P\</emph\> is the number of periods needed for calculating the interest rate.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3159149				0	hi	\<emph\>PV\</emph\> is the present (current) value. The cash value is the deposit of cash or the current cash value of an allowance in kind. As a deposit value a positive value must be entered; the deposit must not be 0 or <0.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149771				0	hi	\<emph\>FV\</emph\> determines what is desired as the cash value of the deposit.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148941				0	hi	उदाहरण				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3154212				0	hi	For four periods (years) and a cash value of 7,500 currency units, the interest rate of the return is to be calculated if the future value is 10,000 currency units.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150775	246			0	hi	\<item type=\"input\"\>=RRI(4;7500;10000)\</item\> = 7.46 %				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3145413	247			0	hi	ब्याज दर को 7.46 % होना चाहिए ताकि 7,500 मुद्रा इकाई 10,000 मुद्रा इकाई हो जाए.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154267				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>calculating;constant interest rates\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>constant interest rates\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>RATE function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
