helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3151052				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ZINS\"\>Returns the constant interest rate per period of an annuity.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154272				0	hi	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3158423				0	hi	RATE(NPer; Pmt; PV; FV; Type; Guess)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3148910				0	hi	\<emph\>NPer\</emph\> is the total number of periods, during which payments are made (payment period).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3148925				0	hi	\<emph\>Pmt\</emph\> is the constant payment (annuity) paid during each period.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149160				0	hi	\<emph\>PV\</emph\> is the cash value in the sequence of payments.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3166456				0	hi	\<emph\>FV\</emph\> (optional) is the future value, which is reached at the end of the periodic payments.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3153243				0	hi	\<emph\>Type\</emph\> (optional) is the due date of the periodic payment, either at the beginning or at the end of a period.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3146949				0	hi	\<emph\>Guess\</emph\> (optional) determines the estimated value of the interest with iterative calculation.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_idN10E2A				0	hi	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#optional\"/\>				20200411 15:09:53
