helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150706				0	hi	What is the constant interest rate for a payment period of 3 periods if 10 currency units are paid regularly and the present cash value is 900 currency units.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3155586				0	hi	\<item type=\"input\"\>=RATE(3;10;900)\</item\> = -121% The interest rate is therefore 121%.				20200411 15:09:53
