helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3163726				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_FVSCHEDULE\"\>Calculates the accumulated value of the starting capital for a series of periodically varying interest rates.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149571				0	hi	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3148891				0	hi	FVSCHEDULE(Principal; Schedule)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3148904				0	hi	\<emph\>Principal\</emph\> is the starting capital.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3148562				0	hi	\<emph\>Schedule\</emph\> is a series of interest rates, for example, as a range H3:H5 or as a (List) (see example).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147288				0	hi	उदाहरण				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3148638				0	hi	1000 currency units have been invested in for three years. The interest rates were 3%, 4% and 5% per annum. What is the value after three years?				20200411 15:09:53
