helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3153134				0	hi	\<emph\>PV\</emph\> is the present value (cash value) in a sequence of payments.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3154398				0	hi	\<emph\>FV\</emph\> (optional) is the future value, which is reached at the end of the last period.				20200411 15:09:53
