helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153770				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SCPAGE_SORT_OPTIONS\"\> Sets additional sorting options.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12030200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146976				0	hi	 Case Sensitivity				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153091				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCPAGE_SORT_OPTIONS:BTN_CASESENSITIVE\"\> Sorts first by uppercase letters and then by lowercase letters. For Asian languages, special handling applies.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12030200.xhp	0	help	par_idN10637				0	hi	 Note for Asian languages: Check \<emph\>Case Sensitivity\</emph\> to apply multi-level collation. With multi-level collation, entries are first compared in their primitive forms with their cases and diacritics ignored. If they evaluate as the same, their diacritics are taken into account for the second-level comparison. If they still evaluate as the same, their cases, character widths, and Japanese Kana difference are considered for the third-level comparison.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12030200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155856				0	hi	क्षेत्रसीमा में स्तम्भ लेबल हैं				20200411 15:09:53
