helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3149000	64			0	hi	 This function returns the inverse hyperbolic cosine of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>, that is the number whose hyperbolic cosine is Number. 				20200411 15:09:53
