helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3148803				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_COS\"\>Returns the cosine of the given angle (in radians).\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
