helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154213				0	hi	COS(Number)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154285				0	hi	 Returns the (trigonometric) cosine of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>, the angle in radians.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id831019				0	hi	To return the cosine of an angle in degrees, use the RADIANS function.				20200411 15:09:53
