helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3444624				0	hi	To return the cotangent of an angle in degrees, use the RADIANS function.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6814477				0	hi	The cotangent of an angle is equivalent to 1 divided by the tangent of that angle.				20200411 15:09:53
