helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3165462				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_TANHYP\"\>Returns the hyperbolic tangent of a number.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3165480				0	hi	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3165494				0	hi	TANH(Number)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3165508				0	hi	Returns the hyperbolic tangent of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
