helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055E				0	hi	Ascending				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10562				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"1495384580\"\>Sorts the values from the lowest value to the highest value. If the selected field is the field for which the dialog was opened, the items are sorted by name. If a data field was selected, the items are sorted by the resultant value of the selected data field.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10565				0	hi	Descending				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10569				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"1495384581\"\>Sorts the values descending from the highest value to the lowest value. If the selected field is the field for which the dialog was opened, the items are sorted by name. If a data field was selected, the items are sorted by the resultant value of the selected data field.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
