helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149188				0	hi	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3148733				0	hi	CUMPRINC(Rate; NPer; PV; S; E; Type)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150864				0	hi	\<emph\>Rate\</emph\> is the periodic interest rate.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3166052				0	hi	\<emph\>NPer\</emph\> is the payment period with the total number of periods. NPER can also be a non-integer value.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150007				0	hi	\<emph\>PV\</emph\> is the current value in the sequence of payments.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153112				0	hi	\<emph\>S\</emph\> is the first period.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3146847				0	hi	\<emph\>E\</emph\> is the last period.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3145167				0	hi	\<emph\>Type\</emph\> is the due date of the payment at the beginning or end of each period.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154502				0	hi	उदाहरण				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153570				0	hi	What are the payoff amounts if the yearly interest rate is 5.5% for 36 months? The cash value is 15,000 currency units. The payoff amount is calculated between the 10th and 18th period. The due date is at the end of the period.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3149884				0	hi	\<item type=\"input\"\>=CUMPRINC(5.5%/12;36;15000;10;18;0)\</item\> = -3669.74 currency units. The payoff amount between the 10th and 18th period is 3669.74 currency units.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150019				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>CUMPRINC_ADD function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150019				0	hi	CUMPRINC_ADD				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3145246				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_CUMPRINC\"\> Calculates the cumulative redemption of a loan in a period.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153047				0	hi	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3157970				0	hi	CUMPRINC_ADD(Rate; NPer; PV; StartPeriod; EndPeriod; Type)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3145302				0	hi	\<emph\>Rate\</emph\> is the interest rate for each period.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3151017				0	hi	\<emph\>NPer\</emph\> is the total number of payment periods. The rate and NPER must refer to the same unit, and thus both be calculated annually or monthly.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3155620				0	hi	\<emph\>PV\</emph\> is the current value.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3145352				0	hi	\<emph\>StartPeriod\</emph\> is the first payment period for the calculation.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3157986				0	hi	\<emph\>EndPeriod\</emph\> is the last payment period for the calculation.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150570				0	hi	\<emph\>Type\</emph\> is the maturity of a payment at the end of each period (Type = 0) or at the start of the period (Type = 1).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150269				0	hi	उदाहरण				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3148774				0	hi	The following mortgage loan is taken out on a house:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150661				0	hi	दर: 9.00 प्रतिशत प्रतिवर्ष (9% / 12 = 0.0075), अवधि: 30 वर्ष (भुगतान अवधि = 30 * 12 = 360), NPV: 125000 मुद्रा इकाइयाँ.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3155512				0	hi	How much will you repay in the second year of the mortgage (thus from periods 13 to 24)?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3149394				0	hi	\<item type=\"input\"\>=CUMPRINC_ADD(0.0075;360;125000;13;24;0)\</item\> returns -934.1071				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3149026				0	hi	प्रथम माह में आपको निम्न राशि का भुगतान करना होगा:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154636				0	hi	\<item type=\"input\"\>=CUMPRINC_ADD(0.0075;360;125000;1;1;0)\</item\> returns -68.27827				20200411 15:09:53
