helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3147566				0	hi	दर: 9.00 प्रतिशत प्रतिवर्ष (9% / 12 = 0.0075), अवधि: 30 वर्ष (NPER = 30 * 12 = 360), Pv: 125000 मुद्रा इकाइयाँ.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3151272				0	hi	How much interest must you pay in the second year of the mortgage (thus from periods 13 to 24)?				20200411 15:09:53
