helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3152804				0	hi	PRICE(Settlement; Maturity; Rate; Yield; Redemption; Frequency; Basis)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3156121				0	hi	\<emph\>Settlement\</emph\> is the date of purchase of the security.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3149983				0	hi	\<emph\>Maturity\</emph\> is the date on which the security matures (expires).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153755				0	hi	\<emph\>Rate\</emph\> is the annual nominal rate of interest (coupon interest rate)				20200411 15:09:53
