helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153884				0	hi	उदाहरण				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150941				0	hi	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DOLLARDE(1.02;16)\</item\> stands for 1 and 2/16. This returns 1.125.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150830				0	hi	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DOLLARDE(1.1;8)\</item\> stands for 1 and 1/8. This returns 1.125.				20200411 15:09:53
