helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154194				0	hi	=YIELD("1999-02-15"; "2007-11-15"; 0.0575 ;95.04287; 100; 2; 0) returns 0.065 or 6.50 per cent.				20200411 15:09:53
