helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148986				0	hi	ऊपर दिए जन्मदिन पार्टी के उदाहरण (कृपया ऊपर स्क्रॉल करें), इस फंक्शन का कोई अर्थयुक्त अनुप्रयोग नहीं है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148462				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>DSTDEV function\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>standard deviations in databases;based on a sample\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148462				0	hi	DSTDEV				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154605				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_DBSTDABW\"\>DSTDEV calculates the standard deviation of a population based on a sample, using the numbers in a database column that match the given conditions.\</ahelp\> The records are treated as a sample of data. That means that the children in the example represent a cross section of all children. Note that a representative result can not be obtained from a sample of less than one thousand.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149427				0	hi	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148661				0	hi	DSTDEV(Database; DatabaseField; SearchCriteria)				20200411 15:09:53
