helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3152766				0	hi	To find the length of the combined distance to school of all children at Joe's birthday party (scroll up, please) who are in second grade, enter the following formula in B16:				20200411 15:09:53
