helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090104.xhp	0	help	par_id3147264				0	hi	If the \<emph\>Regular Expression\</emph\> check box is selected, you can use EQUAL (=) and NOT EQUAL (<>) also in comparisons. You can also use the following functions: DCOUNTA, DGET, MATCH, COUNTIF, SUMIF, LOOKUP, VLOOKUP and HLOOKUP.				20200411 15:09:53
