helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120100.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A0				0	hi	कक्ष क्षेत्रसीमा				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120100.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A5				0	hi	Allow only values that are given in a cell range. The cell range can be specified explicitly, or as a named database range, or as a named range. The range may consist of one column or one row of cells. If you specify a range of columns and rows, only the first column is used.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120100.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AB				0	hi	सूची				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120100.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B0				0	hi	Allow only values or strings specified in a list. Strings and values can be mixed. Numbers evaluate to their value, so if you enter the number 1 in the list, the entry 100% is also valid.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154756				0	hi	पाठ लम्बाई				20200411 15:09:53
