helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	छपाई का दायरा जोड़ें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153088				0	hi	छपाई का दायरा जोड़ें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	par_id3159488				0	hi	\<variable id=\"druckbereichetext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:EditPrintArea\"\>Opens a dialog where you can specify the print range.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> You can also set the rows or columns which are to be repeated in every page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	par_idN105AE				0	hi	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/guide/printranges.xhp#printranges\"/\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156281				0	hi	छपाई क्षेत्रसीमाएँ				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	par_id3147228				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCDLG_AREAS:ED_PRINTAREA\"\>Allows you to modify a defined print range.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145174				0	hi	Select \<emph\>-none-\</emph\> to remove a print range definition for the current spreadsheet. Select \<emph\>-entire sheet-\</emph\> to set the current sheet as a print range. Select \<emph\>-selection-\</emph\> to define the selected area of a spreadsheet as the print range. By selecting \<emph\>-user-defined-\</emph\>, you can define a print range that you have already defined using the \<emph\>Format - Print Ranges - Define\</emph\> command. If you have given a name to a range using the \<emph\>Insert - Names - Define\</emph\> command, this name will be displayed and can be selected from the list box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145272				0	hi	In the right-hand text box, you can enter a print range by reference or by name. If the cursor is in the \<emph\>Print range\</emph\> text box, you can also select the print range in the spreadsheet with your mouse.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149260				0	hi	पंक्तियाँ  जिन्हें दोहराना है				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	par_id3147426				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCDLG_AREAS:ED_REPEATROW\"\>Choose one or more rows to print on every page. In the right text box enter the row reference, for example, "1" or "$1" or "$2:$3".\</ahelp\> The list box displays \<emph\>-user defined-\</emph\>. You can also select \<emph\>-none-\</emph\> to remove a defined repeating row.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	par_id3155418				0	hi	You can also define repeating rows by dragging the mouse in the spreadsheet, if the cursor is in the \<emph\>Rows to repeat\</emph\> text field in the dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149581				0	hi	स्तम्भ जिन्हें दोहराना है				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	par_id3155602				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCDLG_AREAS:ED_REPEATCOL\"\>Choose one or more columns to print on every page. In the right text box enter the column reference, for example, "A" or "AB" or "$C:$E".\</ahelp\> The list box then displays \<emph\>-user defined-\</emph\>. You can also select \<emph\>-none-\</emph\> to remove a defined repeating column.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749				0	hi	You can also define repeating columns by dragging the mouse in the spreadsheet, if the cursor is in the \<emph\>Columns to repeat\</emph\> text field in the dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
