helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_second.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159390				0	hi	\<variable id=\"second\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/func_second.xhp\"\>SECOND\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_second.xhp	0	help	par_id3148974				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_SEKUNDE\"\>Returns the second for the given time value.\</ahelp\> The second is given as an integer between 0 and 59.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_second.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154362				0	hi	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_second.xhp	0	help	par_id3148407				0	hi	SECOND(Number)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_second.xhp	0	help	par_id3155904				0	hi	\<emph\>Number\</emph\>, as a time value, is a decimal, for which the second is to be returned.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_second.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149992				0	hi	उदाहरण				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_second.xhp	0	help	par_id3153350				0	hi	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SECOND(NOW())\</item\> returns the current second				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_second.xhp	0	help	par_id3150831				0	hi	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SECOND(C4)\</item\> returns 17 if contents of C4 = \<item type=\"input\"\>12:20:17\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	दस्तावेज़ सुरक्षित करें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150541				0	hi	दस्तावेज़ सुरक्षित करें				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145172				0	hi	\<variable id=\"dokumenttext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ToolProtectionDocument\"\>Protects the sheet structure of your document from modifications. It is impossible to insert, delete, rename, move or copy sheets.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> Open the \<emph\>Protect document\</emph\> dialog with \<emph\>Tools - Protect Document - Document\</emph\>. Optionally enter a password and click OK.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153188				0	hi	The structure of protected spreadsheet documents can be changed only if the \<emph\>Protect\</emph\> option is disabled. On the context menus for the spreadsheet tabs at the lower graphic border, only the menu item \<emph\>Select All Sheets\</emph\> can be activated. All other menu items are deactivated. To remove the protection, call up the command \<emph\>Tools - Protect Document - Document\</emph\> again. If no password is assigned, protection is immediately removed. If you were assigned a password, the \<emph\>Remove Spreadsheet Protection\</emph\> dialog appears, in which you must enter the password. Only then can you remove the check mark specifying that protection is active.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145750	7			0	hi	A protected document, once saved, can only be saved again with the \<emph\>File - Save As\</emph\> menu command. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152596				0	hi	Password (optional)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155412				0	hi	अवैधानिक या दुर्घटना से किए जा सकने वाले परिवर्धनों से अपने दस्तावेज़ को बचाने के लिए आप पासवर्ड बना सकते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150717	9			0	hi	You can completely protect your work by combining both options from \<emph\>Tools - Protect Document\</emph\>, including password entry. If you want to prevent the document from being opened by other users, select \<emph\>Save With Password \</emph\>and click the \<emph\>Save\</emph\> button. The \<emph\>Enter Password\</emph\> dialog appears. Consider carefully when choosing a password; if you forget it after you close a document you will be unable to access the document.				20200411 15:09:53
