helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	वस्तु की अनुकृति बनाना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145750				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>doubling draw objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>draw objects; duplicating\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>duplicating draw objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>multiplying draw objects\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145750				0	hi	\<variable id=\"duplicate_object\"\>\<link href=\"text/sdraw/guide/duplicate_object.xhp\" name=\"Duplicating Objects\"\>Duplicating Objects\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149400				0	hi	You can create duplicate or multiple copies of an object. The copies can be identical or can differ in size, color, orientation and location.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3153415				0	hi	The following example creates a stack of coins by making multiple copies of a single ellipse.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149129				0	hi	Use the \<emph\>Ellipse\</emph\> tool to draw a solid yellow ellipse.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149209				0	hi	Select the ellipse and choose \<emph\>Edit - Duplicate\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3145585	9			0	hi	Enter 12 as \<emph\>Number of copies.\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3151192				0	hi	Enter a negative value for the \<emph\>Width\</emph\> and \<emph\>Height\</emph\> so that the coins decrease in size as you go up the stack.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3151387				0	hi	To define a color transition for the coins, select different colors in the \<emph\>Start\</emph\> and \<emph\>End\</emph\> boxes. The \<emph\>Start\</emph\> color is applied to the object that you are duplicating.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149947				0	hi	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to create the duplicates.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3153935				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/02120000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Duplicate\"\>Edit - Duplicate\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
