helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects3d.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154014				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>3D objects; assembling\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>assembled objects in 3D\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>combining;3D objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>joining;3D objects\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects3d.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156442				0	hi	\<variable id=\"join_objects3d\"\>\<link href=\"text/sdraw/guide/join_objects3d.xhp\" name=\"Assembling 3D Objects\"\>Assembling 3D Objects\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects3d.xhp	0	help	par_id3145251				0	hi	3D objects that each form a 3D scene can be combined into a single 3D scene.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects3d.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150042				0	hi	3डी वस्तुओं को मिलाने के लिए:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects3d.xhp	0	help	par_id3154702				0	hi	Insert a 3D object from the \<emph\>3D Objects\</emph\> toolbar (for example, a cube).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects3d.xhp	0	help	par_id3155335				0	hi	Insert a second slightly larger 3D object (for example, a sphere).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects3d.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488				0	hi	Select the second 3D object (sphere) and choose \<emph\>Edit - Cut\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects3d.xhp	0	help	par_id3149211				0	hi	इसके समूह में जाने के लिए पहली वस्तु (घन) को दोहरा क्लिक करें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects3d.xhp	0	help	par_id3154652				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Paste\</emph\>. Both objects are now part of the same group. If you want, you can edit the individual objects or change their position within the group.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects3d.xhp	0	help	par_id3155376				0	hi	समूह से बाहर होने के लिए समूह के बाहर दोहरा क्लिक करें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects3d.xhp	0	help	par_id3148606				0	hi	आप 3डी वस्तुओं को प्रतिच्छेदित या सबस्ट्रैक्ट नहीं कर सकते.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects3d.xhp	0	help	par_id3154537				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10090000.xhp\" name=\"Objects in 3D\"\>Objects in 3D\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	वस्तुओं को जोड़ना तथा आकार बनाना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	bm_id3156443				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>combining; draw objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>merging; draw objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>connecting; draw objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>draw objects; combining\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>intersecting draw objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>polygons; intersecting/subtracting/merging\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>subtracting polygons\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>constructing shapes\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156443	64			0	hi	\<variable id=\"combine_etc\"\>\<link href=\"text/sdraw/guide/combine_etc.xhp\" name=\"Combining Objects and Constructing Shapes\"\>Combining Objects and Constructing Shapes\</link\> \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	par_id3149020	65			0	hi	Combined drawing objects act as grouped objects, except that you cannot enter the group to edit the individual objects. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	par_id3154659				0	hi	आप सिर्फ 2डी वस्तुओं को जोड़ सकते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150344				0	hi	2डी वस्तुओं को जोड़ने के लिए:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	par_id3166428				0	hi	Select two or more 2D objects.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	par_id3145587				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Modify - Combine\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	par_id3146978				0	hi	Unlike groups, a combined object takes on the properties of the lowermost object in the stacking order. You can split apart combined objects, but the original object properties are lost.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	par_id3155088				0	hi	जब आप वस्तुओं को जोड़ते हैं, तो जहाँ वस्तु एक दूसरे के ऊपर आते हैं वहाँ छेद प्रकट होते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	par_id3156019				0	hi	 \<image id=\"img_id3157978\" src=\"res/helpimg/kombi1.png\" width=\"8.3646inch\" height=\"2.5inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3157978\"\>Illustration for combining objects\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	par_id3153249				0	hi	चित्रण में अलग-अलग वस्तुएँ बाएँ तरफ तथा जुड़ी वस्तुएँ दाएँ तरफ हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159229				0	hi	आकार बनाना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	par_id3150049				0	hi	You can construct shapes by applying the \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/13180000.xhp\" name=\"Shapes\"\>\<emph\>Shapes\</emph\>\</link\> \<emph\>- Merge, Subtract and Intersect\</emph\> commands to two or more drawing objects.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	par_id3147403				0	hi	आकार कमांड्स सिर्फ 2डी वस्तुओं में कार्य करता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	par_id3150539				0	hi	Constructed shapes take on the properties of the lowermost object in the stacking order.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156402				0	hi	आकार बनाने के लिए:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	par_id3157874				0	hi	Select two or more 2D objects.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	par_id3150650				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Modify - Shapes\</emph\> and one of the following:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	par_id3145829	91			0	hi	 \<emph\>Merge\</emph\> 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	par_id3154680	92			0	hi	 \<emph\>Subtract\</emph\> 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	par_id3153034				0	hi	 \<emph\>Intersect\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
