helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\search_regexp.xhp	0	help	par_id3155861				0	hi	Select the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Regular expressions\</item\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\search_regexp.xhp	0	help	par_id3149843				0	hi	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Search for\</item\> box, type the search term and the wildcard(s) that you want to use in your search.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\search_regexp.xhp	0	help	par_id3156113				0	hi	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Find\</item\> or \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Find All\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\search_regexp.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153401				0	hi	रेगुलर एक्सप्रेशन उदाहरण.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\search_regexp.xhp	0	help	par_id3149641				0	hi	एक अक्षर के लिए वाइल्ड कार्ड पीरियड (.) होता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\search_regexp.xhp	0	help	par_id3153136				0	hi	The wildcard for zero or more occurrences of the previous character is an asterisk. For example: "123*" finds "12" "123", and "1233".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\search_regexp.xhp	0	help	par_id3149609				0	hi	The wildcard combination to search for zero or more occurrences of any character is a period and asterisk (.*).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\search_regexp.xhp	0	help	par_id3149854				0	hi	The wildcard for the end of a paragraph is a dollar sign ($). The wildcard character combination for the start of a paragraph is a caret and a period (^.).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\search_regexp.xhp	0	help	par_id0509200916345545				0	hi	The wildcard for a tab character is \\t.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\search_regexp.xhp	0	help	par_id3153414				0	hi	A search using a regular expression will work only within one paragraph. To search using a regular expression in more than one paragraph, do a separate search in each paragraph.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\search_regexp.xhp	0	help	par_id3149875				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/02100001.xhp\" name=\"List of Wildcards\"\>List of Wildcards\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	खण्डों का इस्तेमाल करना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149832				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>multi-column text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text; multi-column\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>columns; on text pages\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text columns\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>sections; columns in/use of\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149832				0	hi	\<variable id=\"sections\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/sections.xhp\" name=\"Using Sections\"\>Using Sections\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	par_id3153128				0	hi	Sections are named blocks of text, including graphics or objects, that you can use in a number of ways:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	par_id3149284				0	hi	पाठ को संपादन किए जाने से रोकना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	par_id3149630				0	hi	पाठ को दिखाना या छुपाना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	par_id3149647				0	hi	अन्य $[officename] दस्तावेज़ों से पाठ तथा चित्रों को फिर से इस्तेमाल करने के लिए.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	par_id3149612				0	hi	To insert sections of text that uses a different column layout than the current page style.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	par_id3149855				0	hi	A section contains at least one paragraph. When you select a text and create a section, a paragraph break is automatically inserted at the end of the text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	par_id3149872				0	hi	You can insert sections from a text document, or an entire text document as a section into another text document. You can also insert sections from a text document as links in another text document, or in the same document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	par_id3153367	39			0	hi	To insert a new paragraph immediately before or after a section, click in front or behind the section, and then press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154242				0	hi	खण्ड व स्तम्भ				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	par_id3154255				0	hi	You can insert sections into an existing section. For example, you can insert a section containing two columns into a section that contains one column.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	par_id3154845				0	hi	A section layout, for example on the number of columns, has priority over the page layout defined in a page style.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	par_id3155883				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#dde\" name=\"DDE\"\>DDE\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	जब आप टाइप कर रहे हों तो क्रमांकित या चिह्नित (बुलेटेड) सूची बनाना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147407				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>numbering; lists, while typing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>bullet lists;creating while typing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>lists;automatic numbering\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>numbers;lists\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>automatic bullets/numbers; AutoCorrect function\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>bullets; using automatically\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>paragraphs; automatic numbering\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147407				0	hi	\<variable id=\"auto_numbering\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/auto_numbering.xhp\" name=\"Creating Numbered or Bulleted Lists as You Type\"\>Creating Numbered or Bulleted Lists as You Type\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3155525				0	hi	जैसे जैसे आप टाइप करते जाते हैं $[officename] स्वचालित रूप से क्रमांक व चिह्न डाल सकता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154243				0	hi	स्वचालित क्रमांकन व बुलेट (चिह्न) लगाने के लिए				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3152830	29			0	hi	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - AutoCorrect Options\</item\>, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Options\</item\> tab, and then select “Apply numbering – symbol”.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3152867				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Format - AutoCorrect\</emph\>, and ensure that \<emph\>While Typing\</emph\> is selected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id2357860				0	hi	The automatic numbering option is only applied to paragraphs that are formatted with the "Default", "Text body", or "Text body indent" paragraph style.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152897				0	hi	जब आप टाइप कर रहे हों तो क्रमांकित या चिह्नित (बुलेटेड) सूची बनाने के लिए				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3147773				0	hi	क्रमांकित सूची प्रारंभ करने के लिए 1., i., या I. टाइप करें. इसी तरह, चिह्नित सूची प्रारंभ करने के लिए * या - टाइप करें. पीरियड (.) के बजाए आप दायाँ कोष्ठक भी टाइप कर सकते हैं, जैसे कि, 1) या i).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3147794				0	hi	स्पेस प्रविष्ट करें, अपना पाठ टाइप करें, फिर एन्टर दबाएँ. नए अनुच्छेद में स्वचालित रुप से अगला क्रमांक या चिह्न (बुलेट) होगा.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3147814				0	hi	सूची को पूरा करने के लिए फिर से एन्टर कुंजी दबाएँ				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3147287				0	hi	आप क्रमांकित सूची किसी भी क्रम संख्या से प्रारंभ कर सकते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
