helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3154248				0	hi	Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+T\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>F11\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> to open the \<emph\>Styles and Formatting\</emph\> window, and then click the \<emph\>Paragraph Styles\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3154853				0	hi	Right-click the "Default" paragraph style and choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_lines.xhp	0	help	par_id3150222				0	hi	सभी अनुच्छेद शैलियाँ "डिफ़ॉल्ट" शैली पर आधारित हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
