helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3149829				0	hi	To Create a New Style From a Manually Formatted Selection				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3156097				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3153402				0	hi	शैली श्रेणी के उस प्रतीक को क्लिक करें जिसे आप अद्यतन करना चाहते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3153119				0	hi	Click in the document where you want to copy the style from, for example, in a paragraph that you applied manual formatting to.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3153138				0	hi	Click the arrow next to the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>New Style from Selection\</item\> icon and choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>New Style from Selection\</item\> from the submenu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3156260				0	hi	Type a name in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style Name\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3154411				0	hi	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
