helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3154233				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3154258				0	hi	शैली श्रेणी के उस प्रतीक को क्लिक करें जिसे आप अद्यतन करना चाहते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3154851				0	hi	Select at least one character, or object, in the style that you want to copy. For page and frame styles, select at least one character or object in the page or frame.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3154871				0	hi	अक्षर या वस्तु को शैलियाँ तथा फ़ॉर्मेटिंग विंडो में खींच लाएँ तथा छोड़ें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B2				0	hi	For paragraph and character styles, you can drag-and-drop onto the respective icon in the Styles and Formatting window. You do not need to open that style category in advance.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B5				0	hi	You can also drag-and-drop a frame into the Styles and Formatting window to create a new frame style: Click the frame, wait a moment with the mouse button pressed down, but without moving the mouse, then drag to the Styles and Formatting window and drop the frame onto the Frame Styles icon.				20200411 15:09:53
