helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_scan.xhp	0	help	par_id3155864				0	hi	Choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/04060000.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Picture - Scan\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Picture - Scan\</emph\>\</link\>, and choose the scanning source from the submenu.				20200411 15:09:53
