helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153108				0	hi	\<variable id=\"conditional_text2\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/conditional_text2.xhp\" name=\"Conditional Text for Page Counts\"\>Conditional Text for Page Counts\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3156228				0	hi	You can create a conditional text field that displays the word "pages" instead of "page" in conjunction with a page count field if your document contains more than one page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3156257				0	hi	संकेतक को पृष्ठ पर वहाँ रखें जहाँ आप पृष्ठ गणना प्रविष्ट करना चाहते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3150513				0	hi	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Fields - Page Count\</item\>, and then enter a space.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3150537				0	hi	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Fields - Other\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Functions\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3153166				0	hi	Click "Conditional text" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3145256				0	hi	Type \<item type=\"literal\"\>Page > 1\</item\> in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Condition\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3145280				0	hi	Type \<item type=\"literal\"\>Pages\</item\> in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Then\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3145305				0	hi	Type \<item type=\"literal\"\>Page\</item\> in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Else\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3155535				0	hi	Click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>, and then click \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
