helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154250				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>turning off automatic correction\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text;turning off automatic correction\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>uppercase;changing to lowercase\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>capital letters;changing to small letters after periods\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>quotation marks;changing automatically\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>words;automatic replacement on/off\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>lines;automatic drawing on/off\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>underlining;quick\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>borders; automatic drawing on/off\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>automatic changes on/off\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>changes;automatic\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>AutoCorrect function;turning off\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147812				0	hi	\<variable id=\"auto_off\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/auto_off.xhp\" name=\"Turning Off AutoFormat and AutoCorrect\"\>Turning Off AutoCorrect\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3147833	2			0	hi	डिफ़ॉल्ट से ही $[officename] बहुत सी टाइपिंग की गलतियों को स्वचालित रुप से सुधारता है तथा जैसे जैसे आप टाइप करते हैं फ़ॉर्मेटिंग लागू करता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_idN1081B				0	hi	To quickly undo an automatic correction or completion, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Z. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_idN10846				0	hi	To turn off most AutoCorrect features, remove the check mark from the menu \<emph\>Format - AutoCorrect - While Typing\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147251				0	hi	To Remove a Word from the AutoCorrect List				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3147274				0	hi	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - AutoCorrect Options\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3145596				0	hi	Click the \<emph\>Replace\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3145620				0	hi	In the \<emph\>AutoCorrect\</emph\> list, select the word pair that you want to remove.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3145645				0	hi	Click \<emph\>Delete\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145668				0	hi	To Stop Replacing Quotation Marks				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3151196				0	hi	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - AutoCorrect Options\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3151220				0	hi	Click the \<emph\>Localized Options\</emph\> tab				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3151245				0	hi	Clear the "Replace" check box(es).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155076				0	hi	To Stop Capitalizing the First Letter of a Sentence				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155099	10			0	hi	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools – AutoCorrect Options\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155123				0	hi	Click the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155148				0	hi	Clear the "Capitalize first letter of every sentence" check box.				20200411 15:09:53
