helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	Checking Spelling and Grammar				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149684				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>spellcheck; checking text documents manually\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>checking spelling;manually\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>grammar checker\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149684				0	hi	\<variable id=\"spellcheck_dialog\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/spellcheck_dialog.xhp\" name=\"Checking Spelling and Grammar\"\>Checking Spelling and Grammar\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3149814				0	hi	You can manually check the spelling and grammar of a text selection or the entire document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id0525200902184476				0	hi	To check the spelling and the grammar of a text, the appropriate dictionaries must be installed. For many languages three different dictionaries exist: a spellchecker, a hyphenation dictionary, and a thesaurus. Each dictionary covers one language only. Grammar checkers can be downloaded and installed as extensions. See the \<link href=\"https://extensions.openoffice.org/dictionary\"\>extensions web page\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3149828				0	hi	The spellcheck starts at the current cursor position, or at the beginning of the text selection.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3155859				0	hi	दस्तावेज़ में क्लिक करें, या पाठ चुनें जिसे आप जांचना चाहते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3149836				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Spelling and Grammar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3156104				0	hi	When a possible spelling error is encountered, the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Spellcheck\</item\> dialog opens and $[officename] offers some suggested corrections.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3149861				0	hi	Do one of the following:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3145099				0	hi	To accept a correction, click the suggestion, and then click \<emph\>Change\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3156241				0	hi	Edit the sentence in the upper text box, and then click \<emph\>Change\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3155886				0	hi	To add the unknown word to a user-defined dictionary, click \<emph\>Add\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3147107				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/06010000.xhp\" name=\"Spellcheck dialog\"\>Spelling and Grammar dialog\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id9625843				0	hi	\<link href=\"https://wiki.openoffice.org/wiki/Documentation/How_Tos/Adding_More_Languages\"\>Wiki page: Adding more languages\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
