helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3149829				0	hi	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>New Template\</item\> box, type a name for the new template.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3156098				0	hi	Select a template category in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Categories\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
