helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3153404				0	hi	To create a document based on the template, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File - New - Templates and Documents\</item\>, select the template, and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Open\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_create.xhp	0	help	par_id3149636				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01110300.xhp\" name=\"File - Templates - Save\"\>File - Templates - Save\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
