helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3155886				0	hi	Type a name for the index in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Name\</item\> box and click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3147114	52			0	hi	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\> to add the selected word(s) to the new index. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3147139				0	hi	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Close\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_userdef.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150231				0	hi	To Insert a User-Defined Index				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3150933				0	hi	दस्तावेज़ पर वहाँ क्लिक करें जहाँ आप निर्देशिका को प्रविष्ट करना चाहते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3150952				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Indexes and Tables - Indexes and Tables\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3150509				0	hi	On the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Index/Table\</item\> tab, select the name of the user-defined index that you created in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3146881				0	hi	जिन्हें आप चाहते हैं उन विकल्पों को सेट करें.				20200411 15:09:53
