helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	par_id5708792				0	hi	Select the adjacent cells.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	par_id6301461				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Table - Merge Cells\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	hd_id9156468				0	hi	To Split Cells				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	par_id3415936				0	hi	Place the cursor in the cell to be split.				20200411 15:09:53
