helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154922				0	hi	\<variable id=\"insert_graphic\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/insert_graphic.xhp\" name=\"Inserting Graphics\"\>Inserting Graphics\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id3149695				0	hi	पाठ दस्तावेज़ में चित्र को प्रविष्ट करने के कई तरीके हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyphen_prevent.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	विशिष्ट शब्दों के हायफनेशन रोकना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyphen_prevent.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149695				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>hyphenation;preventing for specific words\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>words;wrapping/not wrapping in text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>switching off;hyphenation for specific words\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyphen_prevent.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149695				0	hi	\<variable id=\"hyphen_prevent\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/hyphen_prevent.xhp\" name=\"Preventing Hyphenation of Specific Words\"\>Preventing Hyphenation of Specific Words\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyphen_prevent.xhp	0	help	par_id5640125				0	hi	If your text is \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/using_hyphen.xhp\"\>automatically hyphenated\</link\> and certain hyphenated words look ugly, or if you want specific words never to be hyphenated you can switch off hyphenation for those words:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyphen_prevent.xhp	0	help	par_id3153634	40			0	hi	Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language Settings - Writing Aids\</emph\>            				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyphen_prevent.xhp	0	help	par_id3153658	41			0	hi	Select a dictionary in the \<emph\>User-defined dictionary \</emph\>list, and then click \<emph\>Edit\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyphen_prevent.xhp	0	help	par_id3147125				0	hi	If the list is empty, click \<emph\>New\</emph\> to create a dictionary.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyphen_prevent.xhp	0	help	par_id3150218	42			0	hi	In the\<emph\> Word\</emph\> box, type the word you want to exclude from hyphenation, followed by an equal sign (=), for example, "pretentious=".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyphen_prevent.xhp	0	help	par_id3150247				0	hi	Click \<emph\>New\</emph\>, and then click \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyphen_prevent.xhp	0	help	par_id3147036	29			0	hi	To quickly exclude a word from hyphenation, select the word, choose \<emph\>Format - Character\</emph\>, click the \<emph\>Font \</emph\>tab, and select "None" in the \<emph\>Language \</emph\>box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyphen_prevent.xhp	0	help	par_id0302200910262761				0	hi	Some words contain special characters that %PRODUCTNAME treats as a hyphen. If you do not want such words to be hyphenated, you can insert a special code that prevents hyphenation at the position where the special code is inserted. Proceed as follows:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyphen_prevent.xhp	0	help	par_id0302200910262850				0	hi	Enable the special features of complex text layout (CTL) languages: Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language Settings - Languages\</item\> and check \<emph\>Enabled for complex text layout (CTL)\</emph\>. Click OK.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyphen_prevent.xhp	0	help	par_id0302200910262837				0	hi	Position the cursor at the place where no hyphenation should occur.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyphen_prevent.xhp	0	help	par_id0302200910262867				0	hi	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Formatting Mark - No-width no break\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyphen_prevent.xhp	0	help	par_id0302200910572128				0	hi	Once the special character is inserted, you might disable CTL again. Support of CTL was only necessary to insert the special character.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyphen_prevent.xhp	0	help	par_id3154361				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05030200.xhp\" name=\"Text Flow\"\>Text Flow\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
