helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN10812				0	hi	$[officename] uses page styles to specify the background of the pages in a document. For example, to change the page background of one or more pages in a document to a watermark, you need to create a page style that uses the watermark background, and then apply the page style to the pages.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN10820				0	hi	पृष्ठ के पृष्ठभूमि का रंग बदलने के लिए				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN10827				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN1082F				0	hi	Click the \<emph\>Page Styles\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN10837				0	hi	In the list of page styles, right-click an item, and then choose \<emph\>New\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN1083F				0	hi	On the \<emph\>Organizer\</emph\> tab page, type a name for the page style in the \<emph\>Name\</emph\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN1084B				0	hi	In the \<emph\>Next Style\</emph\> box, select the page style that you want to apply to the next page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN10855				0	hi	To only apply the new page style to a single page, select "Default".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN10859				0	hi	To apply the new page style to all subsequent pages, select the name of the new page style.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN1085F				0	hi	Click the \<emph\>Background\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN10867				0	hi	In the list box at the top, select whether you want a solid color or a graphic. Then select your options from the tab page. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN1086B				0	hi	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN1087A				0	hi	दस्तावेज़ के सभी पृष्ठों के पृष्ठभूमि को बदलने के लिए				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN1087E				0	hi	Before you begin, ensure that you have created a page style that uses a page background. See \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/pagebackground.xhp#define\"\>To Change the Page Background\</link\> for details.				20200411 15:09:53
