helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN1089A				0	hi	Click the \<emph\>Page Styles\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN108A2				0	hi	उस पृष्ठ शैली को दोहरा क्लिक करें जिसमें वह पृष्ठभूमि इस्तेमाल किया गया है जो आप लागू करना चाहते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN108A5				0	hi	उसी दस्तावेज़ में भिन्न पृष्ठ पृष्ठभूमि इस्तेमाल करने के लिए				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN108A9				0	hi	Before you begin, ensure that you have created a page style that uses a page background. See \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/pagebackground.xhp#define\"\>To Change the Page Background\</link\> for details.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN108BD				0	hi	Click in front of the first character of the paragraph where you want to change the page background.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN108C1				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Manual Break\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN108C9				0	hi	Select \<emph\>Page break\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN108D1				0	hi	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style\</item\> box, select a page style that uses the page background.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN108DB				0	hi	To change the background of the current page only, select a page style where the Next Style option is set to "Default".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN108DF				0	hi	To change the background of the current and subsequent pages, select a page style where the Next Style option is set to the name of the page style.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN108E2				0	hi	If you want to change the page background later on in the document, repeat steps 1 to 3.				20200411 15:09:53
