helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\wrap.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154486				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>text wrap around objects\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>contour editor\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>contour wrap\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text; formatting around objects\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>formatting; contour wrap\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>objects; contour wrap\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>wrapping text;editing contours\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>editors;contour editor\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
