helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\printer_tray.xhp	0	help	par_id3155858				0	hi	Use page styles to specify different paper sources for different pages in your document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\printer_tray.xhp	0	help	par_id3149841				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
