helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autocorr_except.xhp	0	help	par_id3144875	17			0	hi	To quickly undo an AutoCorrect replacement, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Z. This also adds the word or abbreviation that you typed to the AutoCorrect exceptions list.				20200411 15:09:53
