helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	par_id3150942				0	hi	The best way to generate a table of contents is to apply the predefined heading paragraph styles, such as "Heading 1", to the paragraphs that you want to include in your table of contents. After you apply these styles, you can then create a table of contents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	hd_id5876949				0	hi	To Insert a Table of Contents				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	par_id3150510				0	hi	संकेतक को दस्तावेज़ में वहाँ क्लिक करें जहाँ आप विषय सूची तालिका बनाना चाहते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	par_id3150528				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Indexes and Tables - Indexes and Tables\</emph\>, and then click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120211.xhp\" name=\"Index/Table\"\>\<emph\>Index/Table\</emph\>\</link\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	par_id3153746				0	hi	Select "Table of Contents" in the \<emph\>Type\</emph\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	par_id3146856				0	hi	जिन्हें आप चाहते हैं उन विकल्पों को सेट करें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	par_id3146872				0	hi	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	par_id3146896				0	hi	If you want to use a different paragraph style as a table of contents entry, select the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Additional Styles\</item\> check box in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Create from\</item\> area, and then click the (\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>...\</item\>) button next to the check box. In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Assign Styles\</item\> dialog, click the style in the list, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>>>\</item\> or the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\><<\</item\> button to define the outline level for the paragraph style.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153148				0	hi	To Update a Table of Contents				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	par_id3153161				0	hi	Do one of the following:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	par_id3153183				0	hi	Right-click in the table of contents and choose \<emph\>Update Index/Table\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	par_id3147066				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Update - All Indexes and Tables\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	शब्दों को गिना जा रहा है				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149686				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>words; counting in text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>number of words\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>documents; number of words/characters\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text; number of words/characters\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>characters; counting\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>number of characters\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>counting words\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>word counts\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149686				0	hi	\<variable id=\"words_count\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/words_count.xhp\" name=\"Counting Words\"\>Counting Words\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D1				0	hi	यदि आप अपने दस्तावेज़ के कुछ ही पाठ को गिनती में लेना चाहते हैं तो उस पाठ को चुनें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	par_id3149821				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Word Count\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	hd_id1116200901133957				0	hi	How does %PRODUCTNAME count words?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	par_id1116200901133998				0	hi	In general, every string of characters between two spaces is a word. Tabs, line breaks, and paragraph breaks are word limits, too.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	par_id1116200901133985				0	hi	Words with dashes or always visible hyphens, as in plug-in, add-on, user/config, are counted as one word each.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	par_id111620090113399				0	hi	The words can be a mix of letters, numbers, and special characters. So the following text counts as four words: abc123 1.23 "$" http://www.example.com.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E2				0	hi	To get some more statistics about the document, choose \<emph\>File - Properties - Statistics\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\words_count.xhp	0	help	par_id3147418				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01100400.xhp\" name=\"File - Properties - Statistics\"\>File - Properties - Statistics\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	लाइन ब्रेक प्रविष्ट हटाना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149687				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>hard returns in pasted text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>line breaks;removing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>deleting; line breaks\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>copies;removing line breaks\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>paragraph marks;removing\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155916				0	hi	\<variable id=\"removing_line_breaks\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/removing_line_breaks.xhp\"\>Removing Line Breaks\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3155858				0	hi	Use the AutoCorrect feature to remove line breaks that occur within sentences. Unwanted line breaks can occur when you copy text from another source and paste it into a text document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3153413	3			0	hi	This AutoCorrect feature only works on text that is formatted with the "Default" paragraph style. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3153138	5			0	hi	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - AutoCorrect Options\</item\>               \<emph\>.\</emph\>            				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3149645				0	hi	On the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> tab, ensure that \<emph\>Combine single line paragraphs if length greater than 50%\</emph\> is selected. To change the minimum percentage for the line length, double-click the option in the list, and then enter a new percentage.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3145093				0	hi	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3145118				0	hi	लाइन ब्रेक युक्त पाठ को चुनें जिसे आप हटाना चाहते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3156253				0	hi	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Apply Style\</item\> box on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formatting\</item\> bar, choose “Default”.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3153388				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Format - AutoCorrect - Apply\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
