helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN10669				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Format - Page - Page\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN10671				0	hi	Select the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Register-true\</item\> checkbox and click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN10678				0	hi	All the paragraphs in the document will be printed register-true, unless otherwise specified.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN1067B				0	hi	To Exempt Paragraphs From Register-True Printing				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN10682				0	hi	Do one of the following:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN10685				0	hi	Select all the paragraphs you want to exempt, then choose \<emph\>Format - Paragraph - Indents & Spacing\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN1068C				0	hi	Open the Styles and Formatting window, click the Paragraph Style you want to exempt, right-click that style, choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>. In the dialog, click the \<emph\>Indents & Spacing\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
