helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_emphasize.xhp	0	help	par_id3155922				0	hi	यहाँ कुछ उदाहरण हैं कि कैसे दस्तावेज़ में पाठ को उभारा जाता है:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_emphasize.xhp	0	help	par_id3147412				0	hi	Select the text and apply a different font style or effect, such as \<emph\>bold\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_emphasize.xhp	0	help	par_id3149840	68			0	hi	Right-click in a paragraph, choose \<emph\>Paragraph, \</emph\>set the options that you want, for example, the background color, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_emphasize.xhp	0	help	par_id3150084				0	hi	Select the text, and then choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Frame\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_emphasize.xhp	0	help	par_id6924649				0	hi	ड्राइंग औजार पट्टी में पाठ औजार इस्तेमाल करें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_emphasize.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E7				0	hi	Use Fontwork. To open the Fontwork window, click the Fontwork Gallery icon on the Drawing bar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	पाठ दस्तावेज़ में सूत्र के परिणाम की गणना करना तथा चिपकाना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147692				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>pasting;results of formulas\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>clipboard;calculating in text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>formulas;pasting results in text documents\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147692				0	hi	\<variable id=\"calculate_clipboard\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/calculate_clipboard.xhp\" name=\" Calculating and Pasting the Result of a Formula in a Text Document\"\> Calculating and Pasting the Result of a Formula in a Text Document\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3156366				0	hi	If your text already contains a formula, for example "12+24*2", $[officename] can calculate, and then paste the result of the formula in your document, without using the \<emph\>Formula Bar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154250				0	hi	पाठ में सूत्र को चुनें. सूत्र में सिर्फ संख्या तथा ऑपरेटर्स हो सकते हैं तथा स्पेस नहीं हों.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155496	38			0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Calculate\</emph\>, or press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Plus Sign (+).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	par_id5172582				0	hi	Place the cursor where you want to insert the result of the formula, and then choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit - Paste\</item\>, or press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+V.\<br/\>The selected formula is replaced by the result.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	पाद-टिप्पणी या अंत-टिप्पणी प्रविष्ट करना व संपादित करना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145819				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>endnotes;inserting and editing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>inserting;footnotes/endnotes\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>deleting;footnotes\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>editing;footnotes/endnotes\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>organizing;footnotes\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>footnotes; inserting and editing\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145819				0	hi	\<variable id=\"footnote_usage\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/footnote_usage.xhp\" name=\"Inserting and Editing Footnotes or Endnotes\"\>Inserting and Editing Footnotes or Endnotes\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3154258				0	hi	Footnotes reference more information about a topic at the bottom of a page and endnotes reference information at the end of the document. $[officename] automatically numbers the footnotes and endnotes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155881				0	hi	To Insert a Footnote or Endnote				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3155903				0	hi	दस्तावेज़ में जहाँ आप नोट के एंकर को रखना चाहते हैं वहाँ क्लिक करें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3147120				0	hi	Choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04030000.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Footnote\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Footnote/Endnote\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150937				0	hi	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering\</item\> area, select the format that you want to use. If you select \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Character\</item\>, click the browse button (\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>...\</item\>) and select the character that you want to use for the footnote.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150508				0	hi	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> area, select \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Footnote\</item\> or \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Endnote\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150704				0	hi	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
