helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3148843				0	hi	\<image id=\"img_id3148857\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_insertfootnote.png\" width=\"0.222in\" height=\"0.222in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148857\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3153176				0	hi	You can also insert footnotes by clicking the \<emph\>Insert Footnote Directly\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155543				0	hi	To Edit a Footnote or Endnote				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150167				0	hi	The mouse pointer changes to a hand when you rest it over a footnote or endnote anchor in your document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3155563				0	hi	To edit the text of a footnote or endnote, click in the note, or click the anchor for the note in the text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3145029				0	hi	To change the format of a footnote, click in the footnote, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+T\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>F11\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> to open the Styles and Formatting window, right-click "Footnote" in the list, and then choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3145062				0	hi	To jump from the footnote or endnote text to the note anchor in the text, press PageUp.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3145081				0	hi	To edit the numbering properties of a footnote or endnote anchor, click in front of the anchor, and choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02150000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Footnote\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Footnote/Endnote\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3147776				0	hi	To change the formatting that $[officename] applies to footnotes and endnotes, choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/06080000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Footnotes\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Footnotes/Endnotes\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3147813				0	hi	To edit the properties of the text area for footnotes or endnotes, choose \<emph\>Format - Page\</emph\>, and then click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05040600.xhp\" name=\"Footnote\"\>\<emph\>Footnote\</emph\>\</link\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3147232				0	hi	पाद-टिप्पणियों को मिटाने के लिए, पाठ में पाद-टिप्पणी एंकर को मिटाएँ.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	Fine-Tuning the Word Completion for Text Documents				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148882				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>settings;word completion\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>word completion;settings\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text documents;word completion settings\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>weekdays; automatically completing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>months; automatically completing\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	hd_id4745017				0	hi	\<variable id=\"word_completion_adjust\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/word_completion_adjust.xhp\"\>Fine-Tuning the Word Completion for Text Documents\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_id4814294				0	hi	If you like it that $[officename] automatically completes the words that you frequently use, you can make further adjustments to refine that behavior. If you want, you can also save the current list of collected words so that it can be used in the next session.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_id2593462				0	hi	To fine-tune the word completion choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools – AutoCorrect Options - Word Completion\</item\> and select any of the following options:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN107C6				0	hi	To Insert an Additional Space Character				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B03				0	hi	Select \<emph\>Append space\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B0E				0	hi	स्वतःपूर्ण होने वाले शब्द का प्रथम अक्षर टाइप करने पर अगले शब्द के लिए एक स्पेस अक्षर जोड़ दिया जाएगा. इस स्पेस अक्षर को नहीं लिया जाएगा यदि अगला अक्षर डेलिमिटर होगा जैसे कि पूर्ण विराम या नए लाइन के लिए कैरेक्टर.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN107CC				0	hi	To Define the Accept Key				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B20				0	hi	Choose the key to accept the suggested word using the \<emph\>Accept with\</emph\> list box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN107D2				0	hi	To Select the Minimum Number of Characters				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B36				0	hi	Use the \<emph\>Min. word length\</emph\> box to set the minimum number of characters a word must have to be collected into the list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN107D8				0	hi	To Select the Scope of Collected Words				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B4C				0	hi	Disable the option \<emph\>When closing a document, remove the words collected from it from the list\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B53				0	hi	अब सूची अन्य दस्तावेज़ों के लिए भी वैध होगी जिन्हें आप खोलते हैं. जब आप अंतिम %PRODUCTNAME दस्तावेज़ बन्द करते हैं, शब्द सूची मिट जाती है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B56				0	hi	यदि आप चेकबक्से को नहीं चुनते हैं, सूची तब तक ही वैध रहेगी जब तक कि वर्तमान दस्तावेज़ खुला है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_id2634968				0	hi	यदि आप चाहते हैं कि आपकी शब्द सूची %PRODUCTNAME सत्र के बाद भी मौजूद रहे, इसे दस्तावेज़ के रूप में सहेजें जैसा कि निम्न खण्ड में दर्शाया गया है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN107DE				0	hi	To Use the Word List for Further Sessions				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B94				0	hi	यदि स्वचालित वर्तनीजाँचक विकल्प सक्षम किया जाता है, सिर्फ वे ही शब्द संग्रहित किए जाएंगे जिन्हें वर्तनीजाँच द्वारा पहचाना जाएगा.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10BA1				0	hi	वह शब्द सूची इस्तेमाल करें जो हमेशा ही तकनीकी शब्दों के पारिभाषित सेट के साथ शब्द पूर्णता विशेषता के लिए प्रारंभ हो.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10BA7				0	hi	उस पाठ दस्तावेज़ को खोलें जिसमें वे शब्द हैं जिनका इस्तेमाल आप शब्द पूर्णता के लिए  करना चाहते हैं. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10BAB				0	hi	शब्द पूर्ण करने वाली विशेषता शब्दों का संग्रह करती है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN107ED				0	hi	सूची में से सभी या कुछ शब्दों को चुनें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN107F4				0	hi	Use \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+C to copy all selected words into the clipboard. Paste the clipboard into a new document and save it to get a reference list of collected words.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10BC6				0	hi	बाद में आप संदर्भ सूची खोल सकते हैं तथा शब्दों को स्वचालित संग्रह कर सकते हैं, जिससे शब्द पूर्णता विशेषता को पारिभाषित शब्दों के साथ प्रारंभ हो सके.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10809				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040600.xhp\"\>Word Completion\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_id5458845				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/word_completion.xhp\"\>Using Word Completion\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cells.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	कुंजीपट के इस्तेमाल से पंक्ति या स्तम्भ जोड़ना या मिटाना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cells.xhp	0	help	bm_id3156377				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>rows; inserting/deleting in tables by keyboard\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>columns; inserting/deleting in tables by keyboard\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>tables; editing by keyboard\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>keyboard;adding or deleting rows/columns\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>splitting cells;by keyboard\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>merging;cells, by keyboard\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>deleting;rows/columns, by keyboard\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>inserting;rows/columns, by keyboard\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cells.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156377				0	hi	\<variable id=\"table_cells\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/table_cells.xhp\" name=\"Adding or Deleting a Row or Column to a Table Using the Keyboard\"\>Adding or Deleting a Row or Column to a Table Using the Keyboard\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id3149487				0	hi	You can add or delete rows or columns in tables as well as split or merge table cells using the keyboard.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id3155906				0	hi	To insert a new row in a table, place the cursor in a table cell, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Insert, and then press the up or down arrow key. You can also move the cursor to the last cell in the table, and then press Tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id3147412				0	hi	To insert a new column, place the cursor in a table cell, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Insert, and then press the left or right arrow key.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id3156096				0	hi	To split a table cell instead of adding a column, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Insert, and then hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> while you press the left or right arrow key.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id3153408				0	hi	To delete a row, place the cursor in a table cell, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Delete, and then press the up or down arrow key.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id3149626				0	hi	To delete a column, place the cursor in a table cell, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Delete, and then press the left or the right arrow key.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id3149612				0	hi	To merge a table into an adjacent cell, place the cursor in the cell, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Delete, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then press the left or the right arrow key.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	पाद-टिप्पणियाँ के बीच की दूरी				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147683				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>spacing; endnotes/footnotes\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>endnotes; spacing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>footnotes; spacing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>borders;for footnotes/endnotes\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>lines;footnotes/endnotes\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147683				0	hi	\<variable id=\"footnote_with_line\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/footnote_with_line.xhp\" name=\"Spacing Between Footnotes\"\>Spacing Between Footnotes\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3145808				0	hi	If you want to increase the spacing between footnote or endnote texts, you can add a top and bottom border to the corresponding paragraph style.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3155603				0	hi	पाद-टिप्पणी या अंत-टिप्पणी में क्लिक करें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3155620				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3154251				0	hi	Right-click the Paragraph Style that you want to modify, for example, "Footnote", and choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3155884				0	hi	Click the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030500.xhp\" name=\"Borders\"\>\<emph\>Borders\</emph\>\</link\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3147110				0	hi	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Default\</item\> area, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Set Top and Bottom Borders Only\</item\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150931				0	hi	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Line\</item\> area, click a line in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150961				0	hi	Select "White" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Color\</item\> box. If the background of the page is not white, select the color that best matches the background color.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150519				0	hi	In the \<emph\>Spacing to contents\</emph\> area, clear the \<emph\>Synchronize\</emph\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150709				0	hi	Enter a value in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Top\</item\> and \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Bottom\</item\> boxes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150740				0	hi	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3148846				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030500.xhp\" name=\"Format - Paragraph - Borders\"\>Format - Paragraph - Borders\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	शीर्षक इस्तेमाल करना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147691				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>inserting; captions\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>captions; inserting and editing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>editing;captions\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>objects; captioning\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>tables; labeling\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>frames; labeling\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>charts; labeling\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text frames; labeling\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>draw objects; inserting captions\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>legends, see also captions\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150537				0	hi	\<variable id=\"captions\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/captions.xhp\" name=\"Using Captions\"\>Using Captions\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3153156				0	hi	पाठ दस्तावेज़ों में, आप चित्रों, तालिकाओं तथा ड्राइंग वस्तुओं में लगातार क्रमांकित शीर्षक शामिल कर सकते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3153172				0	hi	आप विविध प्रकार के शीर्षकों के पाठ तथा संख्या दायरों को संपादित कर सकते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3153186				0	hi	When you add a caption to a picture or to an object, the object and the caption text are placed together in a new frame. When you add a caption to a table, the caption text is inserted as a paragraph next to the table. When you add a caption to a frame, the caption text is added to the text inside the frame, either before or after the existing text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_idN10713				0	hi	To move both the object and the caption, drag the frame that contains these items. To update the caption numbering after you move the frame, press F9.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155541				0	hi	To define a caption proceed as follows:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3155567				0	hi	Select the item that you want to add a caption to.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3155586				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Caption\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3147765				0	hi	Select the options that you want, and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>. If you want, you can also enter different text in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Category\</item\> box, for example \<item type=\"literal\"\>Figure\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3147254				0	hi	दस्तावेज़ में आप सीधे ही शीर्षक पाठों को संपादित कर सकते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3147271				0	hi	A caption is formatted with the paragraph style that matches the name of the caption category. For example, if you insert a "Table" caption, the "Table" paragraph style is applied to the caption text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3145671				0	hi	$[officename] can automatically add a caption when you insert an object, graphic, frame, or table. Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - AutoCaption\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	तालिकाओं में कक्षों के योगों की गणना करना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147400				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>calculating;sums in text tables\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>totals in text tables\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>tables;calculating sums\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>cells;calculating sums\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>table cells;calculating sums\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>sums of table cell series\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147400				0	hi	\<variable id=\"calculate_intable\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/calculate_intable.xhp\" name=\"Calculating Cell Totals in Tables\"\>Calculating the Sum of a Series of Table Cells\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	par_id3154243				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Table\</emph\>, and insert a table with one column and more than one row into a text document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	par_id3154203				0	hi	स्तम्भ के प्रत्येक कक्ष में संख्या टाइप करें, परंतु स्तम्भ के अंतिम कक्ष को रिक्त छोड़ दें.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	par_id3154222				0	hi	Place the cursor in the last cell of the column, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Sum\</item\> icon on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Table Bar\</item\>.\<br/\>The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formula Bar\</item\> appears with the entry "=sum".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	par_id3147775				0	hi	Click in the first cell of the series you want to sum up, drag to the final cell, and then release.\<br/\>$[officename] inserts a formula for calculating the sum of the values in the current column.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	par_id3150507	8			0	hi	Press Enter, or click \<emph\>Apply\</emph\> in the Formula bar. \<br/\>The sum of the values in the current column is entered in the cell.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	par_id3150533				0	hi	If you enter a different number anywhere in the column, the sum is updated as soon as you click in the last column cell.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	par_id3155533				0	hi	इसी प्रकार, आप संख्याओं की पंक्तियों के योग की गणना भी शीघ्रता से कर सकते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_dialog.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	किसी फ़ाइल से चित्र प्रविष्ट करना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_dialog.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154896				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>pictures; inserting by dialog\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>inserting; pictures, by dialog\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_dialog.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154896				0	hi	\<variable id=\"insert_graphic_dialog\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/insert_graphic_dialog.xhp\" name=\"Inserting a Graphic From a File\"\>Inserting a Graphic From a File\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3155914				0	hi	दस्तावेज़ पर वहाँ क्लिक करें जहाँ आप चित्र को प्रविष्ट करना चाहते हैं.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3155864				0	hi	Choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/04140000.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Picture - From File\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Picture - From File\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3156021				0	hi	Locate the graphic file that you want to insert, and then click \<emph\>Open\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3153396				0	hi	डिफ़ॉल्ट रूप में, प्रविष्ट किया गया चित्र जिस अनुच्छेद में आपने क्लिक किया है उसके ऊपर मध्य में रखा जाता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_beforetable.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	पृष्ठ के शीर्ष पर तालिका के पहले पाठ प्रविष्ट करना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_beforetable.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149688				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>tables;start/end of document\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>paragraphs;inserting before/after tables\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>inserting;paragraphs before/after tables\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_beforetable.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149688				0	hi	\<variable id=\"insert_beforetable\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/insert_beforetable.xhp\" name=\"Inserting Text Before a Table at the Top of Page\"\>Inserting Text Before a Table at the Top of Page\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_beforetable.xhp	0	help	par_id3155923				0	hi	If you want to insert text before a table that is at the top of a page, click in the first cell of the table, in front of any contents of that cell, and then press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Enter\</item\> or \<item type=\"keycode\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_beforetable.xhp	0	help	par_idN10612				0	hi	To insert text after a table at the end of the document, go to the last cell of the table and press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	Defining Background Colors or Background Graphics				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149346				0	hi	\<bookmark_value\>backgrounds;text objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>words;backgrounds\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>paragraphs; backgrounds\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>text;backgrounds\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>tables; backgrounds\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cells; backgrounds\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>backgrounds;selecting\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149346				0	hi	\<variable id=\"background\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/background.xhp\" name=\"Defining Background Colors or Background Graphics\"\>Defining Background Colors or Background Graphics\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id7355265				0	hi	You can define a background color or use a graphic as a background for various objects in $[officename] Writer.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147653				0	hi	To Apply a Background To Text Characters				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3150669				0	hi	Select the characters.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3155390				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Format - Character\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3153665				0	hi	Click the \<emph\>Background\</emph\> tab, select the background color.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153541				0	hi	To Apply a Background To a Paragraph				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3145119				0	hi	Place the cursor in the paragraph or select several paragraphs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3158430				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Format - Paragraph\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3151245				0	hi	On the \<emph\>Background\</emph\> tab page, select the background color or a background graphic.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id0104201010554939				0	hi	To select an object in the background, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key and click the object. Alternatively, use the Navigator to select the object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149294				0	hi	To Apply a Background To All or Part of a Table				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3154346				0	hi	Place the cursor in the table in your text document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3148664				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Table - Table Properties\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3154938				0	hi	On the \<emph\>Background\</emph\> tab page, select the background color or a background graphic.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3156280				0	hi	In the \<emph\>For\</emph\> box, choose whether the color or graphic should apply to the current cell, the current row or the whole table. If you select several cells or rows before opening the dialog, the change applies to the selection.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151041				0	hi	You may also use an icon to apply a background to table parts.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3150767				0	hi	To apply a background color to cells, select the cells and click the color on the \<emph\>Background Color\</emph\> toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3147084				0	hi	To apply a background color to a text paragraph within a cell, place the cursor into the text paragraph, then click the color on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Background Color\</item\> toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A56				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/02160000.xhp\"\>Highlighting icon\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
