helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3146345				0	hi	शर्त सही है यदि "x" पाई का गुणज है				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149846				0	hi	To use comparative operators with strings, the operands must be bounded by double quotation marks:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151078				0	hi	x == "ABC" or x EQ "ABC"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150162				0	hi	जाँचता है कि वेरिएबल "x" में  "ABC" स्ट्रिंग है (true), या नहीं (false) है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153301				0	hi	x == "" or x EQ ""				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156120				0	hi	or				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156133				0	hi	!x or NOT x				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156112				0	hi	जाँचें कि क्या वेरिएबल "x" में रिक्त वाक्यांश है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150097				0	hi	The "equal" comparative operator must be represented by two equal signs (==) in a condition. For example, if you define a variable "x" with the value of 1, you can enter the condition as x==1.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148791				0	hi	उपयोक्ता डाटा				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150028				0	hi	You can include user data when you define conditions. To change your user data, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - $[officename] - User data\</emph\>. User data must be entered in the form of strings. You can query the user data with "==" (EQ), "!=" (NEQ), or "!"(NOT).				20200411 15:09:53
