helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155373				0	hi	शर्त सही है यदि COMPANY क्षेत्र रिक्त नहीं है. (पहले उदाहरण में, कोई ऑपरेटर वांछित नहीं है.)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149977				0	hi	!डाटाबेस.तालिका.कंपनी				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149991				0	hi	डाटाबेस.तालिका.कंपनी				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150004				0	hi	डाटाबेस.तालिका.कंपनी EQ ""				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3146911				0	hi	डाटाबेस.तालिका.कंपनी ==""				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148733				0	hi	Returns TRUE if the COMPANY field is empty.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148762				0	hi	डाटाबेस.तालिका.कंपनी ==""				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153016				0	hi	डाटाबेस.तालिका.कंपनी NEQ ""				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153040				0	hi	Returns TRUE if the current entry in the COMPANY field is not "Sun". (Exclamation sign represents a logical NOT.)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154605				0	hi	डाटाबेस.तालिका.प्रथमनाम AND डाटाबेस.तालिका.नाम				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153059				0	hi	सही बताता है यदि रेकॉर्ड में प्रथम तथा अंतिम नाम होता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3159247				0	hi	Note the difference between the boolean NOT "!" and the comparative operator not equal "!=" (NEQ).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153876				0	hi	When you refer to a database field in a condition, use the form Databasename.Tablename.Fieldname. If one of the names contains a character that is an operator, such as a minus sign (-), enclose the name in square brackets, for example, Databasename.[Table-name].Fieldname. Never use spaces inside field names.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153891				0	hi	उदाहरण: रिक्त डाटाबेस क्षेत्र को छुपाना				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150051				0	hi	You may want to create a condition that hides an empty field, for example, if the COMPANY field is empty for some of the data records.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150067				0	hi	Select the \<emph\>Hidden Paragraph\</emph\> list entry, and type the following condition: Addressbook.Addresses.Company EQ ""				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147110				0	hi	or type the following				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147123				0	hi	NOT Addressbook.Addresses.Company				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147136				0	hi	If the COMPANY database field is empty, the condition is true and the paragraph is hidden.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150232				0	hi	To display hidden paragraphs on the screen, you can choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</emph\>, and clear the \<emph\>Fields: Hidden paragraphs\</emph\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145218				0	hi	क्षेत्र में शर्तों के उदाहरण				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145231				0	hi	The following examples use the Conditional text field, although they can be applied to any fields that can be linked to a condition. The syntax used for conditions is also used for the Hidden text, Hidden paragraph, Any record or Next record fields.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150311				0	hi	पृष्ठों की संख्या पर आधारित सशर्त पाठ को प्रदर्शित करने के लिए:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150333				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Functions\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147471				0	hi	In the \<emph\>Type\</emph\> list, click "Conditional text".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154294	63			0	hi	In the \<emph\>Condition \</emph\>box, type "page == 1".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154319				0	hi	In the \<emph\>Then\</emph\> box, type "There is only one page".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150640	65			0	hi	In the \<emph\>Or \</emph\>box, type "There are several pages".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153086				0	hi	Click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>, and then click \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155814				0	hi	उपयोक्ता-पारिभाषित वेरिएबल पर आधारित शर्तयुक्त पाठ दिखाने के लिए				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155836				0	hi	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Variables\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155109	68			0	hi	In the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>list, click "Set Variable".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008	139			0	hi	In the\<emph\> Name\</emph\> box, type "Profit".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147032	140			0	hi	In the\<emph\> Value\</emph\> box, type "5000".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152974				0	hi	Click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152998				0	hi	Click the \<emph\>Functions\</emph\> tab, and click "Conditional text" in the \<emph\>Type\</emph\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150952				0	hi	In the \<emph\>Condition\</emph\> box, type "Profit < 5000".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156291				0	hi	In the \<emph\>Then\</emph\> box, type "Target is not met".				20200411 15:09:53
