helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155587				0	hi	The first part of this example inserts a space between the "First Name" and "Last Name" fields in a document, and the second part inserts text based on the contents of a field. This example requires that an address data source is registered with $[officename].				20200411 15:09:53
