helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id090220080439090				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Lists the available field types. To add a field to your document, click a field type, click a field in the \<emph\>Select \</emph\>list, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3154196				0	hi	क्षेत्र प्रकार				20200411 15:09:53
