helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148386				0	hi	paragraph does not end with a punctuation mark				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150564				0	hi	empty paragraph above and below the paragraph				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149030				0	hi	AutoCorrect for Bullets / Numbering				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156316				0	hi	To create a bulleted list, type a hyphen (-), star (*), or plus sign (+), followed by a space or tab at the beginning of a paragraph.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150763	18			0	hi	To create a numbered list, type a number followed by a period (.), followed by a space or tab at the beginning of a paragraph. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147507				0	hi	Automatic numbering is only applied to paragraphs formatted with the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\>, \<emph\>Text body\</emph\> or \<emph\>Text body indent\</emph\> paragraph styles.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152941				0	hi	AutoCorrect for Separator Lines				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154105				0	hi	If you type three or more hyphens (---), underscores (___) or equal signs (===) on line and then press Enter, the paragraph is replaced by a horizontal line as wide as the page. The line is actually the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030500.xhp\" name=\"lower border\"\>lower border\</link\> of the preceding paragraph. The following rules apply:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153530				0	hi	तीन हायफन (-) से एकल  रेखा बनती है(0.05 पाइंट मोटाई, गेप 0.75 मिमी.).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154477				0	hi	तीन अंडरस्कोर (_) से एकल  रेखा बनती है(1 पाइंट मोटाई, गेप 0.75 मिमी.).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150982				0	hi	तीन बराबर के चिह्न (=) से एक दोहरी रेखा बनती है (1.10 पाइंट मोटाई, गेप 0.75 मिमी.).				20200411 15:09:53
