helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040501.xhp	0	help	par_id3148569				0	hi	खण्ड के लिए स्तम्भ की संख्या तथा स्तम्भ खाका निर्धारित करता है.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040501.xhp	0	help	par_id3151390				0	hi	खण्ड जहाँ प्रविष्ट किए जाएंगे, वहाँ वे पृष्ठ के पाठ प्रवाह व्यवहार का निर्वाह करेंगे.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040501.xhp	0	help	par_id3083448				0	hi	For example, if you insert a section that uses a two-column layout into a page style that uses a four-column layout, the two-column layout is nested inside one of the four columns.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040501.xhp	0	help	par_id3155625				0	hi	You can also nest sections, that is, you can insert a section into another section.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05100400.xhp	0	help	tit				0	hi	अरक्षित				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05100400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149052				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05100400.xhp\" name=\"Unprotect\"\>Unprotect\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05100400.xhp	0	help	par_id3083450				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:UnsetCellsReadOnly\"\>Removes the cell protection for all selected cells in the current table.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05100400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154558	3			0	hi	To remove the protection from several tables at once, select the tables, and then press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+T. To remove the protection from all of the tables in a document, click anywhere in the document, and then press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+T.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05100400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150765				0	hi	You can also remove cell protection from a table in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>Navigator\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
