helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155182				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_BREAK:RB_COL\"\>Inserts a manual column break (in a multiple column layout), and moves the text found to the right of the cursor to the beginning of the next \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05040500.xhp\" name=\"column\"\>column\</link\>. A manual column break is indicated by a nonprinting border at the top of the new column.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
