helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3154389				0	hi	Inserts a reference point in the document, after which the page count restarts. Select "on" to enable the reference point, and "off" to disable it. You can also enter an offset to start the page count at a different number.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3156267				0	hi	पृष्ठ वेरिएबल दिखाएँ				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3150588				0	hi	Displays the number of pages from the "Set page variable" reference point to this field.				20200411 15:09:53
