helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3151377				0	hi	Inserts a custom global variable. You can use the User Field to define a variable for a condition statement. When you change a User Field, all instances of the variable in the document are updated.				20200411 15:09:53
