helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mailmerge00.xhp	0	help	par_idN10559				0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Starts the Mail Merge Wizard to create form letters or send e-mail messages to many recipients.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mailmerge00.xhp	0	help	par_idN105CC				0	hi	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/mailmerge01.xhp\" name=\"Mail Merge Wizard - Starting document\"\>Mail Merge Wizard - Starting document\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
