helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155932	78			0	hi	To quickly reorder headings and their associated text in your document, select the "Headings" category in the list, and then click the\<emph\> Content View\</emph\> icon. Now you can use drag-and-drop to reorder contents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155381				0	hi	Set Reminder				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153011	14			0	hi	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click here to set a reminder at the current cursor position. You can define up to five reminders. To jump to a reminder, click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110100.xhp\" name=\"Navigation\"\>\<emph\>Navigation\</emph\>\</link\> icon, in the \<emph\>Navigation\</emph\> window click the \<emph\>Reminder\</emph\> icon, and then click the \<emph\>Previous\</emph\> or \<emph\>Next\</emph\> button.\</ahelp\>Click here to set a reminder at the current cursor position. You can define up to five reminders. To jump to a reminder, click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110100.xhp\" name=\"Navigation\"\>Navigation\</link\> icon, in the Navigation window click the Reminder icon, and then click the Previous or Next button.				20200411 15:09:53
