helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mailmerge03.xhp	0	help	par_idN10561				0	hi	The Mail Merge wizard opens to this page if you start the wizard in a text document that already contains address database fields. If the wizard opens directly to this page, the \<emph\>Select address list\</emph\> button is called \<emph\>Select different address list\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
