helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3149692				0	hi	DocInformation fields contain information about the properties of a document, such as the date a document was created. To view the properties of a document, choose \<emph\>File - Properties\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090004.xhp	0	help	par_id3148982				0	hi	When you export and import an HTML document containing DocInformation fields, \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090007.xhp#dokumentinfo\" name=\"special $[officename] formats\"\>special $[officename] formats\</link\> are used.				20200411 15:09:53
